<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">Dai-Chin: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF-8)</para>
  <para style="h">Mahte</para>
  <para style="toc1">MAHTEA Yuk Thangkdaw</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mahte</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mt</para>
  <para style="mt1">MAHTEA</para>
  <para style="mt2">Yuk Thangkdaw</para>
  <para style="imt">Pyenhlüma</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Mahtea yuk Thangkdaw</char> naw Jesuh cun khyütama kümceinak küikyan Bawi ni. Ani cun Cangcim kphyüma kcün üng a khyang hea veia a khyütama kümcei lawnak ni. Ahina thangkdaw hin Judah he ksunga hmi law lü a xüngseia phäh, Judah khyang mjü he phäh däk am ni lü, khawmdek vana phäha kyaki.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Mahte</char> naw Jesuha hminak law üng cutei lü Baptican a khannak, hlawhlepnak a khamnak, a ngthu pyen he, a jah mtheimkhawng he, ja Kalilea a jah mdawnak be naküt hnu ma ngdawih theikia a jah tak mi hmuki. Acun käna Jesuh Kalile üngka naw Jerusalema a kdungnak ja akpäihnaka pat, ami hnimnak ja a thawhnak be naküt a jah yuk päih.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ahina thangkdaw üng Pamhnama thum pi kpyahnak thei johit taki Saja Kdäm säih, Pamhnama Khawa mawng jah mtheimthangki cun Jesuh ni tilü ng'yuki. A jah mtheimthangnak üng aktunga mjü mhmaa mi hmuki: (1) Mcunga ngthu mthehnak cun: Xüngsei ning, pawhmsah vai mta he, dawkyanak ja Khankhaw Pe khyanga thawnnak theia phunkam am sängeiki (Chapter 5-7); (2) A hnukläk leinghngih he üng khut ami pawh vaia mawng a jah mthehnak (Chapter 10); (3) Khankhaw Pea mawng a msuimcäpnak he (Chapter 13); (4) Hnukläka thawnnaka mawng a jah mtheinak (Chapter 18); ja (5) akpäihnaka kcün a pha law vai ja Khankhaw Pea pha lawnak vaia mawng he (Chapters 24-25) cun ahina thangkdaw üng mi jah hmuki.</para>
  <para style="iot">Amawng Ktawi he</para>
  <para style="io1">Jesuh Khritawa ksawn ja a hminak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-2:23">1:1—2:23</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Baptican Johana Khut binak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">3:1-12</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jesuha Baptican khannak jah hlawhlepnak a khamnak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">3:13—4:11</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kalilea Jesuha khut pawhnak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-18:35">4:12—18:35</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kalile üngka naw Jerusalema a cehnak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-20:34">19:1—20:34</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Akpäihnaka khyün üng Jerusalem mlüh K'um ja a pipeia a awmih <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-27:66">21:1—27:66</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Bawipaa a thawhnak be ja a ngdangnak hü <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-20">28:1-20</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1"/>
  <para style="s">Bawi Jesuha ksawn</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Lk 3:23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1"/>Hin cun Davita capa, Abrahama capa, Jesuh Khritawa ksawn tähnak cajina kyaki. <verse eid="MAT 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2"/>Abrahama ca Isak, Isaka ca Jakop, acunüng Jakop naw Judah ja a bena he a jah canak. <verse eid="MAT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3"/>Judah naw Tamari am Pereh ja Sherah a jah canak, Pereh naw Heron ca na lü, acunüng Heron naw Ram a canak. <verse eid="MAT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4"/>Rama ca Aminadap, Aminadapa ca Nashon, Nashona ca Salmon. <verse eid="MAT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5"/>Salmon naw Rahap am Bozah a canak, Bozah naw Rutah am Obet a canak, Obet naw Jise a canak.<verse eid="MAT 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6"/>Jise naw Sangpuxang Davit a canak. Sangpuxang Davit naw Sangpuxang Solamon a canak, a nu cun Urijaa khyu Davit naw a khämbea kyaki. <verse eid="MAT 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7"/>Solamona ca Rehobawm, Rehobawma ca Abijah, Abijaha ca Asa. <verse eid="MAT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8"/>Asaa ca Jehosaphat, Jehosaphata ca Jehoram, Jehoram naw Usia a canak. <verse eid="MAT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9"/>Usiaa ca Jotham, Jothama ca Ahaz, Ahaza ca Hezakiha kyaki. <verse eid="MAT 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10"/>Hezakiha ca Manaseh, Manaseha ca Amon, Amona ca Josiah. <verse eid="MAT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:14">2Sang 24:14</ref>,<ref loc="2KI 24:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:10">2Khro 36:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 27:20">Jer 27:20</ref></char></note>Isarel he jah man u lü Babalunga ami jah cehpüi, acun k'um üng Josiah naw Jekhonih ja a bena he a jah canak.<verse eid="MAT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12"/>Babalunga ami jah cehpüi käna Jekhoniha ca Shaltilah, Shaltilaha ca Zerubabel. <verse eid="MAT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13"/>Zerubabela ca Abiud, Abiuda ca Eliakim, Eliakima ca Azora kyaki. <verse eid="MAT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14"/>Azora ca Zadok, Zadoka ca Achim, Achima ca Eliud. <verse eid="MAT 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15"/>Eliuda ca Elezar, Elezara ca Matthan, Matthana ca Jakopa kyaki. <verse eid="MAT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16"/>Acunüng Jakopa ca cun Josep, Mariha ceia kyaki, Marih cun Khritaw Mesijah ti Jesuha nua kyaki.<verse eid="MAT 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17"/>Abraham üngka naw Davit cäpa ksawn xaleikphyü lawki. Davit üngka naw Babalung mpya vaia ami jah cehpüi cäpa ksawn xaleikphyü lawki. Acunüng Babalung mpya üngka naw Messijah hmi law cäpa ksawn xaleikphyü lawki.<verse eid="MAT 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Khritawa hminak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Lk 2:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 1:27">Lk 1:27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jesuh Khritaw a hmi lawa mawng cun hikbaa kyaki. A nu Marih cun Josepa khyu vaia ami mkhyäp käna, atänga am ani awm ham üng, Marih cun Ngmüimkhya Ngcim naw a mpyaisak. <verse eid="MAT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19"/>A cei vaia Josep cun khyang ngsungpyuna kya lü, khyang he maa Marih cun am luthui hmaiset hlüsak lü, ampyua hawih be khaia büki. <verse eid="MAT 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20"/>Acunüngpi, acukba a ngaih k'um üng, a ngmang üng Bawipaa khankhawngsä ngdang vai lü, “Davita capa Josep, Marih na khyunak vai käh cäia. Isetiakyaküng a mpyai hin ta Ngmüimkhya Ngcima mpyaisak ni. <verse eid="MAT 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:31">Lk 1:31</ref></char></note>Ani cun kpamicaa ca khai, a khyang he ami mkhyekatnak üngkhyüh jah küikyan khaia kyase a ngming cun Jesuha na sui khai,” a ti.<verse eid="MAT 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22"/>Ahina mawng cun Bawipa naw Sahma he üngkhyüh a pyen khawi a kümnak vaia kyaki. <verse eid="MAT 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:14">Hesa 7:14</ref> (LXX)</char></note>Pamhnama ngthu ta, “Teng ua, nglamica mpyai law lü, cangpyang ca na law khai, a ngming cun Imanuelaha sui law khai he,” ti hlü ta, “Pamhnam cun mi hlawnga awmki,” tinaka kyaki.<verse eid="MAT 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24"/>Josep cun ip lü a let law üng, Bawipa khankhawngsä naw a pyena kba Marih a khyunak. <verse eid="MAT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:21">Lk 2:21</ref></char></note>Acunüngpi, Josep ja Marih cun Marih a camah veia alanga am ip khawi ni. Josep naw hnasena ngming cun Jesuha a sui.<verse eid="MAT 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2"/>
  <para style="s">Nghngilaw khyang ktheme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1"/>Sangpuxang Herod a Bawi kcün üng Jesuh cun Judah khaw Bethlehem mlüha hmi lawki. Acunüng nghngilawa ka khyang kthem he Jerusalem da lawki he. <verse eid="MAT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2"/>“Hawia ni Judahea Sangpuxang vai hmi lawki hnasen cun. Ania aisi nghngilaw da lut lawki hmu u lü sawkhah khaia kami lawki he ni” ami ti.<verse eid="MAT 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3"/>Sangpuxang Herod naw acun ngja üng cäicing pyangmaki. Jerusalem mlüha awmkia khyang he naküt pi cäicing hngaki he. <verse eid="MAT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4"/>Sangpuxang Herod naw, ktaiyü ngvai he ja thum mthei he jah mkhäm lü, “Khritaw hawia hmi khai ni?” ti lü a jah kthäh.<verse eid="MAT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5"/>Amimi naw, “Judah khaw, Bethlehema hmi khaia Sahma naw a yuk ni” ti lü ami pyen.<verse eid="MAT 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mik 5:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Judah hne Bethlehem mlüh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">Nang hin Judah mlühe üng na ngming ngthang khai ni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">Nang üngka naw Bawi ngtüi law khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">ani naw ka khyang Isarel he lam jah msüm khai.”<verse eid="MAT 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7"/>Acunüng, Herod naw khyang kthem he cun angmpyua jah khü lü, aisi angdang lawa kcün cun angsinga a jah kthäh. <verse eid="MAT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8"/>Acunüng, Herod naw Bethlehema jah tüih lü, “Cit u lü hnasen cun akdawa va sui ua. Nami hmuh üng na mtheh law be uki se, kei pi cit lü ka va sawkhah hnga khai” a ti.<verse eid="MAT 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9-10"/>Acunüng cit u lü, nghngilaw da ami hmuh kunga aisi cun hmu betüki he. Ami hmuh üng jekyai tawngki he. Aisi cun ami maa cit lü hnasena awmnaka ngdang a pha üng ngdüiki. <verse eid="MAT 2:9-10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11"/>Im k'uma va lut u lü hnasen ja a nu Marih ami jah hmuh üng ngdäng u lü, hnasen kpamica cun sawkhahki he. Acunkäna ami lawpüia khawhthem he jah nghmawng u lü xüi, Frankisen ja Mura ng'ui he jah peki he.<verse eid="MAT 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12"/>Acunkäna Sangpuxang Heroda awmnak lam da käh ami ceh be vaia, Pamhnam naw ami ngmang üng jah mtheh se, lam kce üng ami khyawngpe da cu cit beki he.<verse eid="MAT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Egypt pea ami dawngnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13"/>Acun he ami ceh be käna, Bawipaa khankhawngsä mat law lü, Josepa ngmang üng, “Tho law lü, hnasen ja a nu Egypt pea jah cenpüia, ka ning jah mtheh law be vei cäpa acuia awm u, isetiüng ta Herod naw hnasen hnim khaia sui hüki ni” ti lü a jah mtheh.<verse eid="MAT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14"/>Acuna mthan üng Josep cun tho law lü, naca ja a nu jah cehpüi lü Egypt pea dawngki. <verse eid="MAT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 11:1">Hos 11:1</ref></char></note>Sangpuxang Herod a thih vei cäpa acuia awmki he. Ahlana Bawipa naw sahma üng a pyen “Egypt pea ka ca ka khü be ni” ti lü awmki cen kümcei lawnak vaia phäh ni.<verse eid="MAT 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hnasen he ami jah hnim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16"/>Nghngilaw khyang kthem he naw mhleiki he ti Sangpuxang Herod naw a ksing law üng thüi law lü Bethlehem ja apeia awmki hnasen kpamica kum nghngiha kke üngka naküt a jah hnimsak. Acun cun khyang kthema veia a ksing aisi akcük a ngdang law üngkhyüh kum nghngih lawkia kya se, kum nghngih lawki Judah hnasen naküt a jah hnimsak.<verse eid="MAT 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17"/>Acukba sahma Jeramih naw ahlana a na pyen law küm lawki ni.<verse eid="MAT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:15">Jer 31:15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Ramah mlüha sünnak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">mbawikyahnak ngja ve u.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Rachel naw a ca kyahei ve;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">mhlawhmcah vai pi mah ve,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">a ca he thih päiha phäh ni” ti lü awmki.<verse eid="MAT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Egypt pe üngkhyüh law beki he</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19"/>Herod a thih käna Bawipa khankhawngsä mat Josepa ngmang üng ngdang vai lü, <verse eid="MAT 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20"/>“Tho law lü, hnasen ja a nu Isarel pea jah cehpüi bea, hnasen hnim hlüki he thih päng ve u” ti lü a jah mtheh. <verse eid="MAT 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21"/>Acunüng, Josep cun tho law lü hnasen ja a nu jah cehpüi lü Isarel khyawngpe da cit beki.<verse eid="MAT 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22"/>Acunüng, Sangpuxang Heroda capa Akhejah, a paa hnün üng Judah Bawia thawnki ni ti ngjak lü, Josep kyühei lü cit be damki. Pamhnam naw a ngmang üng a mtheha mäiha Kalile hneha cit lü acuia awmki. <verse eid="MAT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:24">Mk 1:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:39">Lk 2:39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:45">Jn 1:45</ref></char></note>Acunüng, Nazaret mlüha im sa lü awmki. Sahma he naw ami na pyen, “Ani cun Nazaret khyanga sui khai he” ti a kümcei lawnak ni.<verse eid="MAT 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3"/>
  <para style="s">Baptican Johana ngthu pyen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mk 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-8">Lk 3:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Jn 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1"/>Acun k'um üng Baptican Johan naw Judah khaw khawmkyang khawa law lü ngthu a pyen ta, <verse eid="MAT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:17">Mt 4:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:15">Mk 1:15</ref></char></note>“Nami mkhyekatnak üngka naw nghlat be hnüh ua. Isetiakyaküng Pamhnama khaw ng'et law ve” ti lü a pyen. <verse eid="MAT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Hesa 40:3</ref> (LXX)</char></note>Ahin va sahma Hesajah naw a pyen, khawmkyang khawa khyang mat, “Bawipa lam cun pyan u lü, a lam he cen jah ngsungsak ua” ti lü ngpyangki.<verse eid="MAT 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 1:8">2Sang 1:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Johan cun naw sanghngüksaüa mu am ami pyang kcu suisa lü, savun ksawmyüi vawp lü, mkhaü ja mawkpyawnga ka khawitui jah ei lü awmki. <verse eid="MAT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5"/>Jerusalem, Judah hne alum ja Jordan mliktui peia ka khyang he cun a veia cit u lü, <verse eid="MAT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6"/>Ami mkhyekatnak he jah phyah u se Jordan tui am Baptican a jah pet.<verse eid="MAT 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mt 12:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref></char>
    </note>Pharise he ja Saduke he a veia Baptican kham khaia lawki he a jah hmuh üng, “Nangmi kphyu he, Pamhnama mlungso lawnak vai üngkhyüh nami lät khaia u naw a ning jah mtheh ni?” <verse eid="MAT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8"/>Acunakyase, akcanga nami ngjut a ngsing vaia nami ngtheipai am mdan ua. <verse eid="MAT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:33">Jn 8:33</ref></char></note>Abraham cun kami pu ania phäh mkhyekatnak üngka naw nami lät khaia käh ngai kawm uki, “Ngai ua, ning jah mtheh veng, Pamhnam cun hina lunge pi Abrahama ca he vaia jah pyang khawhki ni.” <verse eid="MAT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:19">Mt 7:19</ref></char></note>Acunakyase, akdawa am ngtheiki thing naküt cun jah khyu lü mei üng jah mkhih vaia, xäi cun thing phunga msäm päng ni. <verse eid="MAT 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11"/>Nangmi nami ngjut vaia kei naw tui am baptican ka ning jah peki. Cunsepi ka hnua lawki mat awmki, ani cun keia kthaka hlüngtai bawki, kei cun ania khawdawkyüi sut khaia pi am ka nglawiki ni. Ani naw Ngmüimkhya Ngcim la mei am baptican ning jah pe khai. <verse eid="MAT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12"/>A hlawnga cang hjapnak vai kphya awmki ni, angtak he cun kheia jah ta lü, anghi he cun am thih theikia mei üng jah mkhih khai, a ti.<verse eid="MAT 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuha Baptican khamnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mk 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Lk 3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13"/>Acunüng, Jesuh cun Kalile üngkhyüh Johana veia baptican khan khaia Jordan mliktui da lawki. <verse eid="MAT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14"/>Cunsepi, Johan naw a na mah lü, “Kei va nanga veia Baptican ka khan khai sü, ivaia ka veia ksaia na lawki ni?” a ti.<verse eid="MAT 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15"/>Acunüng pi, Jesuh naw msang lü, <char style="wj">“Pamhnama ngjak hlü mi pawhkia kya lü ahikba kya se,”</char> ti se, Johan naw kcangnaki.<verse eid="MAT 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16"/>Baptican a khan päng ja, Jesuh tui üngka naw tho law beki. Acunüng khankhaw a vei da nghmawng law lü, Pamhnama Ngmüimkhya cun müma mäiha a khana ngaw law se Jesuh naw a hmuh. <verse eid="MAT 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Gen 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Sal 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Hesa 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">Mt 12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:5">17:5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mk 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">Lk 9:35</ref></char></note>Acunüng, khankhaw üngka naw kthai pha lawki ta, “Hin cun ka mhläkphyanak kcanga ka capa ni, ani cun angläta ka jenak ni,” tia kyaki.<verse eid="MAT 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4"/>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Hlawhlepnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mk 1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Lk 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 2:18">Heb 2:18</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 4:15">4:15</ref></char>
    </note>Acunüng Jesuh cun Khawyai naw a hlawhlep vaia Ngmüimkhya naw khawmkyang khawa a cehpüi. <verse eid="MAT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2"/>Jesuh cun khawmhnüp kphyükip la mthan kphyükip ei jeih se, a ei cawi lawki. <verse eid="MAT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3"/>Acunüng Khawyai cun a veia law lü, “Nang Pamhnama caa na kya kcang üng, hina lung he hin muka thawn law khai hea jah mtheha” a ti.<verse eid="MAT 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 8:3">Deut 8:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jesuh naw <char style="wj">“Khyang cun muk am xüngki am ni, cunüngpi Pamhnama ngthukhyü am va xüngki tia cangcim üng awmki”</char> ti lü a pyen.<verse eid="MAT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5"/>Acunkäna Khawyai naw Jesuh cun Jerusalem Mlüh Ngcim, a hlüngnak säih Temple khana cehpüi lü, <verse eid="MAT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11">Sal 91:11</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 91:12">12</ref></char></note>“Nang Pamhnama capa kcang na ni üng, ahin üngka naw kco lü</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">‘Pamhnam naw a khankhawngsä he jah mtheh khai ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">acun he naw ami kut am ning na man khaie ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">acunüng na khaw naw lung he am jah hne yah khai ni’” ti lü cangcim üng awmki ni a ti.<verse eid="MAT 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:16">Deut 6:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Na Bawipa Pamhnam ä na hlawhlep vai ti lü pi cangcim üng ng'yuki ni”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8"/>Acunkäna Khawyai naw Jesuh cun khawmcung k'hlüngnua khana cehpüi lü khawmdeka bawinak ja a hlüngtainak he cun a mhnüh. <verse eid="MAT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9"/>Khawyai naw, “Ngdäng lü na na sawkkhah üng ahin he avan ka ning pe khai,” a ti.<verse eid="MAT 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:13">Deut 6:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Satan akcea cita, na Pamhnam däk va sawkhah lü, ani däka khut va na pawh vai ti lü cangcim üng awmki” </char>a ti.<verse eid="MAT 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11"/>Acunkäna Khawyai naw ceh ta se, khankhawngsä he law u lü Jesuh cun kuei lawki he.<verse eid="MAT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Kalilea a Khut cuteiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mk 1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Lk 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 14:3">Mt 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mk 6:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19">Lk 3:19</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:20">20</ref></char>
    </note>Johan thawngim üng ami khyum a ngjak üng Jesuh cun Kalilea citki. <verse eid="MAT 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:12">Jn 2:12</ref></char></note>Nazaret khaw ceh ta lü Zebulung ja Naptalih hne, Kalile tuilinu pei Kapenawm mlüha awmki. <verse eid="MAT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14"/>Acun cun sahma Hesajah naw a na pyen a kümceinak vaia kyaki.<verse eid="MAT 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:1">Hesa 9:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 9:2">2</ref></char>
    </note>“Mliktui da lamki lam läka awmki;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">Zebulung khaw la Naptalih khaw, Jordan mliktui yea,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">khyang mjükce hea venak Kalile,<verse eid="MAT 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16"/>nghmüp k'uma awmki hea khyang he naw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">akvai hmu khaie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">Thihnak khaw nghmüp k'uma awmki hea khana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">akvai pha law khai ni” ti lü a pyen.<verse eid="MAT 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:2">Mt 3:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acun üngkhyüh tün lü Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ngjut ua, Khankhaw Pe ng'et law ve” </char> ti lü ngthu pyenki.<verse eid="MAT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Ngaksui Kphyü a jah khünak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mk 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Lk 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18"/>Jesuh Kalile tuili kama a ceh üng ngbengna xawi Sihmon (Pita ami ti) ja a na Andru ngaksui xawi, ng'üntui üng ngvai ani vawi k'um üng jah hmu lü, <verse eid="MAT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Na läk law nia, nga nani suia mäiha kei naw khyang ksui ning ka ning jah mthei khai ni”</char> a ti. <verse eid="MAT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20"/>Acunüng ani ngvai jah hawih hüt ni lü Jesuh läki xawi.<verse eid="MAT 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21"/>Acunkäna va cit betü lü ngbengna xawi Jakuk ja Johan, Zebedea ca xawi, ani pa mah am mlawng üng ani ngvai jah pyanei ni se jah hmu lü a jah khü. <verse eid="MAT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22"/>Acunüng akjanga ani mlawng ja ani pa jah hawih hüt ni lü Jesuh läki xawi.<verse eid="MAT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Mhnateiki a m'yai be</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Lk 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 9:35">Mt 9:35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:39">Mk 1:39</ref></char>
    </note>Jesuh cun Kalile pei avan üng cit hü lü, Sinakok k'uma jah mthei lü, Pamhnama Khawa thangkdaw jah mtheh lü am phetkiea natnak hlikhaü mjüküm üng khuikhaki he jah mdaw beki. <verse eid="MAT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24"/>Jesuh cun Siria hne abäng üng ngthang hü se, khyang kkun he, hlikhaü mjüküm naw a jah hui he, khawyaia a jah awmnak he, mcimpawm nawt lü ngtawng hüki he, akxo he a veia jah lawpüi u se a jah mdaw be. <verse eid="MAT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25"/>Kalile khaw üngka, Dekapoli khaw üngka, Jerusalem mlüh üngka, Judah khaw üngka, Jordan mliktui kam üngka, khyang khawhah naw Jesuha hnu läki he.<verse eid="MAT 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5"/>
  <para style="s">Mcunga A Ngthu pyen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1"/>Jesuh naw khyang pänu he a jah hmuh üng khawmcung khana cit lü ngaw se, axüisaw he a veia lawki he. <verse eid="MAT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2"/>Acunüng, a ngawhnak üngkhyüh hikba a jah mthei,<verse eid="MAT 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jekyainak Kcang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Lk 6:20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3"/>
    <char style="wj">Ngmüimkhya lama mpyaki he ta ami josen ve, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">
    <char style="wj">isetiüng ta Khankhaw Pe cun amimia phäh ni. </char><verse eid="MAT 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 61:2">Hesa 61:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Thüisei pukseki he ta ami josen ve, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">
    <char style="wj">isetiüng Pamhnam naw mlung üpnak jah pe khai. </char><verse eid="MAT 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 37:11">Sal 37:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Mlung mhnemki he ta ami josen ve, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:5">
    <char style="wj">isetiüng Pamhnama khyütam yahei khaie. </char><verse eid="MAT 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:1">Hesa 55:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 55:2">2</ref> </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Ngsungpyunnak eia cawi lü tuiha xaiki he ta ami josen ve, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">
    <char style="wj">isetiüng ami ngjak hlü kümbe law khai. </char><verse eid="MAT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7"/>
    <char style="wj">Khyang mpyeneinak taki he ta ami josen ve, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:7">
    <char style="wj">isetiüng Pamhnama mpyeneinak yah be khaie. </char><verse eid="MAT 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 24:3">Sal 24:3</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 24:4">4</ref> </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Ami mlungkaw ngcingcaihki he ta ami josen ve, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:8">
    <char style="wj">isetiüng Pamhnam hmu acun he.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9"/>
    <char style="wj">Dimdeihnak pyangki he ta ami josen ve, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">
    <char style="wj">isetiüng Pamhnam naw ka ca he tia jah khü khai. </char><verse eid="MAT 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 3:14">1Pit 3:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Pamhnama ngjak hlü ami bilawha phäh mkhuimkhanak khameiki he ta ami josen ve, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">
    <char style="wj">isetiüng Khankhaw Pe cun ami kaa kyaki.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 4:14">1Pit 4:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Ka hnukläka nami thawna phäh, khyang he naw ning jah mkhuimkha, ksekha na u lü ami ning jah mhleimhlakei üng ta jekyai ua.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">2Khro 36:16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:52">Ngs 7:52</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Isetiüng ta, khankhawa aphu nami yah vai khawhah awmki he kyase, jekyai lü xexawk na ua. Acukba bäa sahma he pi ahlana jah na mkhuimkha khawikie ni. </char><verse eid="MAT 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mci ja Akvai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mk 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Lk 14:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mk 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34">Lk 14:34</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 14:35">35</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Nangmi cun khawmdek khyang mjü naküta phäh, mcia nami kyaki. Acunüngpi mci a tuinak apäih üng i am tuisak be vai ni? Xawtin u lü khyang he naw ami khaw am ami leh sawxata thea ia am daw. </char><verse eid="MAT 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 8:12">Jn 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 9:5">9:5</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Nangmi cun khawmdek lum vaisaki akvaia nami kyaki he ni. Mcunga mdüiha mlühnu pi am ngthup thei. </char> <verse eid="MAT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:21">Mk 4:21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:16">Lk 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">11:33</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“U naw meiim dawn üng am khüp khawi, khukhawng khana va ta lü im k'um avan üng vai hü khaia tak khawia kyaki. </char> <verse eid="MAT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:12">1Pit 2:12</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Acuna kba ni, khyang hea maa nami vainak cun vaisak ua. Khyang he naw nami khut pawh ja nami awmih dawki ti hmu u lü, khana nami Pa mhlünmtai law khaie. </char><verse eid="MAT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Thum a jah Mtheinak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mosia Thum la Pamhnama sahma hea pyen jah nawt khaia ka lawkia ä ngai ua, acun he jah kümceisak khaia ka lawki ni. </char> <verse eid="MAT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 16:17">Lk 16:17</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Ngai ua, akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, khawmdek la khankhaw khyük ni lü pi Thum üngka canglung matca pi akümkawi kaa am khyük yah khai ni. </char> <verse eid="MAT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19"/><char style="wj">Acunakyase, au pi ahina ngthupet üngka matca pi am läklam lü jah mtheiki cun khankhawa akdik säiha kyak khai, cunüngpi läklam lü jah mtheiki cun khankhawa khyang k'hlüngtaia kyak khai. </char> <verse eid="MAT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20"/><char style="wj">Ka ning jah mtheh betüki ngai ua, Pharise he la thum mthei he kthaka nami ngsungpyun bawk üng ni khankhaw nami pha kawm. </char><verse eid="MAT 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mlunga Soa mawng Mtheinak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:13">Ex 20:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">Deut 5:17</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Ahlana ami pyen khawi cun, khyang käh nami hnim vai, au pi khyang hnimki cun ngthumkhyahnak kham khai” ami ti. </char> <verse eid="MAT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng pi tuh ka ning jah mthehki: a bena thüinaki cun ngthumkhyahnak khamei khai. Au pi a bena üng ia am mawngmei veki a ti üng, kawngci maa ngdüi khai. Acunüng na bena üng ak'yaw tinaki naküt cun am dim khawhkia Mulai meia cit khai. </char> <verse eid="MAT 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23"/><char style="wj">Acunakyase, Pamhnama kpyawngkunga khawthem pet vaia na lawpüi k'um üng, na bena naw am a ning jenak na süm üng ta, </char> <verse eid="MAT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24"/><char style="wj">Na lawpüia khawhthem cun kpyawngkunga hawih hüt lü, akcüka na bena veia cit lü va ng'yäppüi be maa. Acun käna law be lü na pet vaia khawhthem cun Pamhnam üng pe kawpi. </char><verse eid="MAT 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25"/>
    <char style="wj">Ning khya hlüki am lama nani ceh yüm üng angxita na ng'yäppüi vai. Am ani üng ta ngthumkhyah mkhawng üng ning kkhya se, acun he naw palik he üng ning ap se amimi naw thawngim üng ning khyum khaie ni. </char> <verse eid="MAT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26"/><char style="wj">Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, tangka na tak naküt üng am na ngthawng bea küt üng am lät be theiki. </char><verse eid="MAT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khyanga Khyu am Mkhyekia mawng Mtheinak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:14">Ex 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Deut 5:18</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Khyanga khyuca am käh nami mkhyekat vai ti nami ngja khawiki, </char> <verse eid="MAT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28"/><char style="wj">Kei naw ka ning jah mtheh hlü ta: au pi nghnumi mkhyekat hlünaka mlungmthin am tengki naküt cun a mlung k'uma mkhyekat pängki ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:9">Mt 18:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:47">Mk 9:47</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Acunakyase na kkhet mik naw a ning mkhyekatsak üng, kawihin lü xawtina. Isetiüng na pumsa avan küm se mulaia na ceha kdama ta na pumsa üngka mat khyük se na awm hin daw bawki ni. </char> <verse eid="MAT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:8">Mt 18:8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:43">Mk 9:43</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Na khet kut naw a ning mkhyekatsak üng, kyükin lü xawtin kawpi. Isetiüng na pumsa avan küm se mulaia na ceha kdama ta na pumsa üngka mat khyük se na awm hin daw bawki ni. </char><verse eid="MAT 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khyungla Ngtaia mawng Mtheinak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mt 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mk 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Lk 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 24:1-4">Deut 24:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:7">Mt 19:7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:4">Mk 10:4</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Acunkäna ami na pyen khawi nami ngjak khawi ta, “Aupi a khyu hawih lü ngtainaka kca yuk lü pe yah khai, ti lü Mosia thum üng awmki.” </char> <verse eid="MAT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mt 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11">Mk 10:11</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Lk 16:18</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10">1Kor 7:10</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 7:11">11</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Acunüng pi kei naw ka ning jah mtheh hlü ta: au pi a khyu kpami kcea dä am ipawm ni se akcea phäh hawihki cun a khyu mkhyekatsaki ni. Acuna thea acuna nghnumi khyu na beki pi mkhyekatkia kyaki ni. </char><verse eid="MAT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'yüncea mawng Mtheinak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:12">Lev 19:12</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 30:2">Num 30:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:21">Deut 23:21</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Na bekhüt käh na lümkan vai, Pamhnama veia bekhüt na taka mäiha na pawh vai” ti nami ngja khawiki. </char> <verse eid="MAT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:12">Jak 5:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 66:1">Hesa 66:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:22">Mt 23:22</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Cunüngpi kei naw ka ning jah mtheh hlü ta: khankhaw be lü käh nami ng'yünce süm vai. Isetiüng khankhaw cun Mhnama a bawi ngawhnaka kyaki. </char> <verse eid="MAT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1">Hesa 66:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 48:2">Sal 48:2</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Khawmdek pi be lü käh nami ng'yünce vai. Isetiüng khawmdek cun Pamhnama khaw taknaka kyaki. Jerusalem be u lü pi käh nami ng'yünce vai. Isetiüng Jerusalem cun Sangpuxang Bawia mlüha kyaki. </char> <verse eid="MAT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36"/><char style="wj">Na lu be lü käh na ng'yünce vai. Isetiüng na lusam matca pi abawk ja alea am pyang khawhki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37"/><char style="wj">Acunakyase ‘Ä’ am ani üng ‘Ka’ nami ti vai. Ahina thea nami pyen cun khawyaiksea a ning jah pyensaka kyaki. </char><verse eid="MAT 5:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Thungei bea mawng Mtheinak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Lk 6:29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:38: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 21:24">Ex 21:24</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:20">Lev 24:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:21">Deut 19:21</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Mik vanga phäh mik vang, ha mata phäh ha mat phusui vai ti nami ngja khawiki. </char> <verse eid="MAT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39"/><char style="wj">Acunüngpi kei naw ka ning jah mtheh hlü ta: ning jah mkhyekatnaki käh thungei be ua. Nami khet ngbeng ning jah kbeiki üng nami kcawng ngbeng pi jah säng petsih vai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40"/><char style="wj">Khyang mat naw nami kcu ning jah hut hlü lü junga a ning jah ngcuhpüi üng ta, na jih pi na petsih vai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41"/><char style="wj">“Khyang naw mäng mat a phüih a ning phüih hlüsak üng ta, mäng nghngih na phüih pet vai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42"/><char style="wj">“Nami ka ning jah täeiki üng nami pet vai. Acunüng nami veia pu hlüki a awm üng nami kpu vai. </char><verse eid="MAT 5:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ye mhläkphyanak vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Lk 6:27-28</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:43: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Na püi mhläkphya na lü na ye na hneng vai ti nami ngja khawiki.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44"/><char style="wj">Acunüng pi kei naw ka ning jah mtheh hlü ta: na ye na mhläkphyanak vai, ning mkhuimkhaki ktaiyü pea. </char> <verse eid="MAT 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45"/><char style="wj">Acunüng ta khankhawa ka nami pa Pamhnama ca hea nami kya khai. Isetiüng Pamhnam naw khyang kse he ja khyang kdaw hea khana khawhngi angteha sosak lü, khyang ngsungpyun ja am ngsungpyunki hea khana pi khaw angteha aksaki ni. </char> <verse eid="MAT 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46"/><char style="wj">Ning jah mhläkphyanaki däk nami mhläkphyanak be üng ta aphu i nami yah khai ni? Akhawn mkhäm he naw pi acukba ta pawh khawhki he ni? </char> <verse eid="MAT 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47"/><char style="wj">Na püi he däk am na ngthuminei üng khyang kce he kthaka i na pawhki ni? Pamhnam am ksingki he naw pi acukba ta am pawh khawhki he aw?</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:2">Lev 19:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:13">Deut 18:13</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Acunakyase, nami pa khana ka a kümkawia mäiha nangmi pi kümkawi ua.” </char><verse eid="MAT 5:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6"/>
  <para style="s">Petmsawtnaka mawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 23:5">Mt 23:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Khyang hea maa, khyang he hmuha käh nami petmsawt vai. Khyanga hmuha nami bilawh üng ta khana ka nami pa naw aphu ning jah pe khaia am kya. </char> <verse eid="MAT 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2"/><char style="wj">Acunakyase msih mpyaki he üng nami jah petmsawt üng angdang käh nami pet vai. Ngpumim ja lama khyanga jah hmuh hmuha khyanga jah mhlünmtai vai hlawheikie hypocrite kba käh nami pawh vai. Ka ning jah mthehki, acun he cun ami ngkhengnak yah pängki he ni. </char> <verse eid="MAT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3"/><char style="wj">Cunüngpi na petmsawt üng na kut vang naw a pet cen na kut vang naw käh ksing se.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4"/><char style="wj">Na petmsawt üng anghmüa nami petmsawt vai. Acunüng, angthupa ka pi hmuh theiki nami pa naw angdanga ning jah kheng khai.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ktaiyünaka mawng Mtheinak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Lk 11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 18:10-14">Lk 18:10-14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Nami ktaiyü üng hypocritea kba käh ktaiyü ua! Amimi cun naw Sinakok ja lam kyuma khyanga hmuh vaia ngdüi hü u lü ktaiyüki he ni. Ka ning jah mthehki, acun he cun naw ngkhengnak yah pängki he ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6"/><char style="wj">Acunüngpi, na ktaiyü üng na im k'um ahinaka lut lü ksawh na khaih käna, ahawia pi ve lü am hmuh theia na Pamhnama veia na ktaiyü üng ning pe khai.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7"/>Nami ktaiyü üng am jumeikia khyang he naw ami pyen kce ami pyen be bea kba käh nami ktaiyü vai. Ami ktaiyü a saüa phäh ami mhname naw jah ngjak khaia ngaieikie. <verse eid="MAT 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8"/>Acun he mäiha käh nami ve vai. Isetiüng ta i nami hlüki ti cun nami pa naw am nami tä ham üng a ksing päng ni. <verse eid="MAT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9"/>Acunakyase, hikba nami ktaiyü vai:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">
    <char style="wj">Khana vekia kami pa, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:9">
    <char style="wj">na ngming ngcim naw leisawngnak yah se. </char><verse eid="MAT 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10"/>
    <char style="wj">Na khaw pha law se; </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">
    <char style="wj">Na hlüei khankhawa ami pawha kba khawmdeka pi pawh u se.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11"/>
    <char style="wj">Tuhngawi kami ei khyawh vai ei jah pe bä. </char><verse eid="MAT 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12"/>
    <char style="wj">Kami khana mkhyekatki he kami jah mhläta kba, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:12">
    <char style="wj">kami mkhyekatnak pi jah mhlät bä. </char><verse eid="MAT 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13"/>
    <char style="wj">Mkhyekat vaia hlawhlepnaka käh jah cehpüi lü, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">
    <char style="wj">Khawyaipaa kut üngkhyüh pi jah yung kawpi.</char> <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:13: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akcea cangcime naw ta am yuk sih u.</char></note><char style="wj">Khaw ni, johit ja hlüngtainak he cun na kaa kya se. Amen.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14"/>
    <char style="wj">Khyang hea ami ning jah mkhyekatnak nami jah mhlät üng khankhawa ka nami pa naw pi nangmia mkhyekatnak pi ning jah mhlät khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15"/><char style="wj">Acunüng pi khyang hea ami mkhyekatnak am nami jah mhlät üng, khana ka nami pa naw pi nami mkhyenak am ning jah mhlät khaia kyaki. </char><verse eid="MAT 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ei Jeiha mawng Mtheinak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16"/>
    <char style="wj">Ei nami jeih üng hypocrit hea kba pukseki hea mäiha nami hmai käh nami tak vai. Khyang he naw ei jeihki he ti ami jah ksing vaia ami hmai hngasaki he ni. Akcanga ka ning jah mtheh hlüki. Acun he cun ami ngkhengnak yah pängki he ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17"/><char style="wj">Ei nami jeih üng nami lu ksi am hluk u lü mthik lü nami hmaiei vai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18"/><char style="wj">Acunüng, khyang he naw ei nami jeih am ksing u. Nami pa angthupnaka ve lü angthup hmuh theiki däk naw angdanga ning jah khyeng khai. </char><verse eid="MAT 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khankhawa Bawimangnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Lk 12:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 5:2">Jak 5:2</ref>,<ref loc="JAS 5:3">3</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Mthiek ja mkhyaa ei thei ja, mpyukei hea kpyeh thei, khawmdek khana khawhthem käh mcun ua.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20"/><char style="wj">Mthiek ja mkhyaa am a ei thei ja mpyukei hea am ami kpyeh thei khankhaw khawh mcun ua.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21"/><char style="wj">Isetiüng ta, khawhthem nami taknaka nami mlungmthin, nami ngainak ve khaia kyaki. </char><verse eid="MAT 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mik cun Pumsaa Kvai ni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Lk 11:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22"/>
    <char style="wj">Mik cun pumsa akvai ni. Acunakyase na mik a daw üng, na pumsa avan vai khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23"/><char style="wj">Acunüng pi, na mik a mü üng ta na pumsa avan nghmüp päihki ni. Acunakyase, na pumsa k'uma veki akvai hin anghmüp ani üng ihlawka kyühkse khai aw? </char><verse eid="MAT 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pamhnam ja Khawhthem</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Lk 16:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">12:22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24"/>
    <char style="wj">U naw pi bawi nghngiha khut am pawh khawh. Bawi mat kphya na lü; bawi mat hneng khai. Am ani üng mata pyen ngai lü, mat ksekha na khai. Nangmi pi Pamhnam ja ngui xüi ani nghngiha khut am jah mkhyawp khawh uki. </char><verse eid="MAT 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25"/>
    <char style="wj">Acunakyase, ka ning jah mtheh hlü ta, i ka ei khai, i ka aw khai, i ka suisak khai ti lü nami pumsaa phäh käh cäicing ua. Sak hin eiawka kthaka am phumah bawki aw? Pumsa hin suisaka kthaka am phumah bawki aw?</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26"/><char style="wj">Khana kha he jah teng ua: mci am saw u, cang am at u, kheia pi am mcunei u. Cunüngpi nami pa khana ka naw jah mcahki ni! Kha hea kthak nami phumah bawkie am niki aw?</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27"/><char style="wj">Acun he nami cäicingnaka phäh a khawkum apica saü</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a dung saü lawki veki aw?</char></note><char style="wj">lawki veki aw?</char><verse eid="MAT 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28"/>
    <char style="wj">Acunakyase, ivaia suisaka phäha nami cäicingki he ni? Mawkpyawnga ka he lili khyeipai he cen jah teng süm ua, ami suisak vai am khüi na u, nghmüi pi am bi u.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:4-7">1Sang 10:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:3-6">2Khro 9:3-6</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Ka ning jah mthehki, Sangpuxang Solamona a khawhkhyam naküt naw khyeipai matcaa ngtongtai pi am kpha.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30"/><char style="wj">Nami jumnak ngceki he aw, tuhngawi xüng lü angawi üng thikia khyeipai he pi Pamhnam naw a jah ngtongtaisak üng ta, acuna kthaka daw bawkia ning jah msuimsak khai ni. </char><verse eid="MAT 6:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31"/>
    <char style="wj">Acunakyase, i kami ei khai, i kami aw khai, i kami suisak khai? ti lü ä cäicing ua.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32"/><char style="wj">(Ahin he cun Pamhnam am ksingki he naw ni ami suihjap khawi.) Nangmi cun khana ka nami pa naw nami hlükaw naküt cun ksingki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33"/><char style="wj">Akcüka Pamhnama khaw ja a hlüei sui ma ua, acun käna ahin he avan ning jah pe khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34"/><char style="wj">Acunakyase, khawngawia phäha käh cäicing ua, khawngawi amäta phäh cäicingei khai ni. Tuhngawi na cäicingnak hin tuhngawia phäha khäk ve. </char><verse eid="MAT 6:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7"/>
  <para style="s">Khyang Ngthumkhyahnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37">Lk 6:37</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:38">38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:41-48">41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 4:24">Mk 4:24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Pamhnama ngthumkhyahnak üngka naw nami lät vaia khyanga lei käh nami mtai vai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2"/><char style="wj">Khyang nami mtainak am khyang naw ning jah mtai be lü, khyang nami mcäpnak am khyang naw ning jah mcäp pet be khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3"/><char style="wj">Ivaia na mik üng cungbäng veki am hmuhei lü, na püia mik üngka mikbengca na hmuh petki ni?</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4"/><char style="wj">Ihawkba na mik üng cungbäng am hmuhei lü, na püi üng “Na mik ek ning lawh pe vang” na tiki ni?</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5"/><char style="wj">Hypocrite aw, akcüka na mik üngka cungbäng loei maki lü, acunkäna na püia mik ek na lawh pet vaia angtea na hmuh khai. </char><verse eid="MAT 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6"/>
    <char style="wj">Ui am angcimcaih käh nami pet vai, nghlat lü ning jah cui khaie. Pale Lunge vawk üng käh nami jah pet vai, ami kainaka thea ning jah nghlatsih u lü ning jah cui khaie ni. </char><verse eid="MAT 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Täa, Suia, Khawka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Lk 11:9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7"/>
    <char style="wj">Tä ua nami yah khai; sui ua nami hmuh khai; ksawh khawk ua, ning jah nghmawn pet khai ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8"/><char style="wj">Au pi täki naw yahki, suiki naw hmuki, ksawh khawki üng nghmawn pet khai ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9"/><char style="wj">Nangmi üng a ca naw muk tä se lung pe khai u veki ni?</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10"/><char style="wj">Nami ca naw nga tä se kphyu pe khai u veki ni?</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11"/><char style="wj">Nangmi khyang ksee naw pi nami ca üng akdaw pet vai nami ksing üng, nami pa khana ka naw täki üng nangmia kthaka dawki pe khai aw? </char><verse eid="MAT 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 6:31">Lk 6:31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Namimäta khana khyang naw a pawh vai nami ngjak hlüa mäiha, namimät naw pi khyanga khana nami pawh vai. Acun cun Mosia thum ja sahma he naw jah mtheh pängki he ni. </char><verse eid="MAT 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lam Kdik ja Lam Ngkaü</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Lk 13:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13"/>
    <char style="wj">Mkawt kdik üng lut ua, isetiüng ta mulaia cehnak lam cun ngbaü lü ceh pi jäkia kyase khyang khawkäna cehnak lam ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14"/><char style="wj">Mkawt kdik cun khak lü, xünnaka lama kya se, cetkia khyang ngcekie. </char><verse eid="MAT 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Thing ja Akthei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Lk 6:43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15"/>
    <char style="wj">Pamhnama sahma mäiha nghmüneikie nami jah yeteinak vai, toa vun büng u lü, nami veia law kyawkie, ak'uma mhngea kyaki he.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16"/><char style="wj">Acun he cun ami ngtheipai am nami jah ksing khai. Nghling thing capyita ngthei khawiki aw? Nghling thing üng fik ngthei khawiki aw?</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17"/><char style="wj">Acuna mäiha thing kdaw naküt naw kthei kdaw ktheih na lü, thing kse naküt naw kthei ksea ngtheiki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18"/><char style="wj">Thing kdaw cun ktheih ksea am ngthei, thing kse naw pi ktheih kdaw am kthei na khawi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:10">Mt 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:9">Lk 3:9</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Aktheih am dawki thing naküt cun khyu u lü, mei üng ami xawtin khawi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:33">Mt 12:33</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Acunakyase, sahma ksee cun ami kthei am nami jah ksing khai. </char><verse eid="MAT 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Am ning jah Ksing khawi ngü</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Lk 13:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21"/>
    <char style="wj">Bawipa, Bawipa ti lü na khüki naküt khankhaw pha khaie am ni, ka pa khana kaa hlüei pawhki va khankhaw pha khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22"/><char style="wj">Ngthumkhyahnaka mhnüp üng, “Bawipa, Bawipa, na ngming üng Pamhnam ngthu pyen lü, na ngming üng khawyame jah ksät lü, müncanksee kami jah pawhki am niki aw? ti law khaie.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 6:8">Sal 6:8</ref> </char></note><char style="wj">Acunüng kei naw, “Nangmi am ning jah ksing khawi nawng, khyang ksee, ka vei üngka naw cit ua” ka ti khai. </char><verse eid="MAT 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Imksa Nghngih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Lk 6:47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24"/>
    <char style="wj">Acunakyase, au pi ka pyen ngja lü ka pyena mäiha veki cun lunga khana im saki khyang kthem üng tängki ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25"/><char style="wj">Khaw a law lü tui däm law sepi, khawkhi naw buh law lü pi, isüm am kyu. Isetiüng ta lunga khana saka kyase am kyu thei. </char><verse eid="MAT 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26"/>
    <char style="wj">Cunüngpi ka jah pyene jah ngja lü ka pyena mäiha am veki cun mdiha khana im sakia khyang nghmawng üng tängki ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27"/><char style="wj">Khaw ngkyawi law lü, tui kdäm naw ceh khai, khawkhi naw buk law se mdiha khana im cun kyu lü pyüpye theiki ni. </char><verse eid="MAT 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuha Khyaihbahnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 1:22">Mk 1:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:32">Lk 4:32</ref></char>
    </note>Jesuh naw acukba a pyen käna khyangpäe naw a jah mtheimthang cun müncan na lawki he. <verse eid="MAT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29"/>Isetiüng ta, Jesuh cun thum mthei hea mäih am ni, khyaihbahnak takia mäiha a jah mtheimthanga phäha kyaki.<verse eid="MAT 7:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8"/>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Mnehkse mnehki a mdaw be</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mk 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Lk 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1"/>Jesuh mcunga khyüh a kyum law be üng khyangpänue naw läk lawki he. <verse eid="MAT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2"/>Acunüng, mnehkse mnehki mat naw Jesuha vei law lü, “Bawipa aw, na hlüei üng ta na ngcimcaihsak bea” ti lü a pyen.<verse eid="MAT 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3"/>Jesuh naw a kut am do lü hnetki naw, <char style="wj">“Ka hlüeiki ni, ngcim se”</char> a ti ja a mnehkse cun daw beki. <verse eid="MAT 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Lev 14:1-32</ref></char></note>Acunkäna Jesuh naw mtheh lü, <char style="wj">“U üng pi käh mtheh bä, cet ktäi lü ktaiyü üng na pumsa va mhnuha. Khyang hea ksing law vaia Mosia thuma kba ngkengtaihnak na pawh vai” </char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Romah Ngvaia Mpya Jesuh naw a mdaw be</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Lk 7:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5"/>Jesuh Kapenawm mlüha a vang üng, yekap ngvai mat law lü Jesuh nghui naki naw, <verse eid="MAT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6"/>“Bawipa aw, ka mpya kun lü ima thih law hlü ngsai lü ngjän ve” ti lü a nghuinak.<verse eid="MAT 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Law lü ka mdaw law be khai ni”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8"/>Yekap ngvai naw, “Bawipa aw, na lawnak vaia ka im am nglawingkawih naw. Ngthu mkhap matca na pyen üng ka mpya daw be khai ni. <verse eid="MAT 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9"/>Angvai säiha kea ka veki ni. Keia kea pi yekap khawhah veki. Mat üng cita ka ti üng, cit lü; mat betü lawa ka ti üng, lawki, ka mpya mat “Hin pawha” ka ti üng, pawhki ni.<verse eid="MAT 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10"/>Jesuh naw acun a ngjak üng mküiei law lü axüisaw hea üng, <char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, ahikba sena jumnak ta Isarele üng pi am hmuh khawi nawng” a ti.</char> <verse eid="MAT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 13:29">Lk 13:29</ref> </char></note><char style="wj">Ka ning jah mtheh hlüki, nghngilaw ja khawkyaka kae khawkän law hü u lü Abraham, Isak ja, Jakop am alanga Khankhaw Pe pawia ngaw yüm khaie ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:13">Mt 22:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25:30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:28">Lk 13:28</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Acunüngpi Khawmahe ta kpunga anghmüpnaka jah xawt u se, acuia mni cui ha kyet üng kyap khaie.</char> <verse eid="MAT 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13"/>Acunkäna Jesuh naw yekap ngvai üng <char style="wj">“Na ima cit bea, na jumeia mäiha thawn se”</char> a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 8:13">Acuna kcün bäbä üng a mpya cun yai beki.<verse eid="MAT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Khyang Khawhah mdaw beki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mk 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Lk 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14"/>Acunkäna Jesuh Pitaa ima law lü, Pitaa khyua nu mhnat lü ngjän se a hmuh. <verse eid="MAT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15"/>Jesuh naw Pita a pi cun a kut üng hnet se mhnat naw a khyah. Acun ja Pitaa pi naw tho law lü a jah khinnak.<verse eid="MAT 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16"/>Khawmü lama khyang he khawyai naw a jah venake khawhah Jesuha veia jah lawpüi u se Jesuh naw ngmüimkhya ksee cun ngthu mkhap mat am jah ksät lü, am phetkie pi avan a jah mdaw be. <verse eid="MAT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:4">Hesa 53:4</ref></char></note>Acun cun sahma Hesajah naw ahlana a na pyen, “Amät naw mi mhnatnake jah lawh pe lü, mi hlikhaü naküt jah phüih pe ve” ti a kümnak vaia kyaki.<verse eid="MAT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuha hnu läk khai bükia Khyang he</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Lk 9:57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18"/>Jesuh naw a peia khyang khawhah a jah hmuh üng, tuili caye kama va pek khai hea a jah mtheh. <verse eid="MAT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19"/>Thum mthei mat a veia law lü, “Saja aw, na cehnak naküta ka ning läk khai” a ti.<verse eid="MAT 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Sauie naw khui taki he, khana khae naw pi ngbu taki he. Cunsepi khyanga capa naw ta a hüieinak vai hnün am ve ve”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21"/>Axüisawe üngka mat naw, “Bawipa aw, cit be lü ka pa va k'ut ma vang” a ti.<verse eid="MAT 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Na läk lawa, akthie naw akthi k'ut u se”</char> ti lü a mtheh.<verse eid="MAT 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Khawkhi a Ngdümsak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mk 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Lk 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23"/>Jesuh mlawnga khana a kai üng, axüisaw he ahlawnga cit hngakie. <verse eid="MAT 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24"/>Tuilia khawkhi ksenu khi law lü, mlawng tui üng lut law hlüki. Acunüngpi Jesuh ta ipeiki. <verse eid="MAT 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25"/>Axüisawe a vei law u lü, “Bawipa aw, ngcum law hlü ve u üng jah yung lawa,” ti lü, ami mhlet.<verse eid="MAT 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Aw, jumeinak ngcekia khyang he aw, ivaia nami kyükyawkie ni?”</char> a ti. Acunkäna tho law lü khawkhi ja tuingnawk cun hüp khai xawia jah mtheh se, dipki xawi.<verse eid="MAT 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27"/>“Khawkhi ja tuingnawk naw pi a pyen ngjaki xawi ta ia khyang ni? ti lü avan müncan tawngkie.<verse eid="MAT 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw khyang nghngih üngka Khawyai a ksät</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mk 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Lk 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28"/>Jesuh tuilia caye Kadaja hnea a law üng, khawyai naw a jah umnak khyang nghngih cun jah kyüh u lü, u naw pi am a cehnak data lam, lungdü üngka naw acuna khyang nghngih cun thäng law ni se a jah khyum. <verse eid="MAT 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29"/>Acun xawi naw, “Keini üng i na hlüeiki, Pamhnama capa aw? Akcün am pha ham se na jah mkhuimkha khaia na lawki aw?” ti lü ngpyangki xawi.<verse eid="MAT 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30"/>Acuna peia vawke ngsuieikie awmki he. <verse eid="MAT 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31"/>Yaie naw Jesuh aw, “Keimi na jah ksät a ni üng pi vawkea k'uma bä jah tüiha” ti lü nghuikie.<verse eid="MAT 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Cit ua”</char> ti se, yaie cun lut law u lü, vawkea k’uma lutkie. Acunüng vawke avan xema ngtäng lü tui üng ngcum lü, thih päihkie.<verse eid="MAT 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33"/>Vawk mcahkie naw mlüh k'uma dawng u lü yaia a umnaka khyang nghngih ja vawkea thiha mawng avan cun ami va pyen. <verse eid="MAT 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34"/>Acunüng mlüh üng veki avan Jesuh hmuh khaia law u lü, Jesuh ami hmuh üng ami khaw ceh ta lü akcea cit khaia nghuinakie.<verse eid="MAT 8:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9"/>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw a kut khaw Xoki a mdaw be</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mk 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Lk 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1"/>Jesuh cun mlawnga khana kai lü, Kalile tuili leh pah lü a venak Kapenawm mlüha cit beki. <verse eid="MAT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2"/>Acuia a kut khaw xoki khyang mat cun kyäp üng a ngjännak üng Jesuha veia ami kawh law. Jesuh naw ami jumnak hmuh lü, <char style="wj">“Ka ca aw, käh ng'äa, na mkhyekatnake cun mhlät päng ni,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3"/>Acunüng thum mthei he akhäk naw ami mlung k’uma, “Hin naw Pamhnam ksekha na ve” ti lü ngaikie.<verse eid="MAT 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4"/>Acunüng pi Jesuh naw ami mlung k’uma ami ngaih jah ksing lü, <char style="wj">“Ivai am dawkia nami ngaikie ni?”</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5"/>A kut khaw xoki üng, <char style="wj">“Na mkhyekatnake cun mhlät päng ni, ti mä ajä?</char> am ani üng <char style="wj">“Tho law lü cita” ti mä ajä?”</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6"/>Khyanga capa naw khawmdek khana mkhyekatnake jah mhlätnaka johit taki ti nami ksing vaia, ti lü, akxo üng, <char style="wj">“Tho law lü, na ngjännak phak lo lü na ima cit bea”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7"/>Akxo cun tho law lü a im da cit beki. <verse eid="MAT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8"/>Khyang he naw ami hmuh üng cäi law u lü, acukba khyang üng akdaw pekia Pamhnam cun mhlünmtaikie.<verse eid="MAT 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Mahte khüki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mk 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Lk 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9"/>Acuna hnün ceh ta lü Jesuh a ceh hü üng, Mahte ngming naki khyang mat, ngcawn ngcawnaka im üng a na ngaw se hmuh lü, <char style="wj">“Na läk lawa,</char>” ti se,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:9">Mahte naw tho law lü Jesuh läki.<verse eid="MAT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 15:1">Lk 15:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 15:2">2</ref></char>
    </note>Jesuh naw Mahtea ima buh a ei k’um üng, ngcawng nglawke ja mdimei khyang he law u lü Jesuh ja axüisaw hea hlawnga ngaw law hngakie. <verse eid="MAT 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11"/>Pharise he avang naw hmuh u lü axüisaw hea üng, “Ivai nami saja ngcawn nglawke ja mdimei khyang hea dä ei yümkie ni?” ami ti.<verse eid="MAT 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12"/>Jesuh naw ngja lü, <char style="wj">“Khyang kphete naw dawkta am hlü u, khyang kune naw ni dawkta ami hlü.</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:7">Mt 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hos 6:6</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Keia hlüei ta mpyeneinak ni, khyüngsei am ngkengtaihnak am ni,” ti hin i a ti hlünak ni? Cit u lü va ngthei ua. Isetiüng ta “Khyang ngsungpyune jah khü khaia ka lawki am ni, mdimei khyang he jah khü khaia ni ka law.” </char><verse eid="MAT 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ei Jeiha mawng Ngthähnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mk 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Lk 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14"/>Acunüng Baptican Johana hnukläke Jesuh veia law u lü, “Ise keimi ja Pharise he ahüt hüt üng ei jeih u üng se nanga na hnukläke ei am jeih khawikie ni?” ti lü Jesuh ami kthäh u.<verse eid="MAT 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Khine cun Cambumkia hlawnga ami vea küt üng, a khine ei kaa ve khai hea nami ngaikie aw? Am ve u! Acunsepi cambumki a khine am ami ngkya lawa mhnüp pha law khai, acunüng amimi naw ei jeih khaie ni,” </char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16"/>
    <char style="wj">U naw suisak kphyüm akthai am am bu khawi. Acukba ami bu üng akthai naw akphyüm ei päk se angbaüa päk law dämdäm khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17"/><char style="wj">Acuna kba ni, u naw awi kphyüm üng capyit tui sü am than khawi u. Acukba ami than üng awi se law lü capyit tui sü ngsawi päih lü, awi pi pye khai. Capyit tui sü cun awi kthai üng ni ami than khawi. Acukba ami than üng va ani nghngih am pye thei ni.</char><verse eid="MAT 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Judah ngvaia canu ja Jesuha kcu hneki Nghnumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mk 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Lk 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18"/>Acukba ngthu a pyen k'um üng, Judah ngvai mat Jesuh veia law lü a mkhuk am ngdängki naw, “Ka canu tuh hi thi ve. Acunüngpi law lü, na kut a khana na taih law üng ta xüng law be khai ni” ti lü, a nghuinak.<verse eid="MAT 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw tho law lü läk se axüisaw he naw pi läk hngakie.<verse eid="MAT 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20"/>Nghnumi mat, khawkum xaleinghngih a thi put lü khuikhaki Jesuha hnua law lü, a kcu mdawngca a hneh. <verse eid="MAT 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21"/>Acuna nghnumi naw, “A suisak mdawngca hleng ka hneh üng ta ka daw be khai ni” ti lü ngaieiki.<verse eid="MAT 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22"/>Jesuh naw nghlat law lü ani a hmuh üng, <char style="wj">“Ka canu aw, käh cäia. Na jumeinak naw ning mdaw be ve,”</char> ti se, acunja nghnumi cun daw beki.<verse eid="MAT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23"/>Acunüng Jesuh Judah ngvaia ima va lutki. Yawk kcing tumkie ja kyahkie a jah hmuh vai üng, <verse eid="MAT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24"/><char style="wj">“Avan kpunga cit ua! Ahina nghnumica thiki am ni ipki ni” </char>ti se, acun he naw ami yaihei. <verse eid="MAT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25"/>Cunüngpi khyang he kpunga ami va luh ja, Jesuh nghnumicaa venak im k’uma lut lü a kut üng kaih se tho law beki. <verse eid="MAT 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26"/>Acuna mawng cun khaw lum üng ngthang hüki.<verse eid="MAT 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw a Mikmü xawi a jah mdaw be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27"/>Jesuh acun üngka naw a va ceh üng, amikmü nghngih naw läk ni lü, “Aw, Davita capa jah mpyeneia” ti lü ngpyangki xawi.<verse eid="MAT 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28"/>Jesuh ima k’uma a luh üng, amikmü xawi a veia law ni se, Jesuh naw <char style="wj">“Kei naw ka ning jah mdaw be khawh khai ti nami jumki aw” </char>ti se,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">“Bawipa aw, kani jumki ni” ani ti.<verse eid="MAT 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw ani mik jah hne lü, <char style="wj">“Nani jumeia mäiha thawn se”</char> a ti. <verse eid="MAT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30"/>Acunja ani mik vai law be se Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“U üng pi käh nani mtheh vai” </char>ti lü a jah ksük.<verse eid="MAT 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31"/>Acunüngpi ani va ceh jah Jesuha mawng cun khaw avan üng ani sang hü.<verse eid="MAT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ak’ang Jesuh naw a mdaw be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32"/>Acun üngka naw ami va ceh üng, khawyaia venak ak’ang khyang mat Jesuha veia ami lawpüi u. <verse eid="MAT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33"/>Jesuh naw khawyai a ksät käna acuna khyang ngthuhei law be thei se, khyang he naw “Hina mäih Isarele üng am mi hmuh khawi” ti lü müncannakie.<verse eid="MAT 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:25">Mt 10:25</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:24">12:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22">Mk 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:15">Lk 11:15</ref></char>
    </note>Acunsepi pharisee naw, “Hin naw khawyaiea ngvai naw a peta johit am khawyaie jah ksät ve” ti lü pyeneikie.<verse eid="MAT 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw khyang he jah Mpyeneiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mt 4:23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:39">Mk 1:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:44">Lk 4:44</ref></char>
    </note>Jesuh mlühe naküt, ngname naküt üng cit hüki. Sinakoka k’uma jah mthei hü lü, Pamhnama khawa mawng thangkdaw pyen hüki. Am phetkie ja hlikhaü mjüküm naw a jah pawhe naküt jah mdaw beki. <verse eid="MAT 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:17">Num 27:17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:17">1Sang 22:17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:16">2Khro 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:5">Hez 34:5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:34">Mk 6:34</ref></char></note>Jesuh naw khyang päe, toksäm am ve se khuikhakia toca hea mäih a jah hmuh üng aktäa jah mpyeneiki. <verse eid="MAT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:2">Lk 10:2</ref> </char></note>Acunüng Jesuh naw axüisaw hea üng, <char style="wj">“Cang hmin lü da sepi, at lü mkhäm khai ngcek ve,”</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38"/><char style="wj">Cangmah naw cang at khai khawhah a tüih law vaia cangmaha veia ktaiyü ua”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 9:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10"/>
  <para style="s">Ngsä Xaleinghngih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mk 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Lk 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1"/>Jesuh naw axüisaw xaleinghngih jah khü lü ngmüimkhya ksee jah ksätnak, am phetkie naküt ja natnak naküt jah mdawnak be khawha johit a jah pet. <verse eid="MAT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2"/>Axüisaw xaleinghngihea ami ngminge ta akcüka, Sihmon (Pita ami ti) ja a be Andru, Zebedea capa Jakuk ja a na Johan, <verse eid="MAT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3"/>Philip ja Batolame, Thomah ja ngcawnklawk Mahte, Alaphaha capa Jakuk ja Thade ami ti ja, <verse eid="MAT 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4"/>Kanan khyang Sihmon ja Jesuh phyaheikia Judah Iskarota kyaki he.<verse eid="MAT 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Axüisawe Xaleinghngih jah Tüihki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mk 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Lk 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5"/>Ahina xaleinghngihe Jesuh naw jah tüih lü, “<char style="wj">Khyangmjü kce hea lam üng käh nami ceh vai, Samarih khyang hea venak mlühe pi käh nami leh vai,”</char> ti lü a jah cük. <verse eid="MAT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6"/><char style="wj">Acunüngpi, khyükia to am tängki Isarel khyang hea veia nami ceh vai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7-15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-12">Lk 10:4-12</ref></char></note> Cit u lü, <char style="wj">“Pamhnama Khaw ng'et law ve”</char> ti lü jah mtheh hü ua. <verse eid="MAT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8"/><char style="wj">“Khyang kune jah mdaw be u lü, mnehkse mnehkie nami jah ngmangsak be vai, khyangkthie nami jah mthawh be vai, khawyaie nami jah ksät vai. Amdanga nami yah amdanga khyang üng nami pet vai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9"/><char style="wj">Ngui im pi ni se, xüi im pi ni se käh nami cehei vai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:14">1Kor 9:14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1Tim 5:18</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Cä pi käh nami phüihei vai, kcu nghngih, khawdawk nghngih käh nami cehei vai, ksawngkhe käh nami cehei vai. Isetiüng ta, khut pawhkie üng ami hlükaw cun jah pe khai. </char><verse eid="MAT 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11"/>
    <char style="wj">Mlüha pi ni se, ngnama pi ni se, nami ceh üng ning jah khina thei khai bükteng lü, nami law be veia acuia nami ve vai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12"/><char style="wj">Im üng nami va luh üng, im mah üng, “Dimdeihnak ve se” ti lü, dawnak nami jah pet vai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13"/><char style="wj">Im mahe naw ami ning dokham üng, dimdeihnak ami khana pha law khai. Acunüngpi am ami ning dokham üng ta dimdeihnak cun nangmi da nghlat law be se.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Ngs 13:51</ref></char></note>Aia mlüh, aia ngnam üng pi am ning jah dokham lü nami ngthu am ami ngjak hlü üng, a im üngka naw pi ni se, ami khaw üngka naw pi ni se, nami nghlat be üng nami khawpha mput nami kphawng hüt vai. <verse eid="MAT 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:24">Mt 11:24</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Gen 19:24-28</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, ngthumkhyahnaka mhnüp üng acuna mlühea kthaka ta Sodom ja Komorah mlühe ka jah mpyenei bawk khai ni. </char><verse eid="MAT 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mkhuimkhanak pha law khai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Mk 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Lk 21:12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:3">Lk 10:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Ngai ua, mhngeea ksunga toca mäiha ning jah tüi veng. Acunakyase kphyua mäiha cingcai u lü müma mäiha nami hniphnawi vai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17-20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:9-11">Mk 13:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:11">Lk 12:11</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-15">21:12-15</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Khyang he nami jah mceiei vai. Isetiüng ta ning jah man khaie veia ning jah cehpüi u lü sinakokea k’uma ning jah kpai khaie.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18"/><char style="wj">Keia phäha acawjah ngvaie ja Sangpuxangea veia ning jah cehpüi khaie. Acunüng keia mawng cun khyang mjükce he üng nami jah mtheh thei khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19"/><char style="wj">Ami ning jah man u üng, i pyen vai, hawkba ve vai ti käh cäi na ua. I nami pyen vai ti cun akcün a pha law üng ning jah mtheh khai ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20"/><char style="wj">Pyen khai cun nanimät däk am ni, nami paa ngmüimkhya naw ning jah pyensak khai ni.</char><verse eid="MAT 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 13:12">Mk 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:16">Lk 21:16</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Ngbengna xawi mat naw mat ami jah hnim vaia ng'apei law khai xawi. A pa naw a ca ceng law khai, hnasene naw ami nupa hneng law u lü, ami thihnak vaia ceng law khaie.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:9">Mt 24:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:13">Mk 13:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:17">Lk 21:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:13">Mt 24:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:13">Mk 13:13</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Keia ngminga phäha khyang naküt naw ning jah hneng law khaie. Acunsepi adütnak cäpa sitih lü jumeiki naw küikyannak yah khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23"/><char style="wj">Mlüh mat üng ami ning jah mkhuimkha üng, mlüh kcea nami dawng vai. Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki Isarel mlühe avan üng thangkdaw am nami pyen päih ham üng Khyanga Capa kyum law be khai. </char><verse eid="MAT 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 6:40">Lk 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Jn 13:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">15:20</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Ahnukläk cun angvaia kthaka am kyäp khawi, mpya pi amahpa khana am ve khawi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mt 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:24">12:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22">Mk 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:15">Lk 11:15</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Ahnukläk angvaia mäih a law hin khäk lü, a mpya amahpa mäih a law hin khäki ni. Imbung khawng hin Beelzebul ti lü ami khü üng ta, imbung üngkae ta acuna kthaka sekia va jah sui khaie! </char><verse eid="MAT 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mhnama thea U Kyüh vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Lk 12:2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 4:22">Mk 4:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:17">Lk 8:17</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Khyang he käh jah kyüh ua. Isetiüng ta, thupvih naküt po päih khai, mjih naküt pi ngte law päih khai ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27"/><char style="wj">Anghmüpnaka ka ning jah mtheh naküt cen adeinaka khyang he üng nami jah mtheh be vai, a sithawta nami ngjak naküt im mkyung üngka naw nami sang be vai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28"/><char style="wj">Pumsa hnim khawh lü, ngmüimkhya xünnak am hnim khawhki käh kyüh ua. Pumsa ja ngmüimkhya xünnak mulai mei üng kphum khawhki Pamhnam va nami kyüh vai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29"/><char style="wj">Khaca nghngih ngui phe mata am mi jawi khawi mä? Acun he matca pi nami pa naw am a ksinga khawmdeka am kya law sawxat khawi u.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30"/><char style="wj">Na lusam ikän veki ti avan Pamhnam naw ksing päihki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31"/><char style="wj">Acunakyase, käh kyühkyawk ua, nangmi cun khaca hea kthaka nami daw bawkie ni. </char><verse eid="MAT 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khritaw Doei ja Maei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Lk 12:8-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32"/>
    <char style="wj">Au pi khyang he maa “Kei Jesuha hnukläk ni” ti lü pyen hlüki cun kei naw pi khankhawa ka paa maa ka hnukläk ni ti lü ka pyen be khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 2:12">2Tim 2:12</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Acunüngpi khyang he maa kei na maki cun, kei naw pi khankhawa ka Paa maa am ksing üng ka ti be khai. </char><verse eid="MAT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngkhawtnak am ni, Ngtuknak ni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Lk 12:51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34"/>
    <char style="wj">Khawmdek khana dimdeihnak lawpüi khaia ka lawkia käh ngai ua. Keia lawpüi ta dimdeihnak am ni, ngtainak vai kcimcei ni ka lawpüi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:35,36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mik 7:6</ref></char></note><char style="wj">A ca naw a pa hneng lü, a canu naw a nu ngtukpüi khai ja, a pai naw a ni a hnengnak vaia ka lawki ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36"/><char style="wj">Ami ye cun amäta khuiim kyawnglawng üng kaea kya khai.</char><verse eid="MAT 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37"/>
    <char style="wj">Aupi a pa pi ni se a nu pi ni se, keia kthaka kphya naki ta keia hnukläka am nglawi. A capa pi ni se, a canu pi ni se keia kthak kphyanaki cun keia hnu läk khaia am nglawiki ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:24">Mt 16:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34">Mk 8:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23">Lk 9:23</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Aupi amäta kutlamktung kawt lü ka hnu am na läk lawki ta ka hnukläka am nglawi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:25">Mt 16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mk 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Lk 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Jn 12:25</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Aupi a xünnak vai suiki naw a sak mkhyüh khai. Cunüngpi keia phäha a sak tawnki naw angsäi xünnak yah khai. </char><verse eid="MAT 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aphu Yah vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Mk 9:41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:40: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Lk 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Jn 13:20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mk 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Lk 9:48</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Nangmi ning jah dokhamki cun kei na dokhamki ni. Kei na dokhamki cun kei na tüih lawki dokhamki ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41"/><char style="wj">Au pi Pamhnama sahma, sahma a nia phäh dokhamki naw a doa khen yah khai. Au pi khyang ngsungpyun, khyang ngsungpyun a nia phäh dokhamki naw a doa khen yah khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42"/><char style="wj">Aupi ka hnukläk üngka mat üng ka hnukläk a nia phäha tui khawt matca tuki naw, a tua phu yah be khai. </char><verse eid="MAT 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11"/>
  <para style="s">Baptican Johan ja Jesuh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Lk 7:18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1"/>Axüisawe xaleinghngih a jah mtheh käna, mlüh kce hea ngthu pyen hü khaia Jesuh citki.<verse eid="MAT 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2"/>Baptican Johan thawngim üngka naw Jesuha pawhmsahe a jah ngjak üng hnukläk nghngih Khritawa veia a jah tüih. <verse eid="MAT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3"/>Acun xawi naw Jesuh veia, “Johan naw law khai a pyen cen nang mä? Am ani üng akce kami na äp khai aw” ti lü ani kthäh.<verse eid="MAT 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4"/>Jesuh naw jah msang lü, <char style="wj">“Nghlat be ni lü nani hmuh ja nani ngjake naküt Johan üng va mtheh be nia” a ti.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:5">Hesa 35:5</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 35:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1">Hesa 61:1</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Amikmüe naw hmuh be u lü, akxoe pi cit be thei ve u, mnehkse mnehkie daw be ve u, a nghnga kpange naw ngja be ve u, akthihe tho law be u lü, thangkdaw pi msih mpyaki he üng jah mtheh päng ve u.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6"/><char style="wj">Keia phäha a mlung am uplatsaki ta a josenki ni” ti lü a pyen. </char><verse eid="MAT 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7"/>Johana axüisaw he ami ceh be üng Jesuh naw Johana mawng khyangpäe üng jah mtheh lü, <char style="wj">“Johana veia khawkhyawng khawa nami ceh üng, i hmu khaia ni nami ceh? Khawkhi naw a ksün khuhnah bükteng khaia mä nami ceh?</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8"/><char style="wj">“I bükteng khaia ja nami ceh? Suisak akdaw suisaki bükteng khaia mä nami ceh? Suisak akdaw suisakie cun Sangpuxangea ima ni ami ve khawi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9"/><char style="wj">“Na mtheh ua, I teng khaia ni nami ceh? Sahma mä? Ä, ning jah mtheh veng, sahmaa pi kyäp bawki ve ve.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Ahina mawng ni cangcim üng ng'yu lü, “Pamhnam naw, na maa ka ngsä na lam pyang khai ka tüih law khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11"/><char style="wj">Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, nghngicim naküt üng Baptican Johana kthaka daw bawki u am ve. Acunüngpi khankhawa veki akdik säih cun Johana kthaka daw bawki ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 16:16">Lk 16:16</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Baptican Johana a ngthu pyen üngkhyüh tuh vei cäpa khankhaw naw tuknak khameiki, ngtuatkia khyang ksee naw khaw ami yah vaia kthanakie.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13"/><char style="wj">Pamhnama sahma he naküt ja Mosia thume naw Johana a ve vei cäpa Pamhnama Khawa mawng cun pyenkie.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:10-13">Mt 17:10-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:11-13">Mk 9:11-13</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Ami pyen nami jum hlü üng, Johan cun law khaia ami na pyen khawi Elijaha kyaki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15"/><char style="wj">A nghnga veki naw ngja se. </char><verse eid="MAT 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16"/>
    <char style="wj">Acunsepi atuh khyang he hin i am ni ka jah mtumtäng kawm? Ahin he cun hnasen lumeikie ami püi khü u lü,</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17"/><char style="wj">Pülün ning jah tum pe ngü se am nami nglamkie, yawk ng’äi mcuk ngü sepi am mbawikyap uki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18"/><char style="wj">Johan a law üng am ei aw se, “Khyang naküt naw khawyaia venak” ami ti.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19"/><char style="wj">Khyanga Capa law lü ei aw se khyang naküt naw, “Teng ua, meng lü capyittui aw ve, akhawn kawke ja khyangkaea püi hin” ami ti. “Acunüng pi ksinghmatnak cun a bilawh üng ngsingki”</char> ti lü a jah mtheh.<verse eid="MAT 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Am Jumeikia Mlühe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Lk 10:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw müncanksee aktunga a pawhnaka mlühe cun am ami ngjuta phäha a jah ksenak. <verse eid="MAT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:1-18">Hesa 23:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:1-28:26">Hez 26:1—28:26</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Jol 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9">Amo 1:9</ref>,<ref loc="AMO 1:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:2-4">Zakh 9:2-4</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Korazin mlüh aw na jo se ve, Bethsaida mlüh aw na jo se ve. Isetiüng ta, nangni üng mdana mäiha müncanksee hin Turah ja Sidon mlüha mdang vai sü ta, ahlana va kpyawnkse ngbung u lü, mput awt u lü ngjut päng khaie sü.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22"/><char style="wj">Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, ngthumkhyahnaka mhnüp üng Turah ja Sidon mlüh xawi cun nangnia kthaka Pamhnam naw jah mpyenei khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:13-15">Hesa 14:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Gen 19:24-28</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Nang Kapenawm mlüh pi, namät naw namät khankhaw cäpa na mhlünmtaiei hlüki aw? Mulaia ning khyakin vai. Nang üng mdana mäiha Sodom mlüh üng müncanksee jah mdan vai sü üng ta tuh vei cäpa ve ham khai sü.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:15">Mt 10:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:12">Lk 10:12</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Ka ning jah mthehki, “Ngthumkhyahnaka mhnüp üng nanga kthaka Sodom mlüh üng Pamhnama mpyeneinak däm khai,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ka veia Law lü Hüiei ua</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Lk 10:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25"/>Jesuh naw pyen lü, <char style="wj">“Ka pa, khawmdek ja khankhawa Bawipa aw! Khyang ktheme üng jah thup lü a mlung mhnemki hnasena mäihe üng na jah mhnüha phäh na ngming ka mküiki. </char> <verse eid="MAT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26"/><char style="wj">Ä, ka pa aw, ahin cun na ngjak hlüa kyaki ni. </char><verse eid="MAT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:35">Jn 3:35</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:18">Jn 1:18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:15">10:15</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Ka pa naw avan a na pet päng. U naw a capa am ksing, ka pa däk naw ni a ksing. Ka pa pi u naw am ksing, a capa däk naw ni a ksing. Acun ja a capa naw a mtheh däk naw ni a ksing. </char><verse eid="MAT 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28"/>
    <char style="wj">A phüih yüh lü bawngbaiki naküt ka veia law ua, ka ning jah hüieisak khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:16">Jer 6:16</ref></char></note>Ka kawhcung kawt ua. Ngmüimkhya lama ka mlungmthin hniphnawi lü nemkia kyase, ka veia ngtheingthang law ua. Acunüng, nami ngmüimkhyaa hüieinak nami yah khai. <verse eid="MAT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30"/><char style="wj">“Isetiüng ta, ka ning jah pet vaia kawhcung cun jäi lü, nami khana ka mtaih vaia phüih pi hangki ni”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12"/>
  <para style="s">Sabbath mhnüpa mawng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mk 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Lk 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 23:25">Deut 23:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jesuh sabbath mhnüp üng loma lama cit se, axüisaw he ami ei ngaih u lü lomaa cangvüi kpyat lü eikie. <verse eid="MAT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2"/>Pharise he naw ami jah hmuh üng, Jesuh üng, “Tenga, sabbath mhnüp üng jeih vai sü, am pawh vai na xüisawe naw pawh ve u” ti lü ami pyen.<verse eid="MAT 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:3-4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1Sam 21:1-6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Davit a ei ngaih lü a khyang he am i pawhkie ti cangcim üng am nami kheh khawiki aw? </char> <verse eid="MAT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Lev 24:9</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Pamhnama ima lut u lü Pamhnam üng peta muk, ktaiyü he däk naw va eia nglawiki. Amimia eia am nglawiki a khyang he am eikie.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:9">Num 28:9</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 28:10">10</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Am ani üng, ktaiyü he sabbath mhnüp üng khut ami pawh msawk üng pi mkhyekiea am jah ngaih, ti cangcim üng am nami khe khawiki aw? </char> <verse eid="MAT 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6"/><char style="wj">Acunsepi ka ning jah mthehki, ngpumima kthaka daw bawki hia ve ve, </char> <verse eid="MAT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:13">Mt 9:13</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hos 6:6</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">“Ngkengtaihnaka kdama mpyeneinak ngaih veng” ti nami ksinga ta ngsungpyunkie am nami jah mkatei khai sü. </char> <verse eid="MAT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8"/><char style="wj">Isetiüng ta, “Khyanga capa cun sabbatha Bawi ni” </char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Akutxo a mdaw be</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mk 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Lk 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9"/>Jesuh acun üngka naw cit lü, ami sinakoka lutki. <verse eid="MAT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10"/>Acuia akutxo a na veki. Ami mkatei vaia phäha, “Sabbath mhnüp üng mdawnak bea khut pawh nglawiki aw?” ti lü ami kthäh.<verse eid="MAT 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 14:5">Lk 14:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Nangmi üngka mata toca mat däk a tak sabbath mhnüp üng khuia k’uma kya se am na lo be khai aw, na hawihin khai aw.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12"/><char style="wj">To mata kthaka khyang mat sabbath mhnüp üng mdaw be vai cun daw bawki. Acunakyase, mi Thum üng pi sabbath mhnüp üng khyang mat kuei vai hin nglawiki ni”</char> a ti. <verse eid="MAT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13"/>Acunkäna Jesuh naw akutxo üng, <char style="wj">“Na kut sänga”</char> ti se,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 12:13">a kut a säng ja a kut akce mäiha daw law beki. <verse eid="MAT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14"/>Acunüng Pharise he akcea cit u lü Jesuh ami mkhyüh vaia cengkie.<verse eid="MAT 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15"/>Jesuh naw ami hnim hlü cun a ksingei üng, akcea jah ceh ta se khyangpä naw läki he. Mhnatei nakütki a jah mdaw be. <verse eid="MAT 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16"/>Jesuh naw ania mawng i käh ami kcüinak vaia a jah mtheh. <verse eid="MAT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17"/>Acun cun Pamhnam naw a pyensak sahma Hesajah naw a na pyen a kümceinak vaia kyaki.<verse eid="MAT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:18-21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 42:1-4">Hesa 42:1-4</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note>“Tenga, ka mpya, ka xü cen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">ka kphyanak ja ka mlunga jenak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Ka ngmüimkhya a khana ka tüih khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">ani naw ngthumkhyahnak cun khyangmjüe üng jah mtheh khai.<verse eid="MAT 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19"/>Ngpyang lü ngcuhpüi am ve,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:19">u naw a kthai lama käh ngja khai.<verse eid="MAT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20"/>Ngkunkia kyaicung käh k’ekbät lü,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">meisui mkhu pi käh mthih khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">Ngpyunnak a ngnäng veia,<verse eid="MAT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21"/>A ngming üng khyang he naw äpeinak ta khaie.<verse eid="MAT 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh ja khawyai Beelzebul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Mk 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:13-23">Lk 11:13-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22"/>Acunüng khawyaia venak a mik mü lü am ngthuhei theiki khyang mat ami lawpüi Jesuh naw mdaw be se, ngthuhei lü hmuh law be theiki. <verse eid="MAT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23"/>Khyangpäe naw Jesuha pawh cun hmu lü müncan law u lü, “Hina khyang hin Davita capa ni khawh khai aw?”<verse eid="MAT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mt 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref></char>
    </note>Pharise he naw acun ami ngjak üng, “Hina khyang naw Beelzebul yaiea mkhawnga pet johit am yaie jah ksät ve” ami ti.<verse eid="MAT 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25"/>Jesuh naw ami cungaih jah ksing lü, <char style="wj">“Aia pe pi animäte ngcawhkie cun khawvei am kham lü ngtai khawikie. Aia mlüh pi imbung üng pi, animäte ngcawhkie cun am ngsawn khawi u.” </char> <verse eid="MAT 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26"/><char style="wj">Acunüng khawyai naw khawyai a ksät üng, amät naw amät mtaikia kya se, ikba a khaw ngsawng khawh khai ni? </char> <verse eid="MAT 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27"/><char style="wj">Nangmi naw Beelzebul yai mkhawnga na pet johit am yaie ka jah ksät vaia nami pyenki. Acun a ni üng, u naw nami hnukläke üng jah ksätnaka johit jah peki ni? Nami hnukläke naw nami mkhye ngdangsak ve u, a ti. </char> <verse eid="MAT 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28"/><char style="wj">Am ni, Beelzebula johit am ni. Mhnama ngmüimkhyaa johit am ka jah ksät üng va Pamhnama Khaw nami khana pha lawki. </char><verse eid="MAT 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29"/>
    <char style="wj">Am ani üng u naw khyang kyan yüi üng am pin ma lü, a ima ka khawhkhyame jah loei thei khai ni? </char><verse eid="MAT 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Am mhlät khawha mkhyekatnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 9:40">Mk 9:40</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Au pi, kei da am veki cun kei na hnengki ni. Kei am alanga am na mcunpüiki cun ngphyüingphyakia kyaki ni. </char> <verse eid="MAT 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31"/><char style="wj">Acunakyase ka ning jah mthehki, mkhyekatnak naküt ja, Pamhnam ksekha nakie cun jah mhläta kya khai. Cunsepi Ngmüimkhya Ngcim ksekhanaki cun mhlät theia am kya. </char> <verse eid="MAT 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:10">Lk 12:10</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Aupi Khyanga Capa mkhyekat na lü ksekhanaki cun mhläta kya khai. Cunsepi Ngmüimkhya Ngcim ksekhanaki cun tuh pi ngawia pi mhlät theia am kya. </char><verse eid="MAT 12:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Thing ja Akthei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Lk 6:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:20">Mt 7:20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:44">Lk 6:44</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Akthei üng a thing ksing theia kya se, akthei a daw üng a thing daw lü, akthei a set üng a thing seki ti nami ksing vai. </char> <verse eid="MAT 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:7">Mt 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:7">Lk 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 15:18">Mt 15:18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:45">Lk 6:45</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Kphyuksee aw, ihawkba se u lü akdaw nami pyen thei khai ni? Mlung üng veki va mpyawng üng lut law khawiki. </char> <verse eid="MAT 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35"/><char style="wj">Khyang kdaw naw a mlung kdaw üngka akdawe jah pyen khawi lü, khyang kse naw a mlung kse üngka aksee jah pyen khawiki. </char><verse eid="MAT 12:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36"/>
    <char style="wj">Ka ning jah mthehki, akse pyenkia khyang naküt a pyena phu cun ngthumkhyahnaka mhnüp üng thung be khai. </char> <verse eid="MAT 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37"/><char style="wj">Na ngthu naw ning lätsak lü na ngthu bä naw ning mkat khai” </char>a ti.<verse eid="MAT 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Müncankse ami Tänak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Mk 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Lk 11:29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:38: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:1">Mt 16:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:11">Mk 8:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:16">Lk 11:16</ref></char>
    </note>Acunüng thum mthei he avang ja Pharise he naw Jesuh üng, “Saja aw, müncankse mat na pawh kami hmuh hlüki” ti lü tä u se,<verse eid="MAT 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:39: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:4">Mt 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mk 8:12</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Jesuh naw, “Tuh kän khyang he ihlawka se lü mtuihmlehkie ni. Nangmi naw müncankse nami täkie aw? Jonaha müncanksea thea i käh ning jah mhnuh vai” a ti. </char> <verse eid="MAT 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:17">Jn 1:17</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Jonah nganua k’uma mhnüp kthum ja mthan kthum a vea mäiha khyanga capa pi mdek k’uma mhnüp kthum ja mthan kthum ve khai. </char> <verse eid="MAT 12:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:5">Jn 3:5</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ninevih mlüha khyang he naw ngthumkhyahnaka mhnüp üng ngdüi u lü ning jah mtai law khaie. Isetiüng Jonaha ngthu pyena phäh ami mkhyenak üngka naw ngjutkie. Teng u, Jonaha kthaka kyäp bawkie ve ve u. </char> <verse eid="MAT 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:1-10">1Sang 10:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2Khro 9:1-12</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ngthumkhyahnaka mhnüp üng Sheba Sangpuxangnu naw ngdüi lü ning jah cijang law khai. Ani cun Solamona themngvainak ngai khaia athuknak a khaw üngka naw lawki. Teng ua, Solamona kthaka kyäp bawki hia ve khü. </char><verse eid="MAT 12:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khawyaia Nghlat lawnak be</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Lk 11:24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43"/>
    <char style="wj">Ngmüimkhyakse khyang üngka naw a lut law üng, mkyanga a hüieinak vai hnün sui hü lü am hmu lü, </char> <verse eid="MAT 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44"/><char style="wj">“ka venak kphyüm ima ka cit be khai” ti lü a ceh be üng, a na ngcim lü a na phephaih, a na ngkhämtawng se a hmuh.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45"/><char style="wj">Cit be lü amäta kthaka se bawkia ngmüimkhya ksee khyüh jah khü law se lut u lü, acuia awmki he. Acunüng, acuna khyang üng kya law khai cun akma kaa kthaka kyühkse bawki ni. Acukba tukbäih hina khyang ksee üng pi thawn law hnga khai”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 12:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuha Nu ja a Benae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mk 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Lk 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46"/>Acukba khyang khawhahea veia a ngthuei k'um üng a nu ja a benae naw ami ngthuheipüi vaia sui hü u lü kpunga ngdüikie. <verse eid="MAT 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47"/>Acunüng mat naw, “Tenga na nu ja na benae naw ning ngthuei hlüpüi lü kpunga ngdüi ve u” ti lü a mtheh.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:47: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Avanga caupe naw cayüi 47 am yuk sih u.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 12:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“U ni ka nu, ue ni ka benae cun”</char> a ti. <verse eid="MAT 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw axüisaw he maa a kut säng lü, <char style="wj">“Hine hin ka nu ja ka benae ni.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50"/><char style="wj">Au pi, ka pa khankhawa kaa ngjak hlü pawhki naküt cun ka benae, ka cinae ja ka nua kyaki he ni”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13"/>
  <para style="s">Mciksaw am a Msuimcäpnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mk 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Lk 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1"/>Acuna mhnüp üng, Jesuh im üngkhyüh cit lü tuilia kama jah mthei khaia ngawki. <verse eid="MAT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Lk 5:1-3</ref></char></note>Ani ngbum lawki khyangpäe nung u se ta Jesuh mlawnga khana kai lü a ngaw üng, khyangpäe cun tuili kama ngdüikie. <verse eid="MAT 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3"/>Jesuh naw msuimcäpnake am ngthu pyen lü,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:3">
    <char style="wj">“Ahlana mci saw khaia khyang mat citki.” </char> <verse eid="MAT 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4"/><char style="wj">Acukba a phuh hü üng, mci avang lama kya se khae naw ami ei u. </char> <verse eid="MAT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5"/><char style="wj">Avang lunga danak, nglei a ngceknaka kya se akjanga cawt lawki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6"/><char style="wj">Khaw so law lü ngling law se, apya am vekia kya lü ngjaiei päihki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7"/><char style="wj">Mci avang nghlinga ksunga kya se nghling naw saü law lü a jah yaiin.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8"/><char style="wj">Cunsepi, mci avang ngleia dawnaka kya se daw lü, avang aphya, avang khyukip, avang thumkipa ngtheipai lawki. </char><verse eid="MAT 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9"/>
    <char style="wj">Aupi a ngjaknak vai a nghnga veki naw ngja se”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Msuimcäpnakea Suilam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mk 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Lk 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10"/>Acunüng axüisaw he Jesuha veia law u lü, “Khyang he am na ngthuei üng ivaia msuimcäpnake na jah sumeiki ni?” ti lü ami kthäh u.<verse eid="MAT 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Nangmi cun Khankhaw Pea küia mawng ksingnak ka ning jah mtheh päng ni, amimi üng ta am jah mtheh nawng”</char> a ti. <verse eid="MAT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:29">Mt 25:29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mk 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Lk 8:18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">19:26</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Takia khyang üng a tak law dämdäm vaia petsih vai. I pi am taki üng a tak naküt pi hutei be vai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13"/><char style="wj">Ami veia msuimcäpnak am ngthu ka pyen hin teng kyaw u lü pi am hmu u, ngai kyaw u lü pi am ngjakya u. </char> <verse eid="MAT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14,15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Hesa 6:9</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 6:10">10</ref> (LXX)</char></note>Acunakyase sahma Hesajah naw</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">
    <char style="wj">Hina khyang he naw ngai lü ngaikie, cunüngpi am ngjakya u; </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">
    <char style="wj">teng lü tengkie, cunüngpi am hmu u, </char><verse eid="MAT 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15"/>
    <char style="wj">Isetiüng ami mlung nghlangkia kyase, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="wj">ami nghnga naw am ngja ti, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="wj">ami mik naw am hmu ti. </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="wj">Ami mik naw hmu lü, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="wj">ami nghnga naw a ngjak vai sü ta, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="wj">ami mlung üng ngjakya khaie sü, </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="wj">acunüng ka veia nghlat law be u se, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="wj">ka jah mdaw be vai sü” a pyen khawi. </char><verse eid="MAT 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:16,17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:23">Lk 10:23</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 10:24">24</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Nangmi ta nami mik naw hmuh lü nami nghnga naw ngja se nami kam daw ve.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17"/><char style="wj">Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, sahma khawkän ja Pamhnama khyang he naw nami hmuh hin hmuh hlü u lü pi am hmuh khawh u, nami ngjak hin ngja hlü u lü pi am ngja hüt u.</char><verse eid="MAT 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mciksaw am Msuimcäpnak Mthehnak ngkhai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mk 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Lk 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18"/>
    <char style="wj">Acunakyase, mciksaw msuimcäpnak üng pyen hlü hin ngai lü ngthei ua.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19"/><char style="wj">Khankhaw Pea mawng ngthu ngja lü am ngjakyaki cun lama khana kyaki mci am tängki ni. Khawyaipa naw law lü a mlung k’uma sawnglin cun a lawheiin pet.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20"/><char style="wj">Lunga khana kyaki mci cun ngthu ngja lü jekyainak am a ngjak ja dokhameiki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21"/><char style="wj">Acunüngpi am phungpya mahkia kyase khawvei am kham. Acun ngthua phäh khuikhatnak ja mkhuimkhanak apha law üng pyaiei beki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22"/><char style="wj">Nghling hmua kyakia mci cun Mhnama ngthu ngja kyawki, khawmdeka cäicingnak ja bawimangnak naw a mhleia phäh a ngthu ngjak cun kpyeh se, am ngtheipai lü veeiki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23"/><char style="wj">Ngleia dawnak üng kyakia mci cun ta ngthu ngja lü ngjakyaki: acunüng ngtheipaikie, avang aphya, akhäk khyukip ja amsah thumkipa ngtheipai bekie”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mci Kdaw ja Mci Kse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24"/>Msuimcäpnak akce a jah mtheh betü ta, <char style="wj">“Khankhaw Pe cun a loa mci kdaw sawki khyang mat am tängki ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25"/><char style="wj">Khyang he ami ih k'um mthan mat üng, ye naw law lü mci kdawa ksunga mci kse saw lü akcea citinki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26"/><char style="wj">Cang pyo law lü a vuipai law üng, mphyaw pi ngdang lawki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27"/><char style="wj">A mpyae naw law u lü amahpaa veia, “Angvai aw, na lo üng mcikdaw va na saw am niki aw? Hawia khyüh hina mphyawe po lawki he ni? ti lü a kthäh.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28"/><char style="wj">Lomah naw, “Yee naw ahikba ami pawh ni” a ti. A mpyae naw lomah üng cit lü kami jah phukin vai aw? ami ti.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29"/><char style="wj">Lomah naw, “Kaa, mphyaw nami phuk üng cangkdaw pi nami phuksih khai ni.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30"/><char style="wj">“Cang ah veia ani nghngih veei yüm ni se. Cang ah law üng mphyawe cun jah phu ma lü mei üng jah mkhih vai ja, cange cun jah at hnga u lü, ka kheia ami tak vaia cangk'at he üng ka jah mtheh khai,”</char> ti lü a pyen.<verse eid="MAT 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Anca ui am Msuimcäpnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mk 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Lk 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31"/>Jesuh naw msuimcäpnak akce a jah mtheh betü cun, <char style="wj">“Khankhaw Pe cun khyang naw anca ui cehpüi lü a loa a phuha mäi ni,”</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32"/><char style="wj">Anca ui cun mciui naküt üng akdik säiha kya lü pi a cawt law üng, kpue naküt kthaka ngbaü lawki. A thinga thawn law se khae naw pi law u lü, a kpyang üng ngbu tuhei law khawikie,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nghngen am Msuimcäpnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20">Lk 13:20</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:21">21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33"/>Msuimcäpnak mat a jah mtheh betü cun, <char style="wj">“Khankhaw Pe cun nghnumi mat naw nghngen lo lü khai tawng kthum üng kcaw se, khai kphawm lawki üng tängki ni,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuha sumei Msuimcäpnake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Mk 4:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34"/>Jesuh naw msuimcäpnak am khyangpäe üng ngthu jah mthehki; msuimcäpnaka kaa i am pyen. <verse eid="MAT 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:2">Sal 78:2</ref></char></note>Sahma naw a pyen khawi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">“Msuimcäpnak am amimia veia ngthu ka pyen khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">khawmdek mhnünmceng üngka naw khyüngthupe ka jah mtheh khai,” ti aküm lawnaka kyaki.<verse eid="MAT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mphyaw am Msuimcäpnak Mthehnak ngkhai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36"/>Jesuh naw khyangpä cun akcea jah ceh ta lü im k’uma lut se, axüisaw he a veia law u lü, “Loa mphyawa mawng msuimcäpnaka suilam i ni, jah mtheha” ami ti.<verse eid="MAT 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Mcikdaw sawki cun Khyanga Capa ni.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38"/><char style="wj">Lo cun khawmdek ni, mcikdawe cun Khankhaw Pea ca hea kya u lü, mphyawe cun Khawyama ca he ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39"/><char style="wj">Mphyaw sawki ye cun Khawyam ni. Cang ah kcün cun khawmdeka päihnaka mhnüp ni, cang atkie cun khankhawngsä he ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40"/><char style="wj">Acukba mphyawe jah mcun lü mei üng ami jah mkhiha mäiha, akcün päih law üng thawn law khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41"/><char style="wj">Khyanga Capa naw a khankhawngsä he jah tüih law se, acun he naw a Khankhaw Pe üng khyang he jah mkhyekatsakie ja akse pawhkie avan cun jah mkhäm khai,</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42"/><char style="wj">Kyap u lü ami mnicui hakyet khai hea mulai mei kdäi üng jah xawt law khaie.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43"/><char style="wj">Acunüng Pamhnam ca he ta khawnghngia deikhanga mäiha ami Paa Khankhaw Pea kdeikhang khaie. Na nghnga a ve üng ngjaa! </char><verse eid="MAT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khawh ngthup am Msuimcäpnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44"/>
    <char style="wj">Khankhaw Pe cun loa thupa khawhthem üng tängki ni. Khyang mat naw acuna khawh cun hmu lü thup beki naw, jekyai lü a tak naküt va jawi lü a yah lawa ngui am acuna lo cun a khyäih. </char><verse eid="MAT 13:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lungtaü am Msuimcäpnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45"/>
    <char style="wj">Acunkäna, Khankhaw Pe cun aphu küiki lungtaü kdaw sui hü lü kunpanki khyang mat veki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46"/><char style="wj">Acuna lungtaü a hmuh üng a tak naküt jawi päih lü acuna lungtaü cun a khyäih am tängki ni. </char><verse eid="MAT 13:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngvai am Msuimcäpnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47"/>
    <char style="wj">Khankhaw Pe cun ngvai am pi tängki ni. Ngaksui avang naw tuia ami ngvai ami vawih üng nga amjüküm ng’awki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48"/><char style="wj">Ngvai cun nga beei se kawnga kaih u lü nga cun ami ngawh sawa phyäihkie: nga kdawe cun cä üng jah xawn u lü, am dawkia ngakse naküt cun ami jah xawtin.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49"/><char style="wj">Acukba akcüna päih law üng thawn law khai: khankhawngsä he naw law u lü khyang ngsungpyunea ksunga khyangkae cun jah xü khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50"/><char style="wj">Kyap lü ami mnicui hakyet khai hea, mulai meikdäia jah xawtin vai”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 13:50"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khyüngthup Akthai ja Akphyüm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ahin he hin nami jah ngjakyaki aw?” ti se, “Ä, kami ngjakyaki ni” </char> ami ti.<verse eid="MAT 13:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Acunakyase Khankhaw Pea mawng mtheiki thum mthei he naküt cun immahpa naw a im k’uma ka khawh akthai ja akphyüm a cümnak üngka naw loki am tängki ni,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 13:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nazaret mlüha Jesuh Makie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53"/>Jesuh naw acuna msuimcäpnake a jah mtheh päng üng, acuna hnün hawih lü, <verse eid="MAT 13:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54"/>A hminak mlüha cit beki. Sinakoka k’uma jah mtheimthang se ngja lü müncan ngenkie. “Ahina themngvainak müncankse pawhnaka johit hin hawia a jah yah ni?” ami ti. <verse eid="MAT 13:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55"/>Imksaa ca am ni mä? A nu pi Marih, a benae pi Jakuk, Josep, Sihmon ja Judah ami ti am nikie mä? <verse eid="MAT 13:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56"/>A cinae am pi ahia awmki he am ni mä? Hawia ka hin naw ahikba johit hin a jah yah hü ni? ami ti. <verse eid="MAT 13:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:57: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:44">Jn 4:44</ref></char></note>Acukba Jesuh cun ami ma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Sahma cun hnün naküt üng leisawngkie ni, a hminak a khaw ja a imbunga ni am leisawngnak a yah khawi,”</char> a ti. <verse eid="MAT 13:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58"/>Am jumkiea kyase acuia müncankse i am pawh.<verse eid="MAT 13:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14"/>
  <para style="s">Baptican Johana Thihnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mk 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Lk 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1"/>Acun k'um üng Kalile Upki Herod naw Jesuha mawng cun ngja lü, <verse eid="MAT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2"/>a khyang he üng, “Ani cun Baptican Johan ni, thihnak üngka naw tho beki, acunakyase ni müncanksee jah pawhnak khawha johit taki,” a ti.<verse eid="MAT 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:3,4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 3:19">Lk 3:19</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:20">20</ref></char>
    </note>Herod naw Johan cun man lü, a na Philipa khyu Herodiha phäha thawngim üng ahlana a khyuma kyaki. <verse eid="MAT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:16">Lev 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:21">20:21</ref></char></note>Johan naw Herod üng, “Na naa khyu na khyunak vai ta am nglawiki ni,” a tia phäha kyaki. <verse eid="MAT 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5"/>Herod naw Johan hnim hlüki kyaw Judah khyang he a jah kyüh. Isetiakyaküng Johan cun Judah khyang he naw sahmaa ami ngaiha kyaki.<verse eid="MAT 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6"/>Heroda hminaka mhnüp üng, Herodiha canu cun Herod ja a khinea maa nglamki. Herod amsüma jeki. <verse eid="MAT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7"/>“Ka ng’yünki, na hlüei na tä naküt ka ning pe khai” ti lü Herod naw Herodiha canu üng bekhüt a pet.<verse eid="MAT 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8"/>A nu naw a cüka kba nglaca cun naw, “Mlikbe üng Baptican Johana lu na pea!” a ti.<verse eid="MAT 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9"/>Sangpuxang cun pukseki, cunüngpi a khinea maa a khyütama pänga kyase nglacaa hlüei cun ami pawh vaia a jah mtheh. <verse eid="MAT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10"/>Acunüng thawngima khyang tüih lü Johana lu a khyüngsak. <verse eid="MAT 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11"/>Johana lu cun mlikbe üng lawpüi lü nglaca üng pe u se, nglaca naw a nua veia a cehpüi. <verse eid="MAT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12"/>Johana hnükläke law u lü a yawk cehpüi lü, k’utkie naw Jesuh üng ami va mtheh.<verse eid="MAT 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Thawngmhma a jah mbei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mk 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Lk 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Jn 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13"/>Jesuh naw Johana mawng a ngjak üng, mlawng am ngcum lü ahinak mawkpyawnga citki. Acun ngjaki khyang he naw ami mlüh jah hawih hüt lü ami khaw am läki he. <verse eid="MAT 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14"/>Mlawng üngka naw a kyum law üng Jesuh naw khyangpänu jah hmuh lü jah mpyeneiki, am phetkie a jah mdaw be.<verse eid="MAT 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15"/>Khaw a mü law hlü üng axüisaw he a veia law u lü, “Ahin hin maw ni, khaw pi mthan hnühki ni. Khyang he hin jah tüiha, ami ei vai ngnamea ami ei phäh phäh vai khyäiei hü u se” ami ti.<verse eid="MAT 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Athuknaka ami ceh vai am hlü, nangmi naw ami ei vai aipi jah pe ua,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17"/>Amimi naw, “Muk mhma ja nga nghngihca däk ni kami tak ve u,” ti u se,<verse eid="MAT 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ka veia lawpüi ua,” </char>a ti. <verse eid="MAT 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19"/>Khyang he cun msaia khana ngaw khai hea a jah mtheh. Acunkäna muk mhma ja nga nghngih cun jah lo lü khana mang lü Pamhnam üng jenak mthehki. Muke cun jah bo lü axüisaw he üng a jah pet. A axüisaw he naw khyang he üng ami jah pet. <verse eid="MAT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20"/>Avan naw ei lü phü u se, ami ei k’hläi cun axüisaw he naw ami mcun be üng cä xaleinghngiha lawki. <verse eid="MAT 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21"/>Eikie naküt cun nghnumi ja hnasen am pakia, kpami däk thawngmhma lawki he.<verse eid="MAT 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tuia khana Jesuh Citki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mk 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Jn 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw khyang he a jah tüih be käna, axüisaw he cun mlawng üng cayea a jah na cehsak. <verse eid="MAT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23"/>Acukba khyang he a jah tüih be päng üng, amätca mcunga ktaiyü khaia kaiki. Khaw mü law se, amät däk acuia veki. <verse eid="MAT 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24"/>Acunüng mlawng cun kawng üngka naw a thuknak tuili nglunga ve se tuingnawk naw a ceh hü.<verse eid="MAT 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25"/>Khaw athaih law hlü üng, Jesuh tuia khana a khaw am axüisaw hea veia lawki. <verse eid="MAT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26"/>Axüisawe naw tuia khana a law ami hmuh üng kyühei law u lü, “Hin hin ngmüimkhya ni,” ti u lü ngpyangkie.<verse eid="MAT 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Käh kyüei ua, Kei ni,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28"/>Pita naw msang lü, “Bawipa aw, nang na ni üng, tuia khana ka law hnga khaia na mtheha,” a ti.<verse eid="MAT 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29"/>
    <char style="wj">“Lawa,”</char> Jesuh naw a ti. Acunüng Pita mlawng üngka naw kco law lü Jesuha veia cit khaia tuia khana citki. <verse eid="MAT 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30"/>Acunüngpi khawa khi law a hmuh üng kyühei lü tui üng ju ngcumei lü, “Bawipa aw, na küikyana,” ti lü ngpyang se,<verse eid="MAT 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31"/>Jesuh naw man be lü, <char style="wj">“Jumeinak ngcekia khyang aw, ivaia na mlung uplatki ni”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32"/>Mlawng üng ani kai be ja khawkhi ngdüm beki. <verse eid="MAT 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33"/>Mlawnga k’uma veki axüisaw he naw hjawkhah law u lü, “Nang hin Pamhnama Capa na kya kcangki ni,” ami ti.<verse eid="MAT 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kennesareta Jesuha mdaw be khyang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Mk 6:53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34"/>Tuili cayea va pek u lü Kenesaret hnea lawki he. <verse eid="MAT 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35"/>Acuia ka khyang he naw Jesuh ami ksing üng, acuna pipei üngkae pe naküt üng khyang he jah tüih hü u lü am phetkie naküt ami jah lawpüi u. <verse eid="MAT 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36"/>A suisak mdawngca hman hneh vaia nghuinakie, acunüng, aupi hneki naküt cun phet bekie.<verse eid="MAT 14:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15"/>
  <para style="s">Ngcimcaihki ja Am Ngcimcaihki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mk 7:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1"/>Acunüng Pharise he avang ja thumksinge Jerusalem üngka naw Jesuh veia law u lü, <verse eid="MAT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2"/>“Ise, na xüisawe naw pupa thum am läklamkie ni? Ise ami kut akdawa am mthiei lü ei suxatkie ni?” ti lü ami kthäh.<verse eid="MAT 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Nangmi pi ivaia nami pupa thum läk u lü Mhnama thum am nami läki ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Ex 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Deut 5:16</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 21:17">Ex 21:17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:9">Lev 20:9</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Isetiüng Mhnam naw, ‘Na nu ja na pa na jah leisawng vai, na nu pi ni se na pa pi ni se na jah yünce üng nang cun na thi khai,’ a ti.</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5"/><char style="wj">Acunsepi nangmi naw, Khyang naw a nu ja pa a jah kueinak vaia mkawt a ve üng, ‘Pamhnam üng pet päng ni’ nami tiki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6"/><char style="wj">A nu pa a leisawng vai am hlü.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:6: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Avang naw ami nu pa ti se, avang naw ami Pa ti lü yukie.</char></note><char style="wj">Acukba nangmi cun Pamhnama thum pi käh ngtäh khaia nami thum am nami pawhki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7"/><char style="wj">Hypocrite aw, Hesajah naw nami mawng a pyen cen cang ve, </char><verse eid="MAT 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:8,9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 29:13">Hesa 29:13</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">‘Hine naw ami mpyawng am na leisawng kyaw u lü pi, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:8">
    <char style="wj">ami mlungmthin ta Kei üngka naw thuk ve u. </char><verse eid="MAT 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9"/>
    <char style="wj">Akhawvaa na sawkhah ve u,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:9">
    <char style="wj">isetiüng nghngicim thume cun Ka thuma hana jah mthei ve u!’”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khyang Mtüihkhehsaki Ngthu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Mk 7:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10"/>Acunüng khyangpäe cun Jesuh naw a veia jah khü lü, <char style="wj">“Ngai u lü ksing ua.</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11"/><char style="wj">Khyanga mpyawng üng ju lutki naw khyang am mtüihkhehsak, a k'um üngka naw mpyawnga lut lawki naw ni khyang a mtüihkhehsak ve,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12"/>Acunüng axüisaw he a veia law u lü, “Pharise he naw na ngthupyen ami ngjak üng ami mlung seki ti na ksingki aw?” ami ti.<verse eid="MAT 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ka pa, khana ka naw am a nglin naküt cun phuka kya khai.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:39">Lk 6:39</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Käh jah cäi na ua! Ami mik mükie ni. Amikmü naw amikmü lam a msüm üng ani nghngih khuikhawk üng kya khai xawi,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15"/>Pita naw msang lü, “Hina msuimcäpnak jah mtheh ngkhaia,” a ti.<verse eid="MAT 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Tuh vei üng khyang kce hea kthaka am na cing hamki aw.” </char> <verse eid="MAT 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17"/><char style="wj">“Na mpyawng üng ju lutki naküt na khawnua pha lü na mtisa lum üng pha hüki ti am nami ksing hamki aw.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mt 12:34</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Acunsepi, mpyawng üngka naw lut lawki naküt cun mlungmthin üngka naw law lü, khyang mtüihkhehsaki ni,”</char> a ti. <verse eid="MAT 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19"/><char style="wj">Isetiüng khyang hnimnak, khyanga khyuca bäühmanak, mpyuknak, hleihlatnak, Pamhnam ksekhanake naküt cun am dawkia ngaihkyunak üngka naw cawm lawkia kyaki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20"/><char style="wj">Ahin he naw ni khyang mtüihkhehsak u lü, kut käh mthiei lü ei naw khyang am mtüihkhehsak,” </char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kanan Nghnumia Jumeinak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mk 7:24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21"/>Jesuh acun üngka naw cit lü Turah ja Sidon mlüh peisua citki. <verse eid="MAT 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22"/>Acuna mlüh pipei üng veki Kanan nghnumi naw law lü, “Davita capa Bawipa aw, na mpyeneia, ka ca nghnumica khawyai naw aknuia pawh ve,” a ti.<verse eid="MAT 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23"/>Cunsepi Jesuh naw mkhap matca am pi am msang be. Axüisawe lawki he naw, “Hina nghnumi hin akcea tüiha, jah läk law lü kpamcai ve,” ami ti.<verse eid="MAT 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Kei hin Isarelea khuiimkyawng üngka naw khyükia toea phäh ni Pamhnam naw a na tüih law,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="MAT 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25"/>A veia law lü sawkhahki naw, “Bawipa aw, na mpyena,” a ti.<verse eid="MAT 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Hnasenea ei lo lü, uie üng jah xawt pet vai hin nglawiki aw,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27"/>Nghnumi naw, “Bawipa aw, acukba lang va. Acunüngpi, uie naw pi ami mahpa buhkbaw mthüpeia thum am veki aw,” a ti.<verse eid="MAT 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Jumeinak dämkia nghnumi aw, na ngjak hlüa thawn se,”</char> a ti. Acun ja a canu cun daw beki.<verse eid="MAT 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw khyang khawhah a jah mdaw be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29"/>Jesuh acun üngka naw Kalile tuili läkläka citki. Mcunga kai lü ngawki. <verse eid="MAT 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30"/>Khyangpänue naw akxo, amikmü, ak'ang, am kümkia hmikie ja, amjümjü natnake jah lawpüi u lü Jesuha khaw kunga jah msän u se, a jah mdaw be. <verse eid="MAT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31"/>Ak'ange ngthuhei law be thei lü, a kut khaw kbäte daw be u lü, akxoe cit be thei u lü, amikmüe naw hmu law be thei u se, khyang he naw ami jah hmuh üng, müncan ngen u lü Isarelea Pamhnam cun mhlünmtaikie.<verse eid="MAT 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khyang Thawng kphyü a jah mbei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mk 8:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32"/>Jesuh naw axüisaw hea jah khü lü, <char style="wj">“Hina khyang he hin ka hlawnga mhnüp kthum ve pängki he , atuh ta ei vai am ve se jah mpyenei veng. Ami ei kaa jah tüih vai am daw. Ei ngaih lü lama khuikha hü khaie ni,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33"/>Axüisawe naw, “Hawia hina khawmkyanga khyang hikäna ei vai mi hmuh khai ni?” ami ti.<verse eid="MAT 15:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Muk ikän nami taki</char>” ti se,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:34">“Khyüh ja ngaca api ve ve” ami ti.<verse eid="MAT 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw khyang he ngaw khai hea a jah mtheh. <verse eid="MAT 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36"/>Acunüng muk khyüh ja ngaca jah lo lü, Pamhnama veia jenak mtheh lü a bo. Acun cun axüisaw he üng jah pe se axüisaw he naw khyang he üng ami jah pet. <verse eid="MAT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37"/>Avan naw ei u lü, ami phü käna ak’hläi jah mcun u se cä khyüh üng beki. <verse eid="MAT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38"/>Eikie cun nghnumi ja hnasen käh pakia kpami däk thawngkphyü lawki he.<verse eid="MAT 15:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw khyang he jah tüih be lü mlawng üng kai be lü, Makadalah khawa citki.<verse eid="MAT 15:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16"/>
  <para style="s">Müncankse ami tänak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mk 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Lk 12:54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mt 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:16">Lk 11:16</ref></char>
    </note>Pharise avang ja Sadukee law u lü Jesuh ami mhnütnak vaia Pamhnam naw ning ksingki ti a ngsingnak vaia, müncankse jah mhnuha” ti lü täkie. <verse eid="MAT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2"/>Jesuh naw jah msang lü, <char style="wj">“Khaw kyak law hlü üng, ‘Khankhaw mliki khawngawi ta khaw sen hlü ve’ nami ti khawiki.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3"/><char style="wj">Ngawilama, “Khaw ngmei lü anghmüp law üng, tuhngawi ta khaw ah hlü ve,” nami ti khawiki. Khawa sen vai ja a ak vai cun khankhaw teng lü nami ksing kyawkie. Cunüngpi akcünmka üng sängeikia müncanksee ta am ksing khawh uki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:39">Mt 12:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29">Lk 11:29</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Tuh kän khyang he ihlawka se lü mtuihmlehkie ni. Nangmi naw müncankse nami täkie aw? </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 16:4">
    <char style="wj">Jonaha müncanksea thea i käh ning jah mhnuh vai”</char> ti lü a jah ceh tak.<verse eid="MAT 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pharise he ja Sadukeea nghngen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mk 8:14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5"/>Acunüng, axüisaw he tuilia cayea ami law üng, muk law vai ami mhnih. <verse eid="MAT 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:1">Lk 12:1</ref></char></note>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Pharise he ja Sadukeea nghngen nami jah cäieinak vai,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7"/>Animäte naw ngai u lü, “Ahin hin muk am mi lawpüia phäha kya ngaiki,” ami ti.<verse eid="MAT 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8"/>Jesuh naw ami pyen ksing lü, <char style="wj">“Jumeinak ngcekia khyang he aw, i nami sumkyamkie ni. Ise muk am nami taka phäh vaia nami ngaikie ni?</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:17-21">Mt 14:17-21</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Muk mhma pacawng thawng mhmaa phäh ka bo cen am nami sümkie aw? Cä ikän ja nami msap law? Am nami ksing hamkie aw?</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:34-38">Mt 15:34-38</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Muk khyüh khyang thawng kphyü naw ei u se, cä ikän hläiki ti am nami sümkie aw?</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11"/><char style="wj">“Eia mawng ka ning jah mthehki am ni, ise am nami ksing u ni? Pharise he ja Sadukeea ngneikse nami cäieinak vaia ka ning jah mthehki ni,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12"/>Acunüng muk üng ami kcaw nghngen a pyen am ni, Pharise he ja Sadukeea jah mtheimthangnak ami cäieinak vaia a jah mtheh tia ami ksing.<verse eid="MAT 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pita naw Jesuh a ninak pyenki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mk 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Lk 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13"/>Jesuh Kesari Philipih mlüh pei cit lü acuia axüisaw he üng, <char style="wj">“Khyang he naw Khyanga Capa hin u ami pyen ni,” </char>ti lü a jah kthäh.<verse eid="MAT 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 14:1">Mt 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14">Mk 6:14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7">Lk 9:7</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:8">8</ref></char>
    </note>“Amsah naw Baptican Johan, amsah naw Elijah, amsah naw Jeramih, am ani üng sahma mat mat va ni khai ti ve u,” ami ti.<verse eid="MAT 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Nangmi naw mä ua jah nami na ngaih?”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 6:68">Jn 6:68</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 6:69">69</ref></char>
    </note>Sihmon Pita naw, “Nang cun Khritaw, xüngseiki Pamhnama Capa ni,” a ti.<verse eid="MAT 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17"/>Jesuh naw msang lü<char style="wj">“Johana ca Sihmon, na jo daw ve. Isetiüng ta, ahin hin khyanga ning mtheh am ni, khana ka Pa naw a ning mtheh ni.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18"/><char style="wj">Ka ning mthehki, Pita aw nang lung ni, ahina lunga khana ka sangcim ka mdüih khai, thihnak naw pi käh näng khai ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:18">Mt 18:18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:23">Jn 20:23</ref> </char></note><char style="wj">Khankhaw Pe tawhe ka ning pe khai, aipi khawmdek khana am na mhlät naküt cun khankhawa pi mhläta am kya, ai naküt pi khawmdek khana na mhlät cun khankhawa pi mhläta kya khai,”</char> a ti. <verse eid="MAT 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20"/>Acunüng axüisaw he üng Khritaw a ninak u üng pi käh ami mtheh vaia a jah mtheh.<verse eid="MAT 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Khamei vai ja a thih vai Jesuh naw a pyen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Mk 8:31—9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Lk 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21"/>Acunüng tünei lü Jesuh naw “Jerusalema ka cit khai, axüe, ktaiyü he ja thumksingea mkhuimkhanak ka khamei khai. Na hnim khaie, cunüngpi amhnüp kthum üng ka tho be khai” ti lü axüisaw he üng a jah mtheh.<verse eid="MAT 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22"/>Pita naw akcea khü lü, “Bawipa aw, acukba käh kya khai, na khana acukba käh thawn yah khai,” ti lü Jesuh a pyen.<verse eid="MAT 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23"/>Jesuh naw nghlat law lü Pita üng, <char style="wj">“Khawyam aw, ka peia käh vea, nang hin ka kyukngtängnak vaia na kyaki ni. Isetiakyaküng, na ngaihnak hin Mhnam üngka naw lawki am ni, khyang üngka naw lawki ni,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mt 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Lk 14:27</ref></char>
    </note>Jesuh naw axüisaw he üng, <char style="wj">“Nangmi üngka mat naw ka hnu läk khaia a bü üng a hlükaw naküt hawih lü, amäta kutlamktung kawt lü na läk law se.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mt 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Lk 17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Jn 12:25</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Na sak küinak khaia na bü üng sak am yahki, cunüngpi keia phäha na sak tawn khaia na bü üng ta angsäi xünnak na yah khai,” a ti.</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26"/><char style="wj">Khyang naw khawmdeknu avan ka na lü, a ngmüimkhya xünnak am a yah üng i am ni a thawnei be thei kawm?</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:31">Mt 25:31</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 62:12">Sal 62:12</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:6">Rom 2:6</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Khyanga Capa, a pa hlüngtainak ja a khankhawngsä he am law be hnühki, khyang naküt cun khut a pawha kba jah kheng khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28"/><char style="wj">Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, “Ahin üng awmki he avang naw am thih ham u lü, Khyanga Capa Sangpuxanga kba law be se hmuh khaie,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 16:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17"/>
  <para style="s">Jesuha hmaia hngalangnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mk 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Lk 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:1-5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 1:17">2Pit 1:17</ref>,<ref loc="2PE 1:18">18</ref></char>
    </note>Amhnüp khyuk käna Jesuh naw Pita, Jakuk ja a na Johan mcunga hlüngnaka a jah cehpüi. <verse eid="MAT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2"/>Acunüng Jesuh a hmai khawnghngia mäiha vai lü, a suisak pi akvai mäiha bawk lawki. <verse eid="MAT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3"/>Acunüng axüisaw kthum naw Jesuh cun Mosi ja Elijah naw ngthuheipüi ni se ami jah hmuh. <verse eid="MAT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4"/>Acunüng Pita naw Jesuh üng, “Bawipa aw, ahia mi ve vai hin daw ve. Na hlüei üng ta, nanga phäh mat, Mosia phäh mat, Elijaha phäh mat, sam kthum ka pha vai sü,” ti lü a mtheh.<verse eid="MAT 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 22:2">Gen 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Sal 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Hesa 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mt 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mk 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Lk 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:15">Deut 18:15</ref></char>
    </note>Acukba a pyen k'um üng, khawngmei bawk naw jah msung law lü, “Hin hin ka mhläkphyanak pipia ka Capa ni, ani üng ka jeki, a pyen ngai ua” tia, kthai cun ngmei üngka naw ngjakie.<verse eid="MAT 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6"/>Axüisawe naw ami ngjak üng, aktäa kyühei u lü mce da ngmümkie. <verse eid="MAT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7"/>Jesuh naw law lü jah hnetki naw, <char style="wj">“Tho law u, käh kyüei ua,”</char> a ti. <verse eid="MAT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8"/>Ami jeng mdei üng Jesuh amät däk ve se ami hmuh.<verse eid="MAT 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9"/>Mcung üngka naw ami kyum law be üng, Jesuh naw axüisaw he üng, <char style="wj">“Khyanga Capa thihnak üngka naw am a thawh be hama küt üng nami hmuha mdannak hin u üng pi käh nami mtheh vai,”</char> ti lü, a jah cük.<verse eid="MAT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal 4:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Axüisawe naw Jesuh üng, “Acunüng ise thumksinge naw Elijah law ma khai ami ti ni? ti u se,<verse eid="MAT 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Akcanga Elijah cun law ma lü ahmäi jah pyang law khai,” a ti.</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:14">Mt 11:14</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Acunüngpi ka ning jah mthehki, Elijah cun law pängki ni. Cunsepi am ksingki he naw ami ngaih ngaiha ami mkhuimkha, acukba bäa Khyanga Capa pi mkhuimkha khaie”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13"/>Acunüng, axüisaw he naw Baptican Johana mawng jah mthehkia ami ksing.<verse eid="MAT 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khawyaia venak kpamica a mdaw be</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mk 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Lk 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14"/>Khyang hea veia ami nghlat law be üng, khyang mat Jesuha veia law lü ngdängki naw, <verse eid="MAT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15"/>“Bawipa aw, ka capa mpyeneia! Kphyaw se aläa tui üng ngcum lü am ani üng mei üng lut lü khuikha ve.” <verse eid="MAT 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16"/>“Acunakyase, na xüisawea veia ka lawpüi kyaw amimi naw pi am mdaw be khawh ve u,” a ti.<verse eid="MAT 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Jumeinak am takia khyang ksee aw, ivei nami veia ka ve khai ni? Ivei ka ning jah msawkei vai ni? Kpamica ka veia lawpüi ua,”</char> a ti. <verse eid="MAT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18"/>Jesuh naw khawyai jüi se kpamica üngka naw lut law beki. Acunja kpamica cun daw beki.<verse eid="MAT 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19"/>Acunüng axüisaw he Jesuha veia ampyua law u lü, “Ise keimi naw am kami ksät khawh ni,” ti lü ami kthäh.<verse eid="MAT 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 21:21">Mt 21:21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:23">Mk 11:23</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1Kor 13:2</ref></char>
    </note>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Nami jumeinak a ngceka phäh ni, akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, anca ui teh jumnak nami tak üng, hina mcung üng ‘Caia ngpyawta’ nami ti üng ngpyawt khai. Ai pi, am nami pawh khawh käh ve khai,” ti lü, a jah mtheh.</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21"/><char style="wj">Ahina ngkhaw cun ei jeihnak ja ktaiyünak am ni mkhüt khawh”</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">akcea cangcime naw ta ayüi 21: hin am taksih u.</char></note> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw a thih vai a pyen betü</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mk 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Lk 9:43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22"/>Kalilea ami ve üng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Khyanga Capa, khyang hea kut üng petnak vaia kcün pha lawki ni,”</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23"/><char style="wj">hnim u se, amhnüp kthum üng tho law be khai,”</char> ti lü jah mtheh se, axüisaw he aktäa vedamkie.<verse eid="MAT 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Temple khawn peta mawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 30:13">Ex 30:13</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 38:26">38:26</ref></char>
    </note>Kapenawm mlüh Jesuh ja axüisaw he ami law üng, temple khawn kawkie cun Pita veia law u lü, “Nami saja naw temple khawn am pe hlüki mä? ti lü ami kthäh.<verse eid="MAT 17:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25"/>Pita naw, “Ä, peki ni,” a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:25">Pita im k'uma a luh üng, ‘Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Sihmon Pita, ihawkba na ngaiki ni” Khawmdek Sangpuxange naw akhawn ami mkhäm üng, ua veia ni ami tä khawi? Khaw mahea veia mä, pekce khyang hea veia mä ami tä khawi?</char> a ti,<verse eid="MAT 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26"/>Pita naw, “Pekce khyang hea veia,” a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:26">Jesuh naw Pita üng, <char style="wj">“Acukba ani üng, khaw mahe naw akhawn pet vai am hlü.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27"/><char style="wj">Acunüngpi, akhawn am mi peta phäh ami mlung käh se khaia, tuia va cit lü nga va mkaiha. Akcüka na phaa nga lo lü a mka na phyen vai. Acunüng tangka mat na hmuh khai. Acun lo lü ka phäh ja na phäha temple khawn va pea,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18"/>
  <para style="s">U ja a kyäp säih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mk 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Lk 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:24">Lk 22:24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acuna k'um üng, axüisaw he a veia law u lü Jesuh üng, “U ja Khankhaw Pea a kyäp säih kawm?” ti lü ami kthäh. <verse eid="MAT 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw hnasenca mat khü lü, ami maa a ngdüihsak. <verse eid="MAT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:15">Mk 10:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:17">Lk 18:17</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, nghlat be u lü hnasena mäiha am nami ve üng Khankhaw Pe am pha hlawt uki.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4"/><char style="wj">Acunakyase, Khankhaw Pea a kyäp säih vai cun hina hnasenca mäiha a mlung mnemki ni a kyäp säih kawm.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5"/><char style="wj">“Aupi, ka ngming üng je lü hina hnasenca mäih dokhamki cun kei na dokhamki ni.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mkhyekat vaia hlawhlepnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Mk 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Lk 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6"/>
    <char style="wj">“Cunsepi, kei na jumkia hina hnasen mat, mkhyekat khaia kyukngtängsakia khyang cun a nghngü üng ksum khawp lü lia thuknak tuia xawtin hin a phäha daw bawk khai ni,” a ti.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7"/><char style="wj">Jesuh naw, “Khyang he jah mkhyekatsaki khawmdeka da se khawmdeknu hin ihlawka kyühei phyaki ni! Acuna mkhyekatnaka ngkhawe cun aläa thawn khai. Cunüngpi, mkhyekatnak vaia pawhkia khyanga phäh ihlawka kyühei phya khai ni. </char><verse eid="MAT 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:30">Mt 5:30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Na kut am a ni üng na khaw naw a ning mkhyekatsak üng, kyükin lü xawtin kawpi. Na kut khaw küm se angsäia mulaia ning xawtina kdama ta, na kut khaw kaa angsäi xünnaka na ceh hin daw bawki ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:29">Mt 5:29</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Acunkäna na mik naw a ning mkhyekatsak üng, kawihin lü xawtin kawpi. Na mik küm se mulaia ning xawtina kdama ta, na mik mat däng am angdäi xünnaka na ceh hin kyäp bawki ni.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khyükia Tawca am msuimcäpnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Lk 15:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ahina hnasenca he käh jah hmuhmsit ua. Ami khankhawngsä he cun ka pa vei khankhawa awmki he ni, ti ka ning jah mthehki.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 19:10">Lk 19:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Isetiüng ta, khyanga Capa hin khyükie jah thawngkhyah khaia lawki ni</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">18:11: </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">akhäka cangcime naw ta ayüi 11: hin am yuksih u.</char>
    </note>.<verse eid="MAT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ihawkba ni nami ngaih? Khyang mat naw toca aphya a tak üngka mat khyük se i pawh khai ni? A taw kawkip ja kaw jah hawih hüt lü khyükia taw mat sui khaia mcunga cit khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13"/><char style="wj">Acun a hmuh be üng, veki kawkip ja kawa kthaka pi acuna khyüki mat a hmuh bea phäha aktäa jeki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14"/><char style="wj">Acukba kunga</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:14: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amsah cangcime naw taki he.</char></note>,<char style="wj">hina hnasenca he üngka matca pi amdanga a khyüh vaia nami pa khana ka naw am hlüei.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Na bena naw a ning mkhyekatnak üng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 17:3">Lk 17:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Na bena naw a ning mkhyekatnak üng</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">18:15 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">cangcim avang naw </char>
      <char style="fp" closed="false">“a ning mkhyekatnak üng” am ta u</char>
    </note>, <char style="wj">a veia cet lü a mkhyekatnak nanimäta ksinga a mkhyenak na mtheh vai, na mtheh a ngjak üng na mkhüta kyaki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Deut 19:15</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Acunüngpi na mtheh am a ngjak üng, a mkhyekatnak angsingnak ksing khaia khyang nghngih mat bang jah cehpüi lü na ceh vai. Cangcim naw “Mkhyekatnak naküt üng saksiki nghngih kthum ve yah khai” a tia kba na pawh vai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17"/><char style="wj">Acunüng, acun hea pyen pi am a jah ngaih üng, avana sangcim üng nami sang vai. Akpäihnaka sangcima pyen pi am a ngaihsim üng khyang k'yu ja akhawnkawka nami ngaih vai.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:19">Mt 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:23">Jn 20:23</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, khawmdek khana nami mhlät naküt cun khankhawa pi mhläta kya khai, khawmdek khana am nami mhlät naküt cun khankhawa pi mhläta am kya.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19"/>
    <char style="wj">Ka ning jah mtheh betüki, khawmdek khana aipi nghngih naw atänga ngaisim ni lü nani täsam üng, nani täsam naküt cun ka Pa khankhawa ka naw ning jah pawh pet khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20"/><char style="wj">“Ahawia pi, nghngih kthum ka ngming üng ngcun u lü ami ve üng ami ksunga kei ka veki,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mpyeneinak am takia mpya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:21,22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 17:3">Lk 17:3</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:4">4</ref></char>
    </note>Acunüng, Pita Jesuha veia law lü, “Bawipa aw, ka bena naw a na mkhyekatnak üng ivei ka mhlät vai ni? Khyüh vei aw?” ti se,<verse eid="MAT 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 4:24">Gen 4:24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Khyüh vei am ni, khyühkip ja khyüh vei na mhlät vai,”</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:22: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Khyühkip cima khyüh vei, am ani üng </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Khyühkip ja khyüh vei</char></note> a ti. <verse eid="MAT 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23"/><char style="wj">Acunakyase, Khankhaw Pe cun Sangpuxang mat a mpyaea pupawng ngui jah bükteng lawki üng tängki ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24"/><char style="wj">Acukba a jah teng law üng ngui tan xa k’hläih lei naki mat cun a veia ami lawpüi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25"/><char style="wj">Ngui a pu am thung be hlawt se Sangpuxang naw man lü amät mpyaa jawi lü,a khyuca he ja a khawhkhyam naküt pi jah jawisih lü, a lei ami thung vaia a jah mtheh.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26"/><char style="wj">Acuna mpya cun Sangpuxanga maa a mkhuk am ngdäng lü, “Ka Bawipa aw, na bä ni, na msawkei canga,” avan ka ning thung law be khai ni,” a ti.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27"/><char style="wj">Sangpuxang naw mpyenei lü hläh be lü a lei naküt avan pi a mhlät.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28"/>
    <char style="wj">Acunüng, acuna mpya cun cit lü a püi mpyae üngka mat, ngui api a kpu a va hmuh. Man lü “Na pu na thung law bea” ti lü a k'aw üng a kbüh.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29"/><char style="wj">A püi mpya naw a mkhuk am ngdäng lü, “Na mpyenei lü, na msawk canga, ka ning thung law be päih khai ni,” ti lü, a nghuinak.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30"/><char style="wj">Cunsepi, käh mpyenei lü am a thung be khawh vei thawng im üng a khyum.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31"/><char style="wj">Acun cun mpya kce he naw ami hmuh üng aktäa ami mlung na se, Sangpuxang üng acuna mawng cun ami va mtheh u.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32"/><char style="wj">Acunüng ami Sangpuxang naw khü lü, “Ia am na mawngki nang khyang kse, na nghui naki se na lei naküt ka ning mhlät.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33"/><char style="wj">Ka ning mhläta mäiha mpyeneinak na püi mpyaa khana pi na tak vai sü.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34"/><char style="wj">Sangpuxang thüi lawki naw a mpya cun a lei naküt am a thung be khawh veia thawngim üng a khyum. </char><verse eid="MAT 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35"/>
    <char style="wj">Acukba bäa, khyang naküt naw nami mlungmthin kcang am nami benaa mkhyekatnak am nami mhlät üng khankhawa kaa Ka Pa naw pi nami mkhyekatnak am ning jah mhlät khai ni,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 18:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19"/>
  <para style="s">Ngtainaka mawng mtheinak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mk 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1"/>Jesuh ngthu a pyen päng ja Kalile üngka naw cit lü Jordan mliktuia caye Judah khawa citki. <verse eid="MAT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2"/>Khyangpänu naw läk law u se Jesuh naw acuia a jah mdaw be.<verse eid="MAT 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3"/>Pharise he a veia law u lü ami mhnüteinak am, “Khyang mat naw a khyu ia phäha pi ni se a hlüeia kcün üng a hawih vai hin mi thum üng nglawiki aw?” ti lü ami kthäh.<verse eid="MAT 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 1:27">Gen 1:27</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 5:2">5:2</ref></char>
    </note>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Akcüka jah mhnünki naw kpami ja nghnumi a jah mhnün ti hin am nami khe khawikie aw?”</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Gen 2:24</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Pamhnam naw ‘Kpami naw a nu ja pa jah ceh ta lü a khyua vei ngdawn se nghngih xawi cun mtisa mata kya law khai xawi’ a ti.</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6"/><char style="wj">Acunkäna, nghngiha am ni ti ni, mata kyaki. Acunakyase, Pamhnam naw a jah lu hlin khawsawm cun khyang naw käh jah mtai se,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 24:1-4">Deut 24:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31">Mt 5:31</ref></char>
    </note>Pharise he naw, “Am ani üng ivaia Mosi naw ngkyanaka kca pe u lü hawih vaia a jah mtheh ni,” ami ti.<verse eid="MAT 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Nami mlungmthin nghlang lü mtheh am ngja uki se, Mosi naw nami khyu nami hawih vaia a ning jah mtheh ni. Cunüngpi a jah mhnünceng üng acukba am ni” a ti.</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mt 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10">1Kor 7:10</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 7:11">11</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Acunüng Jesuh naw, “Ka ning jah mthehki, aupi a khyu kpami kce am käh bäühma ni se akcea phäha hawih lü, khyu mah beki cun mkhyeki ni, acuna nghnumi khyu na beki pi mkhyekatki ni,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10"/>Acunüng axüisaw he naw, “Acukba ani üng ta am khyu mah üng ni a daw hlü bawk ve,” ami ti.<verse eid="MAT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ahina ngthu cun khyang naküt naw am ngaisim u. Acunüngpi, ngaisim khai hea a jah xü naw ni a mi ngaihsim hlü ve.</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12"/><char style="wj">Avang cun a nua puk'um üngka naw käh khyuca mah khai hea a jah mhnün, avang cun khyang naw käh khyuca mah khaia ami jah pyang, avange cun Khankhaw Pea phäh animät käh khyuca mah khai hea nghnüneikie, aupi khyuca mah khaia tängki naw ngaisim se,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw hnasene dawkyanak jah petki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mk 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Lk 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13"/>Jesuh naw Hnasenea khana a kut mtaih lü a jah ktaiyü pet vaia a veia jah lawpüi u se, axüisaw he naw ami jah ksenak. <verse eid="MAT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Hnasene ka veia law u se, käh jah mah ua, Khankhaw Pe cun amimia mäiha phäh ni,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15"/>Jesuh naw hnasenea khana a kut mtaih lü acunkäna akcea citki.<verse eid="MAT 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bawimangki cawngpyang mat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mk 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Lk 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16"/>Khyang mat law lü, “Saja aw, khankhawa angsäi xünnak ka yah vaia akdaw i ja ka pawh kawm?” ti se,<verse eid="MAT 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“I dawki ti ivai na na kthähki ni? Dawki ta mat däk ni a ve. Angsäi xünnak na yah hlü üng ngthumkhäne jah läklama”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:13">Ex 20:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">Deut 5:17</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:14">Ex 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Deut 5:18</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:15">Ex 20:15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:19">Deut 5:19</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:16">Ex 20:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:20">Deut 5:20</ref> </char>
    </note>Cawngpyang naw, “Ia ngthumkhäne ni? a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 19:18">Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Khyang käh na hnim vai, khyanga khyuca käh na mkhyekatnak vai, käh na mpyuk vai, käh na hleihlak vai,”</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Ex 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Deut 5:16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Na nu ja na pa na jah leisawng vai, namät naw namät na jawngnaka mäiha na impei loceng na jawngnak vai,”</char> a ti,<verse eid="MAT 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20"/>Cawngpyang naw, “Ahin he cun ka dikca üngkhyüh ka jah läk päih ni, i ka pawh ham khai ni?” a ti.<verse eid="MAT 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21"/>Jesuh naw, “Na kümkawi vai na ngai üng, cit lü na tak naküt jawi lü sih mpyaki he üng ngui na jah yet vai. Acunüng khana na khawh vai ve khai, acunkäna na läk law kawpi,” a ti.<verse eid="MAT 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22"/>Cawngpyang naw acun a ngjak üng, pukse lü akcea citeiki. Isetiüng ani cun bawimangkia kyaki.<verse eid="MAT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw axüisaw he üng, <char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, bawimangki hin Khankhaw Pe a luh vai aktäa küi ve,”</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24"/><char style="wj">Bawimangki Pamhnama Khaw a luha kthaka ta sanghngüksaü mpyüma nghnga khuia a luh vai jä bawki ni,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25"/>Axüisawe naw ami ngjak üng aktäa müncan u lü, “Acunüng u naw küikyannak yah khawh khai ni?” ti lü ngthähkie.<verse eid="MAT 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26"/>Jesuh naw jah teng lü, <char style="wj">“Ahin cun khyanga phäha i am thawn thei lü pi Pamhnama phäha am thawn theiki am ve”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27"/>Acunüng Pita naw, “Tenga ahmäi naküt hawih lü kami ning läk lawki, kami ning läk law phäha i kami ngmangnak khai ni?” a ti.<verse eid="MAT 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 25:31">Mt 25:31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:30">Lk 22:30</ref></char>
    </note>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, Tuha Khyanga Capa amäta hlüngtainak ja a bawingawhnak üng a ngawh law üng, nami na läk hlükie pi bawingawhnak xaleinghngih üng ngaw hnga u lü, Isarel paca xaleinghngih nami jah uk khai,”</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29"/><char style="wj">Aupi keia ngminga phäh a ima pi kyase, a bena cinae pi kyase, a nu pa pi kyase, a ca hea pi kyase, a khawmdeka pi kyase, jah ceh taki cun acun kän cima aphya kthaka yah be lü, angsäi xünnak pi yah khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:16">Mt 20:16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:30">Lk 13:30</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Acunsepi akmae hnu u lü akhnuae ma law khaie,” ti lü a jah mtheh.</char><verse eid="MAT 19:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20"/>
  <para style="s">Capyit ngvawnga nghlawhkie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1"/>
    <char style="wj">Khankhaw Pe cun capyit ngvawng taki khyang mat am tängki ni. Ngawi mat üng a ngvawnga nghlawh khaie a jah ngvah vai sui hüki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2"/><char style="wj">Mhnüp at üng tangka mat hlawhei khaia khyang he jah hmuh lü a capyit ngvawnga a jah tüih.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3"/><char style="wj">Khawpyanga va cit hü lü ngnam k'uma amdanga veeikie jah va hmuh lü,</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4"/><char style="wj">“Nangmi pi ka capyit ngvawnga cit lü va nghlawh hnga ua, ka ning jah khyeng khai,” ti se, citkie.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5"/><char style="wj">Naji xaleinghngih mhnüpngsung ja mkeng naji kthum üng va cit lü pi acukba bäa jah va hmuh lü a ngvawnga a jah nghlawhsak.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6"/><char style="wj">Acunüng naji mhma bang üng pi va cit hü lü amdamnga veeikie a jah hmuh üng, “Ivaia ahikba amdanga nami veeikie ni?” a ti.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7"/><char style="wj">Acun he naw, “Jah ngvatki u am ve se va,” ami ti, acunüng ngvawngmah naw “Nangmi pi ngvawnga cit lü va nghlawh hnga ua” a ti. </char><verse eid="MAT 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:13">Lev 19:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 24:15">Deut 24:15</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Acunüng khaw a mü law üng, ngvawngmah naw a lo ngängki üng, “Nghlawhkie ami van jah khü lü, anghnu säih üng cutei lü akma säih üng dütkia kami ngkheng jah pea,” a ti.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9"/><char style="wj">Acunüng, mülam naji mhma üng cuteikie cun law u lü, ami khüi khen tangka mat ci do lawki he.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10"/><char style="wj">Khüi makie cun law u lü khawhah yah khai hea ngai u se pi acukba bäa tangka mat ci däk yah hngakie.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11"/><char style="wj">Acukba tangka mat däk ci ami do law hnga üng ngvawngmaha veia mtai law u lü,</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12"/><char style="wj">“Anghnua lawki hine naji mat däk va khüikie, amhnüpa khawngling khamei lü kami khüikie am angteha na jah kheng,” ami ti.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13"/><char style="wj">Ngvawngmah naw mat üng, “Ngaia ka püi, am ning mhlei nawng. Mhnüp mat khüi lü tangka mat hlawhei vai na jumki cen ta.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14"/><char style="wj">Na ka ceh lü na ima cita. Hina anghnua lawki he üng pi nang üng ka pet kän ka pe hlüki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15"/><char style="wj">Ka ngui cun kamäta ngjak hlüa am ka pawh thei khai aw? Käh ngvang na lü ka ning jah peta phäh na na mkeiki aw? </char><verse eid="MAT 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 19:30">Mt 19:30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:31">Mk 10:31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:30">Lk 13:30</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Acunakyase, akmae hnu u lü, hnukie hma law khaie” </char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw a thih vai akthum veinak pyenki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mk 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Lk 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17"/>Jesuh Jerusalem da cit lü axüisaw he xaleinghngih lam peia jah khü lü, <verse eid="MAT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18"/><char style="wj">“Ngai ua, Jerusalem da mi cit khai, acuia Khyanga Capa cun ktaiyü he ja thumksingea kut üng msuma kya khai. Amimi naw thi khaia mkatei khaie.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19"/><char style="wj">Khyanga Capa cun yaihei u lü, kpai acun he, kutlamktung üng ami hnim vaia khyang mjü kce hea kut üng msum acun he. Acunüngpi amhnüp kthum üng tho be khai,”</char> ti lü a jah mtheh.<verse eid="MAT 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nu mata nghuinak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Mk 10:35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20"/>Acunüng, Zebedea khyu, a cakpa xawi maha Jesuha veia lawki. A mkhuk üng ngdäng lü iyaw täeiki.<verse eid="MAT 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“I ja na ngjak hlü?”</char> a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:21">Nghnumi naw, “Hina ka cakpa xawi, Sangpuxanga na thawn law üng, mat na khet da, mat na kcawng da ngaw khai xawia bekhüt na pea,” a ti.<verse eid="MAT 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“I nami tä hman am ksing niki. Ka awk law vaia khawt, nani aw khawh khai aw? Baptican ka khan law vai, nani khan khawh khai aw?”</char> ti se,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:22">“Ä, yah khai,” ani ti.<verse eid="MAT 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ka awk vaia khawt na awk khawh üng pi, ka khet da ja kcawng da nani ngawh vai cun keia xü thei am ni. Ahina ngawhnak cun ka Pa naw a jah xüea phäha kyaki ni,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24"/>Axüisawe xa naw ami ngjak üng, acuna ngbengna xawi cun jah thüinakie. <verse eid="MAT 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:25,26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:25">Lk 22:25</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:26">26</ref></char></note>Jesuh naw axüisaw he alanga jah khü lü, <char style="wj">“Nami ksinga mäiha, khyang mjü kce hea bawie cun khyang hea khana aktäa bawi u lü, aktäa ami ana sumeikie.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:26,27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mt 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mk 9:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Lk 22:26</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Cunsepi, ahina mäih nangmi üng käh ve se, nangmi üngka mat a kyäp säih vai ngja hlüki ta nami mpyaa kya se.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27"/><char style="wj">Nangmi üngka mat akma säih vai ngja hlüki ta nami mpyaa thawn se.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28"/><char style="wj">Khyanga Capa cun khyanga khüih vaia am law; khyang khüih lü a xünnak jah pe lü khyang khawkän jah thawng khaia a lawa mäiha, nami ve vai,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="MAT 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amikmü nghngih a jah mdaw be</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mk 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Lk 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29"/>Jesuh ja axüisaw he Jerikho mlüh üngka naw ami ceh üng khyangpänu naw jah läki he. <verse eid="MAT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30"/>Amikmüki nghngih lam peia ngawhki xawi naw Jesuh lam üng citki tia ani ngjak üng ngpyang ni lü, “Davita Capa, Bawipa aw, jah mpyeneia,” ti lü ngpyangki xawi.<verse eid="MAT 20:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31"/>Khyangpänu naw käh ani ngpyang ti vaia jah mtheh u sepi, aksetama, “Davita Capa, Bawipa aw, jah mpyeneia,” ti lü ngpyang dämdämki xawi.<verse eid="MAT 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32"/>Jesuh naw ngdüi lü, <char style="wj">“I ka ning jah pawh pet vai ni nani hlüei,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 20:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33"/>Anini naw, “Bawipa aw, kani mika vai be vai ngaih ve ning,” ani ti.<verse eid="MAT 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34"/>Jesuh naw jah mpyenei lü ani mik a jah hneh pet. Acunja ani mik vai law be se, Jesuh läki xawi.<verse eid="MAT 20:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21"/>
  <para style="s">Hlüngtainak am Jerusalem lutki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mk 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Lk 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Jn 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1"/>Jesuh ja axüisaw he Jerusalema law u lü Olip mcung, Betphake<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:1: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ahin cun khyang 50-150 bang vekia ngnam/mlüha kyaki. Bethanih mlüh pei, Jerusalem üngka naw 1.6 kilometer thuki.</char></note> ngnam ami pha law üng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Axüisaw xawi nghngih maa jah na tüih lü,</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2"/><char style="wj">nani maa vekia ngnama cit ni lü, sanghngaksaü mat ja, a ca ami jah kphung nani hmuh khai. Jah sut ni lü ka veia nani jah lawpüi vai.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3"/><char style="wj">Khyang naw a ning jah kthäh üng, “Bawipa</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:3: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kamah </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Angvai ti lü sumkie </char></note><char style="wj">naw jah hlüei ve,” nani ti vai. Acunüng angxita ning jah tüih law khai ni,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4"/>Ahin avan cun sahma naw a na pyen law,<verse eid="MAT 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zakh 9:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Zion mlüh üng mtheh ua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">Tenga, na Sangpuxang na veia law ve!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">Ani cun a mlung nem lü sanghngaksaü,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">ja sanghngaksaüca xawia khana ngcumki,” ti akümkawinak vaia kyaki.<verse eid="MAT 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6"/>Acunüng, axüisaw xawi naw cit ni lü, Jesuh naw a jah mtheha mäiha ani va pawh. <verse eid="MAT 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7"/>Sanghngaksaü ja a ca cun jah lawpüi u lü, ami suisake a khana jah mtaikie naw, Jesuh cun a khana ami ngawhsak. <verse eid="MAT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8"/>Khyangpänu naw ami suisak lama ami jah phah üng, avang naw nghleng hnahe jah ksawm u lü jah phahkie. <verse eid="MAT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25">Sal 118:25</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 118:26">26</ref></char></note>Khyangpä a ma a na citkie ja amät läki he naw, “Hosana Davita Capa, Bawipa ngming am lawki josennak be se! A hlüngnak säih khankhawa Hosana,” ti lü, ngpyangkie.<verse eid="MAT 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10"/>Jerusalem a pha law üng, mlüh üngka ami van üicai u lü, “Ani u ni?” ti lü pyenkie.<verse eid="MAT 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11"/>Khyangpänu naw, “Hin cun sahma Jesuh, Kalile hne, Nazaret mlüh üngka ni,” ami ti.<verse eid="MAT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Temple k'uma Jesuh lutki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mk 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Lk 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Jn 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12"/>Jesuh Temple k'uma lut lü Temple k’uma jawitukie ja kheikie jah sät lü tangka mhlaikie ja müm jawikiea ngawhnake, avan a jah hukxänin. <verse eid="MAT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Hesa 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Jer 7:11</ref></char></note>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Cangcim üng, ‘Ka im cun ktaiyünak ima sui khaie’ ti lü ng’yuki, nangmi naw mpyukeiea ngthupnak ima pyang ve uki” </char>a ti.<verse eid="MAT 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14"/>Amikmü ja akxoe, temple k'uma law u se Jesuh naw a jah mdaw be. <verse eid="MAT 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15"/>Ktaiyü ngvaie ja Thum mtheie naw müncanksee a pawhmsah ja, hnasene naw, “Hosana Davita Capa,” ti lü, ami ngpyang hmuh u lü aktäa ami mlung soki.<verse eid="MAT 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 8:2">Sal 8:2</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note>Jesuh üng, “Amimi naw i pyenkie ti na jah ngjaki aw?” ami ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ä, hnasene ja cihtui k’aw naca hea mpyawng üng mhlünmtainak na yahki ni,” ti lü ng’yuki am nami khe khawiki aw?” </char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17"/>Jesuh naw jah hawih hüt lü Bethanih mlüha cit lü acuna mthan cun acuia ipki.<verse eid="MAT 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw kthei thing a yünce</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mk 11:12-14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18"/>Ngawilama mlüh da a nghlat law be üng, a ei ngaih lawki. <verse eid="MAT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19"/>Kthei thing lam peia hmu lü kthei thing da cit kyawki, am ngthei lü a hnah däk ve se a hmuh. <char style="wj">“Käh ngthei ti sümsüm kawpi,”</char> ti se, acunüng kthei thing cun ngjai lü thiei lawki.<verse eid="MAT 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20"/>Axüisawe naw acun ami hmuh üng, “Ihawkba Fik dung akjangnua khyawngei lawki ni?” ti lü müncankie.<verse eid="MAT 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mt 17:20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1Kor 13:2</ref></char>
    </note>Jesuh naw jah msang lü, <char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, jumei kcang lü mlung hlawthlatnak am nami tak üng hina Fikdung däk am ni lü, hina mcung üng, ‘Hin üngka naw ngnawn lü mliktuia kya se’ nami ti üng nami tia mäiha kya khai.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22"/><char style="wj">Nami jumei üng nami täsam naküt nami yah khai,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuha Ana mawng ngthähnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mk 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Lk 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23"/>Templea law be lü a jah mthei k'um üng, ktaiyü ngvaie ja a xüe a veia law u lü, “Ahin he jah pawh vaia ia ana ja na tak? U naw ahin he na jah pawhak vai ana a ning pet ja?” ti lü ami kthäh.<verse eid="MAT 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24"/>Jesuh naw jah msang lü, <char style="wj">“Kei pi mat däk ka ning jah kthäh khai. Nami na msang üng, kei naw pi ahin he ka jah pawhnak vaia ia ana ka tak cun ka ning jah mtheh khai.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25"/><char style="wj">Johana a baptican hin hawia khyüh lawki ni? Pamhnam üngkhyüh mä. Khyang üngkhyüh mä”</char> a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Amimäte naw ngcuh u lü, “I mi ti khai ni. Pamhnam üngka naw ni” mi ti üng mä, “Ise Johan am nami kcangnaki ni,” ti hlü kbak. <verse eid="MAT 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26"/>“Khyang üngka naw” mi ti üng pi khyang he naw i ami pawh vai ti kyühei phyaki. Isetiüng, khyang avan naw Johan cun sahma mat ti ksingki he,” ami ti. <verse eid="MAT 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27"/>Jesuh üng, “Am ksing ve u nawng,” ami ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Kei pi ia ana am ka pawh ti am ning jah mtheh hlü veng,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Capa nghngih am msuimcäpnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ihawkba nami ngaiki ni? Ahlana nghngih canaki khyang mat veki. Akdäma veia cit lü, “Ka ca aw, tuhngawi ngvawnga cit lü va khüia,” a ti.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29"/><char style="wj">A ca naw, “Kaa! am cit hlü veng,” a ti kyaw, akäna a mlung nglat law be lü citki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30"/><char style="wj">Acunüng anghngihnaka veia cit lü acukba bäa a mtheh. Ani naw, “Ä ja, cit kawng,” ti lü am cit.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31"/><char style="wj">Ahin xawi üng u naw ni a paa ngjakhlü a pawh?”</char> a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Amimi naw, “Akdäm ni,” ami ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, akhawnkawke ja nghnumi ksee nami maa Pamhnama Khawa lut ve u.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:12">Lk 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:29">7:29</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 7:30">30</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Isetiüng ta Baptican Johan lam kdaw ning jah mhnuh khaia law se am jumei uki; cunsepi, akhawnkawke ja nghnumi ksee naw ani jumkie. Acun nami hmuh käna pi ngjut lü am jum uki,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="MAT 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngvawng ngängkie am msuimcäpnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mk 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Lk 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:1">Hesa 5:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 5:2">2</ref></char>
    </note> Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Msuimcäpnak akce ngai betü ua: khyang mat ngvawngmah veki, acun naw capyit ngvawng pyang lü ngvawng lü capyittui suinak vai khui co lü, ngängnak vai kyäng a sak. Khüikie üng jah khah lü athuknaka khaw kcea kdungki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34"/><char style="wj">Capyit angtheih lawa kcün üng, amäta hama capyit ngthei kbit khai hea a mpyae ngvawng ngängkiea veia a jah tüih.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35"/><char style="wj">Ngvawng ngängkie naw ngvawngmaha a mpyae jah man u lü mat ami kpaih, mat ami hnim, mat lung am ami vawih.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36"/><char style="wj">Acunüng ngvawngmah naw akcüka kaa kthak nungkia, a mpya kce he a jah tüih betü. Acunsepi acukba kunga ami jah na pawh betü.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37"/><char style="wj">Akpäihnaka amäta ca, “Ahin ta leisawng khaie ni, am pawh hngaläk u” ti lü a tüih betü.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38"/><char style="wj">Cunsepi ngvawng ngänge naw ami hmuh üng, “Hin hin ngvawngmaha ca va ni kbak. Law ua mi hnim lü a khawh mi bi vai u,” ti u lü,</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39"/><char style="wj">man lü ngvawng kpunga xawt lü ami hnimin u. </char><verse eid="MAT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40"/>
    <char style="wj">“Tuh ta ngvawngmah a law üng, ngvawng ngängkie cun ihawkba jah pawh khai ni?”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 21:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41"/>Msang u lü, “Acuna khyang ksee cun jah hnim khaia ngsing ve. Ngvawng pi capyit angthei law kcün üng, tha law khai hea khyang kce he üng jah khah khai,” ami ti.<verse eid="MAT 21:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:42: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:22">Sal 118:22</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 118:23">23</ref></char>
    </note>Jesuh naw <char style="wj">“Cangcim naw a pyen am nami khe khawikie aw? </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="wj">“Imksae naw am daw se ami hawiha lung cen, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="wj">akdaw säih lunga thawn law khawiki. </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="wj">Ahin cun Bawipa naw a pawha kyaki, ahin cun müncan vaia kyaki, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="wj">ihlawka müncan phyaki ni!” </char><verse eid="MAT 21:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43"/>
    <char style="wj">Acunakyase, ka ning jah mthehki, “Pamhnama Khaw ning jah hut lü ngtheisak pungpyahsak khaia khyang he üng jah pet vai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44"/><char style="wj">“Aupi, hina lung üng kyaki cun khuikhaiei khaia bo vai. Ahina lung naw a kyaknak cun mput khuia thawn khai,”</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:44: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ahina cayüi hin amsaha caupe naw am yuksih u.</char></note> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 21:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45"/>Ktaiyü ngvaie ja Pharise he naw acuna msuimcäpnak cun ami ngjak üng, amimi a jah tinak ti ksingki he. <verse eid="MAT 21:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46"/>Acunüng, man khai hea ami bü. Cunsepi Jesuh cun sahma tia jumeikia khyangpänu ami jah kyüh.<verse eid="MAT 21:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22"/>
  <para style="s">Cambumnak pawi am msuimcäpnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Lk 14:15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1"/>Jesuh naw msuimcäpnake am khyang he üng a jah mtheh betü. <verse eid="MAT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2"/><char style="wj">“Khankhaw Pe cun a capaa phäh cambum khaia ngtünki Sangpuxang mat am tängki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3"/><char style="wj">“Cambumnaka law lü buh pawi bükei law khai khine jah khü khai hea a mpyae a jah tüih, cunsepi, am law hlü u.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, a mpya kce he jah tüih betü lü, “Müei vai pyang päng ni, ka semce ja khyükseie akthaü säih jah hnim veng, ahmäi küm päng ve, cambumnaka law ua,” ti lü khine üng jah mtheh u bä’ a ti.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5"/><char style="wj">“Cunsepi, khine naw käh cuhlihei u lü animäta khut pawh khaia citei hükie: mat a loa cit lü, mat betü kdungei hüki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6"/><char style="wj">Avang naw Sangpuxanga mpyae jah man u lü jah kpai lü ami jah hnim u.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7"/><char style="wj">“Acun Sangpuxang naw a ngjak üng thüi lü a yekape a jah tüih. A mpyae jah hnimkie cun ami van jah hnim lü ami mlüh pi mei am a jah mkhih pet.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8"/><char style="wj">Acunkäna a mpyae jah khü lü, ‘Cambumnak pyang päng ni, cunsepi, jah cükeia khyang he ei khaia am ngkawih ve u.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9"/><char style="wj">‘Tuh ta lamnuea cit hü u lü nami hmuh naküt jah va khü hü ua’ a ti.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10"/><char style="wj">Acunüng, a mpyae cun lam naküt üng cit hü u lü, ami hmuh naküt akdaw akse jah mkhäm lü jah lawpüi u se, cambumnaka im cun khin am beki. </char><verse eid="MAT 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sangpuxang cun khine jah bükteng khaia im k’uma a law üng, khin mat cambumnak suisak am jihki a hmuh.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12"/><char style="wj">“Sangpuxang naw, ‘Ka püi aw, ihawkba, cambumnaka suisak am jih lü na lawki ni?’ a ti. Cunsepi acuna khyang naw i pi am ti be.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:12">Mt 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25:30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:28">Lk 13:28</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Acunüng, Sangpuxang naw a mpyae üng, ‘A kutkhawe jah pinpawk lü anghmüpnaka xawt ua. Acuia a mni cui hakyetnak am kyap khai’ a ti. </char><verse eid="MAT 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14"/>
    <char style="wj">“Jesuh naw, “Khüa khyang da kyaw lüpi xüa khyang ngcek ve”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Akhawn pet vai ja käh pet vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mk 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Lk 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15"/>Acunüng, Pharise he naw a ngthähnak am Jesuh man vaia lam sui lü cengkie. <verse eid="MAT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16"/>Pharise he naw ami hnukläke avang ja Heroda hnukläke avang Jesuha veia jah tüih u lü, “Saja aw, nang cun akcang na pyenki ti kami ksingki. Akce he naw ihawkba ngai khaie ti käh cäi na lü, Pamhnam naw khyang he a jah ngjak hlüa mawng khyüngtak na jah mtheiki. Isetiüng nang cun naw ua mikhmai pi am tengki. <verse eid="MAT 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17"/>“Ihawkba na ngaih jah mtheha? Mi thum naw Empero üng akhawn pet vai hin nglawiki aw, am nglawiki aw?” ami ti.<verse eid="MAT 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18"/>Acunsepi, Jesuh naw ami ngneikse jah ksing lü, <char style="wj">“Hypocrite aw, ise nami na mhnüteikie ni? </char><verse eid="MAT 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19"/>
    <char style="wj">“Akhawn ngui hawia ni? Na mhnuh ua”</char> a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:19">Acunüng tangka mat a veia ami lawpüi. <verse eid="MAT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Hin hin ua lup ja ua ngming ni a ve?”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21"/>“Empero ni,” ami ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:21">Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Acukba ani üng, Empero üng sängeiki Empero üng pe ua, Pamhnam üng sängeiki Pamhnam üng pe ua,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22"/>Acun ami ngjak üng, müncan u lü akcea ami ceh tak.<verse eid="MAT 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Thihnak üngkhyüh thawh be ngthähnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mk 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Lk 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:8">Ngs 23:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acuna mhnüp üng, khyang kthi am tho be khawi u tiki Sadukee avang Jesuha veia lawki he. <verse eid="MAT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Deut 25:5</ref></char></note>“Saja aw! Mosi naw khyang mat am ca lü a thih üng, a na naw khäm be lü a casak vai. Acunüng akthia caa ngai vai,” a ti ni. <verse eid="MAT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25"/>“Tuh a bena khyüh xüngkie, a khyu hmeinu cun a na naw a khäm be. <verse eid="MAT 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26"/>“Acukba bäa anghngihnak ja akthumnak pi am ca u lü, akhyühnak cäpa thih päihkie. <verse eid="MAT 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27"/>“Akdüta acuna nghnumi pi thiki. <verse eid="MAT 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28"/>“Acunakyase, thikie ami thawh law bea mhnüp üng, acuna nghnumi cun ngbengna khyüh üng ua khyua kya khai ni? Angtu naw ami khyunak” ti lü ami kthäh.<verse eid="MAT 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29"/>Jesuh naw jah msang lü, <char style="wj">“Nami mkhyekie ni! Cangcim ja Pamhnama khyaihbahnak am nami ksinga phäh ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30"/><char style="wj">“Akthie ami thawh law bea mhnüp üng, amimi cun khankhawa khankhawngsä hea mäiha am ngkhyungla ti u.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31"/><char style="wj">“Pamhnam naw nami veia akthiea thawhnak bea mawng a pyen am nami khe khawikie aw?</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Ex 3:6</ref></char></note><char style="wj">‘Kei Abrahama Pamhnam, Isaka Pamhnam, Jakopa Pamhnam’ Pamhnam cun akthiea Pamhnama am ni, akxüngea Pamhnam ni,”</char> ti lü, a jah mtheh.<verse eid="MAT 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33"/>Acun khyangpäe naw ami ngjak üng, a jah mtheimthang cun müncan nakie.<verse eid="MAT 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngthupet akü säih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mk 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Lk 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34"/>Acunüng, Sadukee jah mkhütki ti, Pharise he naw ami ksing üng alanga ngcun law u lü, <verse eid="MAT 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:35-40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Lk 10:25-28</ref></char></note>ami ksung üngka mat, thum ksingki naw kthähnak üng man vaia ngtängki. <verse eid="MAT 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36"/>“Saja aw, i ni Mosia thum üng akü säiha ngthupet cun?” a ti.<verse eid="MAT 22:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:5">Deut 6:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Na Bawipa Pamhnam cun na mlung avan, na ngmüimkhya avan, ja na ksingnak avan am na mhläkphyanak vai.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38"/><char style="wj">“Ahin cun akdäm säih ja akü säiha ngthupeta kyaki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Anghngihnak cun: ‘Na impei loceng namät na kphyanaka mäiha na kphyanak vai.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40"/><char style="wj">“Ahina ngthupet nghngih üng Mosia thum naküt ja sahma hea mtheimthang naküt avan phungki ni,”</char> ti lü a jah mtheh.<verse eid="MAT 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khritawa mawng ngthähnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mk 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Lk 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41"/>Acunüng, Pharise he avang ami ngcun law üng Jesuh naw jah kthähki. <verse eid="MAT 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42"/><char style="wj">“Mesijah hin ia ni nami ngaih? Ua ksawn üngka ni?”</char> a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">“Ani cun Davita ksawn üngka ni,” ti lü ami msang.<verse eid="MAT 22:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43"/>‘Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ise ngmüimkhya naw Davit üng “Khritaw cun Bawipa aw” ti lü a khüsak?” Davit naw pyen lü, </char><verse eid="MAT 22:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:44: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sal 110:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">‘Bawipa naw ka bawipa üng a mtheh ta: </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">
    <char style="wj">ka khet da ngawa </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">
    <char style="wj">na yee na khawa kea am ka jah taka küt üng” a ti. </char><verse eid="MAT 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45"/>
    <char style="wj">“Davit naw Khritaw üng Bawipa ti lü a khü üng, ihawkba Mesijah cun Davita ksawn thei vai ni?”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 22:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46"/>U naw pi ngthu mkhap matca am pi am msang be u. Acuna mhnüp üngka naw cutei lü u naw i pi am kthäh ti u.<verse eid="MAT 22:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23"/>
  <para style="s">Pharise he ja Thumksinge jah cäieinak vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Mk 12:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Lk 11:43</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw axüisaw he ja khyangpäe jah mthehki. <verse eid="MAT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2"/><char style="wj">“Thum mtheie ja Pharise he Mosia ngawhnak üng ngawkie.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3"/><char style="wj">“Acunakyase, aipi ami ning jah mtheha mäiha nami ve vai, cunsepi ami pawh käh nami jah läkei vai. Ami pyena mäiha i am pawh khawi u.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4"/><char style="wj">“Aktäa yüh lü phüi sekia phüih pyang u lü khyanga ngkyang üng mtaihkie. Amimät naw ta ami kut mdawngca am pi am hnet hlü u.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:1">Mt 6:1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:8">Deut 6:8</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 15:38">Num 15:38</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Khyang he naw ami jah hmuh hmuh vaia khut pawhkie. Cangcim üng a vea kba; khyang naw ami jah münnak vaia, ami mcea sawm lü ami ban ami pinnak mehvun yüi</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:5: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mehvun yüi cun Pamhnam leisawngki ti ngsingnaka ami sawma kyaki.</char></note><char style="wj">teng ua.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6"/><char style="wj">“Eiawknak pawia adawnak säih ngawhnak üng ngaw hlükie. Sinakoka pi akdaw säiha ngawhnak üng ngawh vai jawngnakie.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7"/><char style="wj">“Jawihtuknaka pi ami jah leisawng vai, ‘Saja aw’ ti lü jah khü vai jawngnakie.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8"/><char style="wj">“Nangmi naw ta ‘Saja aw’ ti lü ami ning jah khü vaia käh ve ua. Isetiüng ta, nangmi cun avan tängei u lü Saja pi mat ni nami tak.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9"/><char style="wj">“Khawmdek khana u pi, ‘Pa aw,’ ti lü käh khü ua. Isetiüng ta nami pa mat däk khankhawa veki ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10"/><char style="wj">“Mkhawnga ami ning jah khü vaia käh ve ua. Isetiüng ta, nami mkhawng cun Mesijah mat däk ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:26">Mt 20:26</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 20:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mk 9:35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:43">10:43</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:44">44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Lk 22:26</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Nangmi üng kyäp säihki cun nami mpyaa kya yah khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 14:11">Lk 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">18:14</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Aupi, amät mhlünmtaieiki cun nem säih khai, amät mhnemeiki cun mhlünmtaia kya khai.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ami hleihlak Jesuh naw jah mkateiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Mk 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Lk 11:39-42</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nangmi thumksinge ja Pharise he, hypocrite aw, nami jo se ve. Isetiüng ta, khyang hea maa Khankhaw Pe ksawh khai ve uki, nanimät pi käh lut u lü lut khaie pi nami jah mkhyawhki. </char><verse eid="MAT 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14"/>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">23:14: </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ahina ayüi 14 hin akhäk naw am yuk sih u.</char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Thum mtheie ja Pharise he, nangmi hypocrite aw, nami jo se ve. Isetiüng ta, hmeinue jah ei aw u lü ami im nami jah huteiki. Mkhyekatnak am a ngdangnak vaia, khawvei veia nami ktaiyüki. Acunakyase, ksehlen bawkia mkatnak nami khamei khai. </char><verse eid="MAT 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15"/>
    <char style="wj">“Thum mtheie ja Pharise he, nangmi hypocrite aw, nami jo se ve. Isetiüng ta, Judahea jumeinak üng khyang matca a law vaia tuilawng khawkawng naküt lümkan lü nami cit hüki. Ngpyawt lawki pi namimäta kthaka anghngiha Mulai Pea nami cehsaki. </char><verse eid="MAT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Khyang mikmüe aw! nami jo se ve, “Aupi Temple be lü ng’yünceki cun amdang ni, aupi Temple üngka xüi be lü ng’yünceki cun a pyena mäiha kyaki ni,” nami tiki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17"/><char style="wj">“Amikmü yawk’ange aw, i ja adaw bawk? Xüi mä a daw bawk? Xüi ngcimsakia Temple mä a daw bawk?</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18"/><char style="wj">“Kpyawngkung be lü ng’yünceki cun amdang ni, kpyawngkunga khana peta petmsawt be lü ng’yünceki cun a pyena mäiha kyaki ni,” ti lü nami jah mtheiki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19"/><char style="wj">“Ihlawka nami mik müki ni, i ni a daw bawk? Petmsawt mä a daw bawk? Acuna petmsawt ngcimcaihsakia kpyawngkung mä a daw bawk?</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20"/><char style="wj">“Acunakyase, kpyawngkung be lü ng’yünceki cun acuna kpyawngkung ja a khana vekia petmsawte, avan be lü ng’yünceki ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21"/><char style="wj">“Temple be lü ng’yünceki cun acuna Temple ja a khuia veki Pamhnam be lü ng’yünceki ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1">Hesa 66:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:34">Mt 5:34</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Khankhaw be lü ng’yünceki cun Pamhnama ngawhnak ja acunüng ngawki be lü ng’yünceki ni. </char><verse eid="MAT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 27:30">Lev 27:30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Thum mtheie ja Pharise he, nangni hypocrite aw, nami jo se ve. Thingkthei yawpai ja tawikxüng ankseie xa üng mat nami peki. Acunsepi, aktung bawk thum üng jah läklam vai: ngsungpyunkia bilawhnak, mpyeneinak ja cingcainake jah hawihinkie. Ahin he cun käh jah hawih lü nami jah läklam vai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24"/><char style="wj">“Lam msümki khyang mikmüe aw, mkhoyang mat pi käh pa khaia tui mcim u lü sanghngüksaü nami mjaweiki.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25"/>
    <char style="wj">“Thum mtheie ja Pharise he, nangni hypocrite aw! nami jo se ve. Isetiüng, khawt ja kbe a kpung nami mthiki, a k’uma hleihlaknak ja ngtawngeinak am beki ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26"/><char style="wj">“Pharise mikmüe aw, khawt ja kbe a ngcim vaia a k’um mthi ma ua. Acunüng a kpung pi ngcim hnga khai ni. </char><verse eid="MAT 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:3">Ngs 23:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Thum mtheie ja Pharise he, nangni hypocrite aw, nami jo se ve. Isetiüng ta, nangmi cun ng'utnak lungdü akbawk, a kpunga angtoa ngdang lü a k’um yuhe ja yawk kthue am be lü mtüihkhehki am nami tängki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28"/><char style="wj">“Acukba nangmi pi akpunga khyang naküta veia ngsungpyunkia mäiha nami ngdangki, acunsepi nami mlung k’uma Pamhnam khut pawhkia nami ngsaihnak ja am dawkia ngaihnak mkhyekatnak beki. </char><verse eid="MAT 23:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ami khameinak vai Jesuh naw pyenki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Lk 11:47-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29"/>
    <char style="wj">“Thum mtheie ja Pharise he, nangmi hypocrite aw, nami jo se ve. Isetiüng ta, sahma hea mkhya ime jah sa u lü akdawa xüng lü awmki hea phäh yepim nami saki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30"/><char style="wj">“Mi pupaea kcün üng, mi na ngtüi law hngaa ta, sahma he ami jah hnimnak üng am mi na bawibeng hnga khai sü,’ nami tiki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31"/><char style="wj">“Acunakyase, sahma hnimkia ksawna nami kya cun nami ksingki ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32"/><char style="wj">“Nami pupaea mkhyekat nami kpha vaia nangmi pi mkhyekat betü ua.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:7">Mt 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:34">12:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:7">Lk 3:7</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Nangmi kphyue ja kphyua ca he aw, mulai nami cehnak vai üngka naw ihawkba nami lät thei khai ni?</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34"/><char style="wj">“Acunakyase, cangcim üng a na pyen khawi cun, ‘Sahmae, khyang ktheme ja, ngthungcim ksinge, ka ning jah tüih law pet khai. Avang nami ja hnim khai, avang kutlamktung üng nami jah taih khai, avang sinakok k’uma jah kpai u lü, mlüh mat üngka naw mlüh mata cit lü nami jah mkhuimkha khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Gen 4:8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:20">2Khro 24:20</ref>,<ref loc="2CH 24:21">21</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Acunakyase, khyangdüng Abelaha thisen üng tün lü, Temple k'uma ja, Temple ja kpyawngkunga nglaka nami hnim Barakiha capa Zakhariha thisen cäp, ja khawmdek khana khyangsungpyune, ami jah hnim naküta thisen cun nami khana pha khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36"/><char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, khyang hnima phäh ksükcetnak avan cun tuh ka khyang hea khana pha law khai!</char><verse eid="MAT 23:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalema khana Jesuha kphyanak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Lk 13:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37"/>
    <char style="wj">“Aw Jerusalem, Jerusalem, sahma he jah hnim lü na veia ami jah tüih law khyang he lung am na jah vawiki aw! Ainu naw, a ca he a ngphya keha a jah mkhäma kbaa, khawvei na canae jah mkhäm be vai ka ngaihki? Cunüngpi, acun am na jumki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:5">Jer 22:5</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Acunakyase Na temple cun axawnga na veia ning hawih peta kya ve.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Sal 118:26</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Ka ning jah mthehki, tuh üngkhyüh ‘Bawipa ngming üng lawki Pamhnam naw josennak be se’ am nami tia küt cäpa, ka hmai am na hmu ti uki,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 23:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24"/>
  <para style="s">Temple a pye vai Jesuh naw pyenki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:2">Mk 13:2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Lk 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1"/>Jesuh Temple üngka naw akcea a ceh üng, axüisaw he naw Temple ime mhnuh khai hea a veia lawki he. <verse eid="MAT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Hin avan nami jah hmuki am niki aw? Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, lung matca pi, hin üng am ve khaia a pyehnak vaia kcün pha law khai,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khuikhatnak ja mkhuimkhanak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mk 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Lk 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3"/>Olip mcunga khana a ngawh üng axüisaw he ampyua law u lü, “Itüha, acukba thawn law khai ni? Na lawnak vaia akcün ja akpäihnak kcün msingnak vai cun i ni? Jah mtheha” ami ti.<verse eid="MAT 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“U naw pi käh a ning jah mhleimhlak vaia mceiei ua.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5"/><char style="wj">“Khyang khawkän ka ngming üng law lü, Keia hana ngsaih lü ‘Kei, Khritaw ni’ ti lü khyang khawhah jah mhlei law khaie.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6"/><char style="wj">“Nami peia ngtuknake kthaie ja athuknaka pi ngtuknaka thange cun nami jah ngja law khai. Cunüngpi käh cäicing kawm uki. Acuna ngkhawe cun thawn law khaie, cunüngpi akcüna päihnak tinak am ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7"/><char style="wj">“Pee mat ja mat, pungnu mat ja mat, ngtung’at law khaie. Mdek alum üng, khaw jaw khyat pai law khai, ngkhyü ngsün law khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8"/><char style="wj">“Ahin he cun na hmi hlüki a huiheia mäiha khuikhanakea cuteinaka kyaki. </char><verse eid="MAT 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:22">Mt 10:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Acunüng ning jah man u lü ami ning jah mkhuimkha vai ja ami ning jah hnim vaia khyang hea kut üng ning jah ap khaie. Khyang naküt naw keia phäh ning jah hneng khaie.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10"/><char style="wj">“Acuna kcün üng khyang khawhah naw ami jumnak hawih u lü mat ja mat nghneng law khaie, hleihlak law khaie.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11"/><char style="wj">“Sahma ksee po law u lü khyang khawhah jah mhleimhlak law khaie.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12"/><char style="wj">“Am dawkia khut pawhnak da law lü mhläkphyanak ng’yeng law khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Mt 10:22</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Cunsepi, adütnak vei cäpa jumeiki naw küikyannak yah khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14"/><char style="wj">“Khankhaw Pea mawng thangkdaw cun khawmdek van üng sang lü khyang naküta veia saksia mdanga kya khai. Acun käna akcüna päihnak pha law khai. </char><verse eid="MAT 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kpyükpye theiki Kyükyawksee</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mk 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Lk 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dan 9:27</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:31">11:31</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12:11</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Sahma Danjelah naw cangcim üng a pyena kba, ‘Kpyükpye theiki kyükyawkse angcimcaihnak säiha ngdüi se, nami hmu khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng Judaha veki naküt mcungea dawng u se.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:17,18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:31">Lk 17:31</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Mkhyung khana veki im k’uma a ka lo khaia käh kyum law se.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18"/><char style="wj">“Loa veki naw pi a suisak loei khaia käh nghlat be se.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19"/><char style="wj">“Acuna mhnüp üng mpyaikie ja cihtui k’aw naca kpawmeikie ta aktäa khuikha khaie ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20"/><char style="wj">“Nami dawngnak vaia mhnüp cun khawksik khya ja Sabbath mhnüpa käh a kya vaia Pamhnama veia ktaiyü ua.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dan 12:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:14">Malam 7:14</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Khawmdek a ngtüi üngkhyüh am hmuh khawi, malama pi am hmuh be ti vai khuikhatnak kyühkse cun pha law khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22"/><char style="wj">Khawmhnüpe cun Pamhnam naw a jah tawisak päng ni; am a tawisak vai sü üng, u pi xüng khai am ve. A jah xüa khyang hea phäh Pamhnam naw khawmhnüpe cun jah tawisak khai. </char><verse eid="MAT 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23"/>
    <char style="wj">‘Hia ni Khritaw, cuia ni Khritaw’ tiki a ve üng, käh nami kcangnak vai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24"/><char style="wj">“Isetiüng ta, Khritaw kcang am nikie ja sahma ksee po law khaie. Pamhnama jah xü khyang he pi a thawn theia ta, ami jah mhleinak vaia müncanksee pi jah pawh law khaie.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25"/><char style="wj">“Ngai ua, akcün am a pha law ham üng ma lü ka ning jah mtheh päng ni. </char><verse eid="MAT 24:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:26,27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 17:23">Lk 17:23</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:24">24</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Acunakyase, ‘Mesijah cun khawmkyanga ni’ ami ti üng käh nami ceh vai! Ani cun ‘Angthupnaka ve ve’ ami ti üng pi käh jah kcang na ua.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27"/><char style="wj">“Nghngilaw da mlaih se khawkyak cäpa khaw a vaia kba, Khyanga Capa cun law be khai. </char><verse eid="MAT 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 17:37">Lk 17:37</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Ahawia pi akthia venaka, langktahe ngcun khaie ni.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khyanga Capa a law bea mawng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mk 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Lk 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Hesa 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Jol 2:10</ref>,<ref loc="JOL 2:31">31</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:15">3:15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12-13">Malam 6:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Hez 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Jol 2:10</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:15">3:15</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Acuna, khuikhatnaka mhnüpe käna, khaw nghmüp law khai. Khyalawn pi am vai law ti. Aisie khankhaw üngkhyüh kya law khaie, khankhaw khyaihbahnake pi ami venak üngka naw jah ksät khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:10-14">Zakh 12:10-14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Malam 1:7</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Acunüng khyanga Capa msingnak cun khana ngdang law khai. Khawmdek khyang naküt Khyanga Capa hlüngtai kyäpsawknak am khana khawngmei ngcum lü law be se, hmu u lü kyap khaie.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31"/><char style="wj">“Pungnu tum lü a khankhawngsä he naw a xüe cun khawmdek avan üng jah mkhäm hü be khai hea jah tüih law khai. </char><verse eid="MAT 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fikdung am a msuimcäpnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mk 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Lk 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32"/>
    <char style="wj">“Hina Fikdung üngka naw ngtheingthang ua. A kpyange tawi law u lü a hnah a hlip law üng, khawkhye cäh lawki ti, nami ksingki he.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33"/><char style="wj">“Acuna kba ni, nangmi naw ahin he nami jah hmuh üng, akcün cäh law lü mkawt pei pha lawki ti ksing ua.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34"/><char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, tukbäih ksawn üng khyang he am ami thi päih ham üng acun he avan cun kümcei law khaie ti süm ua.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35"/><char style="wj">“Khawmdek ja khankhaw khyük ni sepi, ka khyü nglung matca pi a kümcei kaa käh khyük yah khai. </char><verse eid="MAT 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Akcün ja mhnüp u naw am ksing</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mk 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Lk 17:26-30</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36"/>
    <char style="wj">“Acuna mhnüp ja akcün cun iti üng pha law khai ti, u naw pi am ksing. Khankhawngsäe naw pi am ksing u. Capa</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">24:36: </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Amsah naw “Capa naw pi am ksing” ti hin am yuksih u.</char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">naw pi am ksing. Ka pa däk naw ni a ksing.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:5-8">Gen 6:5-8</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Khyanga Capa a law be vai cun Nawea kcün üngkaa mäiha kya law khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38"/><char style="wj">“Mlikpitui am a phu law hama kcüne üngka naw Nawe mlawng k’uma a luh vei cäp, khyang he cun ei awkie, nghnumi ja kpami ngkhyunglakie;</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:6-24">Gen 7:6-24</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Mlikpitui phu law lü khyang avan a jah cehin vei cäpa i käh sim lü awmki he. Acun üng ami vea mäiha, Khyanga Capa a law be vai üng pi acukba kya law khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40"/><char style="wj">“Loa ve yümki xawi üng mat jäk lü mat hawih hüt khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41"/><char style="wj">“Ksum su yümki nghnumi nghngih üng mat jäk lü mat hawih hüt khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42"/><char style="wj">“Nami Bawipa a lawnak vaia akcün am nami ksingkia kya se, a na ngäng ua.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:39">Lk 12:39</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:40">40</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Im mah naw mpyukei a law vaia kcün a ksing vai sü ta, a im mpyukei naw käh a kpye vaia mtät kyet khai ti nami ksingki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44"/><char style="wj">“Acuna mäiha, nangmi pi a na ngcüngcei ua. Isetiüng ta, Khyanga Capa cun am nami sümhmuha kcün üng law be khai. </char><verse eid="MAT 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Üpnak vaia veki ja am vekia mpya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Lk 12:41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45"/>
    <char style="wj">“Im mahpa naw, a imbunga eiawk akcün phäh phäh üng jah pyangmtham pawhmsah khaia a mcawn themngvai lü cingcaikia mpya cen u ni?</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46"/><char style="wj">“Acun he jah na pawhmsah se a mahpa naw ima a law be üng, a hmuh lawa mpya ta a josen ve.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47"/><char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, amahpa naw acuna mpya üng a khawh naküt ap khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48"/><char style="wj">“Cunsepi, mpya kse ania üng ta, ‘ka mahpa a law be vai hjo ham khai ni’ ti lü ngaihnipki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49"/><char style="wj">“A püi mpyae jah kpai lü ju awk ktai k’eiea hlawnga a na eiawk hü hngaki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50"/><char style="wj">“Am a ngaihhmuh ja am a na ksinga kcün mhnüp mat üng, acuna mpyaa mahpa law be khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51"/><char style="wj">“A mahpa naw a mtemtea mawi</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:51: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Amtemtea mawi lü akcea xawtin khai” ti lü akhäk üng veki.</char></note><char style="wj">lü hypocritea venaka vesak hnga se, acuia kyahnak ja, mnicui hakyetnak am khuikhatnak khamei khai.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25"/>
  <para style="s">Nglamica xa am msuimcäpnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 12:35">Lk 12:35</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acunkäna, Khankhaw Pe cun nglamica xa, ami meiim jah ceh lü ca mbumki a na do khaia, citkie üng tängki ni. <verse eid="MAT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2"/>“Mhma cun am cingcai u, akce mhma ta cingcaikie. <verse eid="MAT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3"/>“Am cingcaikie cun ami meiim cehpüi u lü meitui um üng am ceheisih u. <verse eid="MAT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4"/>“Acunsepi, akcinge cun ami meiim üng meitui a bea thea um üng meitui abe ceheisihkie. <verse eid="MAT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5"/>“Ca mbumki am pha law nai se, ami van ngam u lü ipeikie.<verse eid="MAT 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mthan nglunga, ‘Ca mbumki law ve, law lü do law ua,’ ti lü ngpyang kthai ngthang lawki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7"/><char style="wj">“Nglamica he cun ami van xak law u lü ami mei ime jah pyaneikie.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8"/><char style="wj">“Am cingcaikie naw, ‘Akcinge üng nami meitui jah pe lawca ua, kami meiim thi law hlü ve’ ami ti.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9"/><char style="wj">“Akcinge naw, ‘Kaa, keimi ja nangmia phäh meitui am khäk hlü ve. Cit lü namimäta phäh va khyäiei ua’ ami ti.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, meitui khyäi khai hea ami va ceh k’um üng, ca mbumki law lü meitui taki he cun am atänga ca mbumnaka jah lutpüi lü ksawh ami khaih u. </char><verse eid="MAT 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:11,12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 13:25">Lk 13:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Acunkäna, nglamica kce he pi law hnga u lü, ‘Bawipa aw, Bawipa aw, lut law hnga vang ung’ ami ti.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12"/><char style="wj">“Ani naw, ‘Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, nangmi am ning jah ksing nawng’ a ti. </char><verse eid="MAT 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ia kcün ja amhnüp üng Khyanga Capa law be khai ti, am nami ksingkia kya se, a na ngcüngceiei ua. </char><verse eid="MAT 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mpya kthum am msuimcäpnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Lk 19:11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:14-30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Lk 19:11-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Khankhaw Pe cun khyang mat kdunglawng hü khai naw a mpyae jah khü lü a khawhkhyeme jah mceisaki am tängki ni. <verse eid="MAT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15"/>“Ami khyaihnak üng ngkäkia, mat üng ngui thawng mhma, mat üng thawng nghngih ja mat üng thawng at cima jah pe hüt lü kdung hüki. <verse eid="MAT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16"/>“Thawng mhma yahki naw ta cit ktäi lü a ngui cun am kungpang hü lü thawng mhmaa a pungsak. <verse eid="MAT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17"/>“Acukba bäa thawng nghngih yahki naw pi thawng nghngiha a pungsak. <verse eid="MAT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18"/>“Cunüngpi, thawng mat yahki naw ta amahpa ngui cun cehpüi lü mdek k’uma a va cümin.<verse eid="MAT 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19"/>
    <char style="wj">“Khawvei angsawk käna ami mahpa law be lü a jah pet hüt nguia mawng a jah kthäh.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20"/><char style="wj">“Thawng mhma yahkia mpya naw ta a yaha ngui thawng mhma lawpüi lü, ‘Ka mahpa aw, thawng mhma na na pet hüt; tenga, thawng mhma ka yahsih ni’ ti lü a msum be.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21"/><char style="wj">“Amahpa naw, ‘Daw ve, nang hin daw lü sitihkia mpya ni; apica üng na sitihkia kyase, kei naw khawhaha ka ning ap khai ni. Law lü na mahpaa dä ayüma jekyaia’ a ti.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, thawng nghngih yahki pi law hnga lü a yaha ngui thawng nghngih lawpüi lü, ‘Ka mahpa aw, thawng nghngih na na pet hüt; tenga, thawng nghngih ka yahsih ni’ a ti.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23"/><char style="wj">“Amahpa naw, ‘Daw ve, nang hin daw lü sitihkia mpya ni; apica üng na sitihkia kyase, kei naw khawhah ka ning ap khai ni. Law lü na mahpaa dä ayüma jekyaia’ a ti.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24"/><char style="wj">“Thawng mat yahki pi law lü, ‘Ka mahpa aw, nang cun na khaki, am na sawnaka na atki, mci am na phuhnakaa pi na mcunki’ ti ka ksingki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25"/><char style="wj">“Acunakyase kyühei lü, ka va citki naw mdek k’uma ka k’uhin ni. Tenga, acuna mä se na ka bi bea,” a ti.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26"/><char style="wj">“Amahpa naw, ‘Nang mpya kse, mpya kdam! Am ka sawnaka ka atki, mci am ka phuhnaka ka mcunki’ ti na ksingki am niki aw?</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27"/><char style="wj">“Ka ngui cun ngui cümnak ima jah va kpuki se, ka law be üng ka ngui pung se ka yah be vai sü.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28"/><char style="wj">“Tuh ta, hina veia ngui la be lü ngui thawng xa taki üng pe ua.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mt 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mk 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Lk 8:18</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Isetiakyaküng, khawkän yah thei lü taki üng, a tak law dämdäm vaia pet sih vai. Cunüngpi, i pi am ta lü am sui theiki üng, a takca naküt huh be vai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:12">Mt 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 22:13">22:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:28">Lk 13:28</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Ia pi am ngmangnaka mpya, anghmüpnak, kpunga va xawt tawn hü ua. Acuia khuikha mpyensetnak am mnicui hakyet lü ve khai,’ ti lü a jah mtheh. </char><verse eid="MAT 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Akpäihnak ngthumkhyahnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:27">Mt 16:27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:28">Mt 19:28</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Khyanga Capa cun Sangpuxanga mäiha a khankhawngsä ngcime am atänga a law be üng, a Bawingawhnak üng ngaw khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32"/><char style="wj">“A maa, khyang mjü naküt ngcun law khaie. Acunüng toksäm naw a toe mee ksung üngkhyüh a jah mtaia kba khyang mjü naküt cun jah mtai law khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33"/><char style="wj">“Khyang ngsungpyune cun a khet da jah ta lü, akce he cun a kcawng da jah ta khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, Sangpuxang naw a khet da kae üng, ‘Law ua, ka pa naw dawkyanak am a ning jah kbe, khawmdek angtüi üngkhyüh nami phäha pyan päng Khankhaw Pe cen ka na ua.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35"/><char style="wj">‘Ei ka cawi üng na na tumbeiki; tui ka xai üng tui na na peki; Khina ka kya üng pi na ima na na khin naki;</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36"/><char style="wj">‘Suisak kpuma ka ve üng, nami na msuimsaki; am ka phetyai üng, nami na msümcei büktengki; thawng ima ka ve üng pi, ka veia nami lawki he,’ ti law khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37"/><char style="wj">“Khyang ngsungpyune naw, ‘Bawipa aw, itüh üng ei cawiki se ning hmu u lü, kami ning mbei ni? Itüh üng tui xaiki se tui kami ning tu ni?</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38"/><char style="wj">‘Itüh üng, khina kya lü, kami ning khinnak ni? Itüh üng suisak kpuma veki se, kami ning msuimsak ni?</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39"/><char style="wj">‘Itüh üng am phetyai lü thawng ima veki se, kami ning bükteng law ni? ami ti.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40"/><char style="wj">“Sangpuxang naw, ‘Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, hina ka hnükläke üngka akdikca säiha khana nami bi naküt cun keia phäh nami bi ni,’ ti law khai. </char><verse eid="MAT 25:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41"/>
    <char style="wj">“Acunkäna, a kcawng da kae üng, ‘Pamhnama yünsenak khameikie aw, Khawyam ja a khankhawngsä hea phäha pyang mulaia ka venak üngkhyüh cit ua.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42"/><char style="wj">‘Isetiüng, ei ka cawi üng, ei am na mbei uki; tui xai üng se, awk vai tui am na pe uki;</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43"/><char style="wj">‘Khina ka kyak üngpi am nami na khinaki; suisak kpuma ve üng se, am nami na msuimsaki; am ka phetyai lü thawng ima ka um üng pi, am nami na bükteng lawki.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, amimi naw, ‘Bawipa aw, itüh üng ei cawi lü, tui ngaih lü, khina kya lü, akpuma na ve, am phetyai lü thawng ima veki se, ning hmu u lü, am kami ning kueiki ni?” ti law khaie.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45"/><char style="wj">“Sangpuxang naw, ‘Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, hina akdikca kuei vai nami hai cun Kei nami na haia kyaki,’ ti lü, jah msang be.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan 12:2</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Acunüng, acun he avan angsäia khuikhatnak mulaia cit u se, ngsungpyunkie ta angsäia xünnaka cit khaie”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 25:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26"/>
  <para style="s">Jesuh ami ceng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-7">Mk 14:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Lk 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Jn 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1"/>Jesuh naw acuna mtheimthangnake a jah pyen päng üng, axüisaw he üng, <verse eid="MAT 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Ex 12:1-27</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Lätnak Pawi a phanak vai mhnüp nghngih hlü hamki ti nami ksingki, Khyanga Capa kutlamktung üng ami hnim vaia man law khaie,”</char> ti lü a jah mtheh.<verse eid="MAT 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3"/>Acunüng, ktaiyü ngvaie, thumksinge ja, angvaie cun, ktaiyü ngvai säih Kaiphah ami tia abawi ima ngbum lawki he. <verse eid="MAT 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4"/>Jesuh ampyuaa man lü hnim khai hea cengkie. <verse eid="MAT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5"/>“Acunsepi, lätnak pawi k’um üng ta käh pawh vai, khyang he suksak khaie ni,” ami ti.<verse eid="MAT 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bethaniha Jesuh ksi ng’ui am buih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mk 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Jn 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6"/>Jesuh Bethanih mlüh, mnehkse mnehki Sihmona ima veki. <verse eid="MAT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:37">Lk 7:37</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 7:38">38</ref></char></note>Jesuh naw buh a ei k’um üng, nghnumi mat naw aphu küi alabasta ksi ng’ui um mat üng lawpüi lü, a lu khana a buih law. <verse eid="MAT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8"/>Axüisawe naw hmuh u lü ami mlung so se, “Ivai ahikba a päihcaihsak ni? <verse eid="MAT 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9"/>“Hina ksi ng'ui khawhaha jawi lü, khuikha msih mpyaki he üng jah pet vai sü,” ami ti.<verse eid="MAT 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10"/>Jesuh naw ami pyen ksing lü, <char style="wj">“Ivai hina nghnumi nami suksakeikie ni? Ani naw ka khana akdaw säih pawhki ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Deut 15:11</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Sih mpyaki he cun aläa nami hlawnga ve khaie. Acunsepi, kei cun nami hlawnga aläa am ve hlü nawng.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12"/><char style="wj">“Hina ksi ng'ui ka khana a buih hin ka ng'utnak vaia pyangki ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13"/><char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, khawmdek van üng hawia pi, thangkdaw ami sang hü u üng, hina nghnumi naw hikba a pawha mawng pi ani sümnak vaia pyensih khaie”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Judah Iskarot naw Jesuh phyeheiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mk 14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Lk 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14"/>Acunüng, axüisaw he xaleinghngih üngka mat Judah Iskarot naw ktaiyü ngvaiea veia cit lü, <verse eid="MAT 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 11:12">Zakh 11:12</ref></char></note>“Ani nami veia ka phyehei üng, i ja nami na pet kawm?” a ti. Ngui thumkip khe ma u lü ami pet. <verse eid="MAT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16"/>Acunkäna Judah Isakarot naw Jesuh a phyeheinak vaia lam suiki.<verse eid="MAT 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh ja axüisaw hea Lätnak pawi buh ei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mk 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Lk 22:7-13</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Jn 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17"/>Nghngen am ngcawkia buh pawhnaka mhnüp kcük üng, axüisaw he Jesuh veia law u lü, “Hawia ni, Lätnak pawi buh na ei vaia kami pyen vai na ngjak hlü?” ami ti.<verse eid="MAT 26:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ngnam k'uma khyang mata veia cit u lü, ‘Saja naw Ka kcün pha law ve; ka hnükläke ja Kei naw na ima Lätnak pawi buh ei khai, ti ve’ va ti ua”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19"/>Jesuh naw a jah mtheha mäiha axüisaw he naw Lätnak pawi buh pyang vaikie.<verse eid="MAT 26:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20"/>Khaw amü law üng, axüisaw xaleinghngihe ja Jesuh ei khaia ngaw yümkie. <verse eid="MAT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21"/>Ami ei k’um üng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ka ning jah mthehki, nangmi üngka mat naw na phyehei khai,” </char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 26:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22"/>Axüisawe amsüma pukse u lü, “Bawipa aw, acun mä kei vai aw?” ti lü mat mat cima ami kthäh u.<verse eid="MAT 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 41:9">Sal 41:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Kbe mat üng atänga na kpuiheipüiki naw na phyehei khai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24"/><char style="wj">“Khyanga Capa cun Cangcim üng a ng'yuka mäiha thi khai. Acunsepi, Khyanga Capa phyehei khaia phäh ihlawk kyühkse khai ni. Acuna khyang hin angtüia käh a ngtüi law xaa ta a phäha daw bawk khai sü,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25"/>Phyehei khaia khyang Judah naw, “Rabbi, acun mä kei phäi aw?” a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:25">Jesuh naw, “Ä, na pyen cang ve,” a ti.<verse eid="MAT 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bawipaa müei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mk 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Lk 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Kor 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26"/>Acukba ami ei k’um üng, Jesuh naw muk lo lü ktaiyü ma lü boki naw, axüisaw he üng a jah pet. <char style="wj">“Lo u lü, ei ua; hin hin keia mtisa ni,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 26:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw khawt lo lü Pamhnam üng jenak mtheh lü, axüisaw he üng a jah pet. <char style="wj">“Nami van naw hin aw ua.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Ex 24:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Jer 31:31-34</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Hin hin ka thisen, Pamhnama khyütamnak kthai, khyang khawhah mkhyekatnak mhlätnak vaia lawngki ka thisen ni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29"/><char style="wj">Ka ning jah mthehki, ka paa Uknaka Khawa nangmi am ahina capyittui kthai am mi awk be yüm vei cäpa, hina capyittui kthai am ka aw be ti khai ni,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30"/>Acunüng, ng’äi mat ami mcuh käna, Olip mcung da citkie.<verse eid="MAT 26:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pita naw Jesuh a manak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mk 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Lk 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Jn 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Zakh 13:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Tuh mthan, kei na hawih hüt u lü nami cen päih khaie. Cangcim üng a ng’yuka kba, ‘Pamhnam naw toksäm hnim se, toe cun ngpyangtaiei hü päih khaie’</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:16">Mt 28:16</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Acunsepi, ka thawh be käna Kalile khawa nami maa ka na cit khai,”</char> ti lü Jesuh naw a pyen.<verse eid="MAT 26:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33"/>Pita naw msang lü, “Ami van naw ning cen ta päih u sepi, kei naw ta isüm am ning cen ta ngü,” a ti.<verse eid="MAT 26:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ka ning mthehki, tuh mthan ai am khawng ham se, nang naw kthum vei am na na ksing vaia na pyen khai,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 26:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35"/>Pita naw, “Na thihnaka thih hnga vai ngü sepi acukba ta am ka pyen khai ni,” a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:35">Acukba bäa axüisaw he ami van naw ti law hngakie.<verse eid="MAT 26:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ketaseman ngvawng k'uma Jesuh ktaiyüki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mk 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Lk 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36"/>Acunüng, Jesuh axüisaw he am alanga, Ketaseman ami tinaka hnün mat ami pha law üng, axüisaw he üng, <char style="wj">“Caia ka va ktaiyü k’um üng, hin üng a na ngaw ua,”</char> a ti. <verse eid="MAT 26:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37"/>Pita ja Zebedea capa xawi jah ngkhahpüi lü, a mlung na leng lengki. <verse eid="MAT 26:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw jah mtheh lü, <char style="wj">“Thi hlü awnga ka mlung khuikha ve. Ahin üng ve lü na ngängpüi ua,”</char> ti lü a cehpüi kthum üng a jah mtheh.<verse eid="MAT 26:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39"/>Jesuh cun va cetca lü, mdeka a hmai bun lü, <char style="wj">“Aw, ka pa aw, a thawn thei üng ta, hina khuikhatnak khawt hin ka vei üngka naw loina. Cunüngpi, keia ngjakhlüa käh thawn lü, na ngjakhlüa thawn se,”</char> ti lü ktaiyüki.<verse eid="MAT 26:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40"/>Acunüng law be lü, a hnükläk kthum cun a na ipei u se jah hmuh lü Pita üng, <char style="wj">“Naji matca pi ami na na k’äihpüi khawhki aw?</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41"/><char style="wj">Hlawhlepnak üng nami lut msawk khai ni, ngäng lü ktaiyü ua. Mlungmthin ta yäng kyawki mtisa naw am lüi ve,”</char> ti lü a mtheh.<verse eid="MAT 26:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42"/>Anghngihnaka va cit lü, <char style="wj">“Aw ka pa aw, kei naw hina khuikhatnak khawt hin am aw ngü se am a thawn thei üng ta, na ngjakhlüa kya se,”</char> ti lü ktaiyü betüki. <verse eid="MAT 26:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43"/>Ami veia a law be üng a axüisaw he a na ip betü u lü am mdei khaw u se a jah hmuh.<verse eid="MAT 26:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44"/>Jah hawih hüt lü akthumnaka acukba bä pyen lü va ktaiyü betüki. <verse eid="MAT 26:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45"/>Acunüng, axüisaw hea veia cit be lü, <char style="wj">“Atuh vei cäpa ip lü nami hüieikie aw? Teng ua, Khyanga Capa cun khyangkaea kut üng msum vaia kcün pha law ve.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46"/><char style="wj">“Tho law ua, mi cit vai. Teng ua, na phyeheikia khyang law ve,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 26:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh ami man</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mk 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Lk 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Jn 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47"/>Acukba, a na ngthuhei k'um üng, axüisaw he üngka Judah law lü, ktaiyü ngvaie, thumksinge ja axü ngvaie naw ami jah tüih law khyangpänu li kcim jah kpawmeikie a jah lawpüi. <verse eid="MAT 26:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48"/>Phyeheiki naw msingnak jah pe lü, “Ka mhnama khyang cun na ngjakhlüa khyanga kya khai, ani nami man vai,” a ti.<verse eid="MAT 26:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49"/>Judah cun Jesuh veia cit lü, “Rabbi, dimdeihnak ve se,” ti lü a mhnam.<verse eid="MAT 26:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ka püi aw, ise na lawki ni?”</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka püi aw, ise na lawki ni? am ani üng “Ka püi hlah lü tia” </char></note> a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:50">Acun ja lawsih lü ami man u. <verse eid="MAT 26:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51"/>Jesuha a ngkhahpüi he üngka mat naw kcim ksetei lü ktaiyü ngvai säiha mpyaa hngakawi a ksawm pit. <verse eid="MAT 26:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Na kcim a venak üng ta bea, kcim xatnakie cun kcim am ni ami thih kawm.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53"/><char style="wj">Tukbäih ka pa veia ktaiyü ngü se, ani naw khankhawngsä he xaleinghngih khläih na tüih law pe khawhki ti, am nami ksingki aw?</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54"/><char style="wj">Ka ktaiyü üng, ihawkba Cangcim naw ahikba thawn law khai a ti, kümbe law khai ni?”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 26:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:55: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 19:47">Lk 19:47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21:37</ref></char>
    </note>Acunkäna Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Li kcime jah kawtei u lü Kei na man khaia nami lawki he aw? Kei hin khyang kse aw? Amhnüp tä, nami hlawnga ngaw lü templea jah mthei ngü se, am nami na manki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56"/><char style="wj">Acunsepi, ahin avan cun sahma hea pyen akümnak vaia kyaki ni,”</char> a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:56">Acunüng axüisaw he ami van naw hawih lü ami dawng tak.<verse eid="MAT 26:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kawngci maa Jesuh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mk 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Lk 22:54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Jn 18:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57"/>Jesuh mankia khyang he naw ktaiyü ngvai säih Kaiphah ima, thumksinge ja axü ngvaiea ngcunnaka ami cehpüi. <verse eid="MAT 26:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58"/>Pita athuknak üngka naw ktaiyü ngvaia ngvawng cäpa läk hngaki. Lut hnga lü i a thawn law teng khaia, yekapa am ngaw yümkie. <verse eid="MAT 26:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59"/>Ktaiyü ngvaie ja Kawngci üngka ami van naw Jesuh ami hnimnak vaia am cangkia saksi suikie. <verse eid="MAT 26:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60"/>Cunüngpi, khyang khawkän naw maa law u lü Jesuh mhleieikie kyaw, cunsepi i am hmuh u. Akpäihnaka khyang nghngih law ni lü, <verse eid="MAT 26:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:61: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:19">Jn 2:19</ref> </char></note>“Hina khyang naw, ‘Kei naw Pamhnama temple kpye lü amhnüp kthum üng ka sa be khawh khai’ tiki,” ti lü ani pyen law.<verse eid="MAT 26:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62"/>Ktaiyü ngvai säih naw tho law lü, “Ami ning mkatei na jah msangnak vai am na ksingeiki aw?” a ti. <verse eid="MAT 26:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63"/>Acunsepi, Jesuh am khihkheh. Ktaiyü ngvai säih naw msang lü, “Xüngseikia Pamhnama ngming be lü ka ning kthähki: Pamhnama Capa, Khritaw Mesijaha na kya üng jah mtheha,” a ti.<verse eid="MAT 26:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:64: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Na pyen cang ve. Acunsepi, tuha Khyanga Capa cun a Johitmah säih khet da ngaw lü, ngmei üng kyum law se nami hmuh khai,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 26:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:65,66: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 24:16">Lev 24:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acunüng, ktaiyü ngvai säih naw a suisake jah ktekin lü, “Hin naw Pamhnam pyenksenaka ngthu pyen ve! Ahina thea ia saksi am hlü ti? Tuh kung Pamhnam a pyetsenak nami ngjaki. <verse eid="MAT 26:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66"/>Ihawkba nami ngaikie ja?” a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">Amimi naw, “Ani mkhyekatki, thih kung khaia ngkawih ve,” ami ti.<verse eid="MAT 26:66"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:67: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 50:6">Hesa 50:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acunüng, a hmai üng msawh lü thäkie. Avang naw ami mja am kbei u lü, <verse eid="MAT 26:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68"/>“Nang Khritaw! Na nghmaki. U ja ni kbeiki? jah mtheha” ami ti.<verse eid="MAT 26:68"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pita naw Jesuh maki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mk 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Lk 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Jn 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69"/>Pita ngvawnga kpunga ngaw se, ktaiyü ngvaia mpya nghnumi mat naw a veia law lü, “Nang pi Kalile khyang Jesuh am nani ve yümki,” a ti.<verse eid="MAT 26:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70"/>Cunsepi, Pita naw ami vana maa ngcim lü, “I na pyenki, am ksing nawng,” a ti. <verse eid="MAT 26:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71"/>Acunüng, akce mkawt da cit se, acuia mpya akce nghnumi naw hmuh lü, “Hina khyang pi, Nazaret Jesuh am ve yümki va ni kbak,” ti lü acuia awmki he üng a jah mtheh.<verse eid="MAT 26:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72"/>Pita naw, “Ka ng’yünki, acuna khyang kei am ksing nawng” ti lü ngcim betüki.<verse eid="MAT 26:72"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73"/>Ivei am ngsawk se acuia ngdüikie naw law u lü, “Akcanga nang pi acun he üngka mata na kyaki ni, na ngthuhei üng ngsingei ve,” ami ti.<verse eid="MAT 26:73"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74"/>Acunüng Pita naw, “Ka ng’yünki, akcang ni ka pyen. Ka hlei ka pyen üng Pamhnam naw na hmuh se. Acuna khyang am ksing nawng” a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:74">Acukba a ngcim betü ja ainghlüi khawngki. <verse eid="MAT 26:74"/><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ainghlüi am khawng ham se kthum vei ngcim lü na na ma khai,”</char> a ti cen Pita naw süm law be lü kpunga cit lü aknuia kyapki.<verse eid="MAT 26:75"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27"/>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Pilata veia ami cehpüi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mk 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Lk 23:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Jn 18:28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1"/>Khaw athaih law üng, ktaiyü ngvaie ja axü ngvaie ami van naw Jesuh hnimnak vaia lam suikie. <verse eid="MAT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2"/>Lakkhit am khit u lü cehpüikie naw Romah Khaw Uk Pilat üng ami msum.<verse eid="MAT 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Judah Iskarot a thiha mawng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 1:18">Ngs 1:18</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 1:19">19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:3-8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:18">Ngs 1:18</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 1:19">19</ref></char>
    </note>Phyeheiki Judah naw Jesuh ami hnim vaia mkateikie ti a ksing üng ngjut lü, tangka thumkip ktaiyü ngvaie ja axü ngvaiea veia a lawpüi be. <verse eid="MAT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4"/>“Khyang ngcim phyehei lü mkhyekat veng,” a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">Amimi naw, “Keimi üng acun i sängei se ja? Namät üng va sängeiki” ti lü ami pyen.<verse eid="MAT 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5"/>Judah naw tangka cun templea xawtin hüt lü acun üngka naw dawng lü amät va ng’awk ngengki.<verse eid="MAT 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6"/>Ktaiyü ngvaie naw tangka lo u lü, “Hina ngui hi thisena phu ni, Templea khawh taknak üng tak vaia am nglawi,” ti lü, <verse eid="MAT 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7"/>atänga sumkyam u lü acuna ngui am pekce khyang he jah k’utnak vai k’am kvawa khawmdek ami khyäih u. <verse eid="MAT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8"/>Acunakyase, acuna mdek cun tuhvei cäpa “Thisen khawmdek” ami ti.<verse eid="MAT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:9,10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 11:12">Zakh 11:12</ref>,<ref loc="ZEC 11:13">13</ref></char>
    </note>Acunüng, sahma Jeramih naw a pyen, “Isarele khyang he naw ania phu tangka thumkipa ami mkhyäp päng cun la u lü, <verse eid="MAT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10"/>tangka thumkip cen am k’am vawkia mdek khyäihnak vaia sum ve u,” a ti kümcei lawki.<verse eid="MAT 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pilat naw Jesuh a kthäh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mk 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Lk 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Jn 18:33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11"/>Jesuh Romah Ukia ma ngdüi se, Khaw Uk naw, <char style="wj">“Nang Judahea Sangpuxanga na kyaki aw?” </char>ti lü a kthäh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">Jesuh naw, “Ä, na pyen cang ve,” a ti. <verse eid="MAT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12"/>Acunüngpi, ktaiyü ngvaie ja axü ngvaiea mkateinak üng ta mkhap matca am pi am jah msang be.<verse eid="MAT 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13"/>Acunüng, Pilat naw, “Ami ning mkatei hin na ngjaki aw?” a ti.<verse eid="MAT 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14"/>Acunüngpi, mkhap matca üng am jah msang lü ve betü se, Khaw Uk naw a münnak law.<verse eid="MAT 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh thi khaia ami mkhyäp</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mk 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Lk 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Jn 18:39—19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15"/>Romah Uk naw Lätnak pawi buh pawh mhnüp üng, thawngkyum mat, khyang he naw ami ngai mat cim a jah mhlät pet khawia thum veki. <verse eid="MAT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16"/>Acunüng thawngim üngka a ngming ngthangki, mat Jesuh Barabah ami ti veki. <verse eid="MAT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17"/>Acunakyase, khyang he ami ngcun law üng Pilat naw, “U ja nami phäha ka mhlät vai nami ngai? Barabah mä, Khritaw ami ti Jesuh mä?” a ti. <verse eid="MAT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18"/>Isetiakyaküng, Jesuh cun Judah ngvaie naw hneng lü ami lawpüi ti, a ksinga phäha kyaki.<verse eid="MAT 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19"/>Pilat, ngthumkhyahnaka ngawhnak üng a ngawh üng, a khyu naw “Hina khyang ngsungpyun, ia käh pawh kawpi, tuh mthan ka ngmang üng ania phäh aktäa ka khuikhaki ni,” ti lü a cük law.<verse eid="MAT 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20"/>Ktaiyü ngvaie ja axü ngvaie naw Barabah mhlät lü Jesuh hnim vaia, khyangpä naw ami tä vaia ami jah ksük. <verse eid="MAT 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21"/>Cunsepi Pilat naw jah kthäh lü, “Hina khyang nghngih üng u ni ka mhlät vai nami jum?” a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">Amimi naw, “Barabah,” ami ti.<verse eid="MAT 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22"/>Acunüng Pilat naw, “Khritaw ami tia Jesuh ia ka pawh vai ni?” a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">Ami van naw, “Kutlamktung üng taiha,” ami ti u.<verse eid="MAT 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23"/>Cunsepi Pilat naw, “Ia mkhyenak pawh se ni?” a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Acunüng, “Kutlamktung üng taih vai,” ti lü, ngpyang law dämdämkie.<verse eid="MAT 27:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 21:6-9">Deut 21:6-9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acunüng Pilat naw i am ti thei ti. Khyang he suksak law khaie ti ksing lü, “Hina khyang ngcima thisen üng kei am sängei veng, nangmia pawha ni a kya hlü ve” ti lü, khyang hea maa a kut tui am a kpyaw.<verse eid="MAT 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25"/>Khyangpä van naw, “Hina a thisen ta kamimät ja kami ca hea khana kya law kawm,” ti lü, ngpyangkie.<verse eid="MAT 27:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26"/>Acunüng Pilat naw Barabah jah mhlät pet lü; Jesuh a kpai päng ja kutlamktung üng ami taih vaia a jah mtheh.<verse eid="MAT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yekape naw Jesuh yaiha pawhkie</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mk 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Jn 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27"/>Acunkäna Pilata yekape naw Jesuh, Khaw Uka Bawiima k’uma luhpüi u se, läk lawki he naw ami kbumin law. <verse eid="MAT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28"/>A suisak jah suh pet u lü suisak sen ami jihsak. <verse eid="MAT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29"/>Acunüng nghling lukhum pyang u lü ngbüngsakie; a khet kut da ksawngkhe ami kcüngeisak. Ami mkhuk am ngdäng lü ngkun u lü, “Judahea Sangpuxang, na sak saü se,” ti u lü yaiha ami pawh u. <verse eid="MAT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30"/>Msawh lü ksawngkhe lokie naw a lu üng ami kpai. <verse eid="MAT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31"/>Ami yaihei law päng üng, suisak sen suh pe lü a suisak jihsak bekie naw, kutlamktung üng ami taih vaia ami cehpüi.<verse eid="MAT 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh ami taih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mk 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Lk 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Jn 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32"/>Acukba ami lawpüi üng, lama Kurenih khawa ka Sihmon hmuh u lü, yekape naw Jesuha kutlamktung asihlinga ami kawhsak u. <verse eid="MAT 27:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33"/>Kolkotha (Acun cun lukawi hnün tinaka kyaki) ami tia hnün pha lawki he. <verse eid="MAT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Sal 69:21</ref></char></note>Seitui kha am ami kcaw capyitui awk hlüsak u se, mdep lü am aw hlü.<verse eid="MAT 27:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:18">Sal 22:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kutlamktung üng taih u lü cung kphawng<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:35: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Cung kphawng” ti hin u naw i yah khai tia ami ksingnak vaia ami pawh ni.</char></note> u lü a suisake ami jah ng’yatei u. <verse eid="MAT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36"/>Acunkäna acuia ngaw u lü tengeikie. <verse eid="MAT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37"/>Hnengnaka kca, “Hin hin Jesuh, Judahea Sangpuxang,” ti lü yuk u lü a lu khana ami taih u. <verse eid="MAT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38"/>Acunüng mpyukei nghngih, mat a khet da, mat a kcawng da kutlamktung üng ami jah taih hnga.<verse eid="MAT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:39: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:7">Sal 22:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:25">109:25</ref> </char>
    </note>Acuna lam üng cet hükie naküt naw pi ami lu kting lü, <verse eid="MAT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:61">Mt 26:61</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:19">Jn 2:19</ref></char></note>“Nang naw temple kpye lü amhnüp kthum üng na sa be hlüki, Pamhnama Capa na kya üng ngküikyaneia; kutlamktung üngka naw kyum lawa,” ti lü Jesuh yaiheikie.<verse eid="MAT 27:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41"/>Acukba bäa ktaiyü ngvaie, thumksinge ja axü ngvaie naw pi yaihei u lü, <verse eid="MAT 27:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42"/>“Hin naw akce he ta jah küikyanki, amäta am ngküikyanei khawh ve. Isarelea Sangpuxanga am ni mä? Kutlamktung üngka naw a kyum law üng, kami jumei khaie ni. <verse eid="MAT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:8">Sal 22:8</ref> </char></note>Pamhnam jumeiki ni, “Kei cun Pamhnama na ca ni” a ti. Daw ve! Pamhnam naw küikyan law hlü khü mi teng vai u” ti lü yaiheikie.<verse eid="MAT 27:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44"/>Kutlamktung üng ami jah taih yüma mpyukei xawi naw pi acukba bäa ani yaihei hnga.<verse eid="MAT 27:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh a thiha mawng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mk 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Lk 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Jn 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45"/>Mhnüp ngsung üngkhyüh cutei lü mkeng naji kthum cäpa khawmdek avan cun nghmüp nghmawei päihki. <verse eid="MAT 27:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:1">Sal 22:1</ref></char></note>Naji kthum bang üng, Jesuh angsanga, <char style="wj">“Eli, Eli, lemaa sabathani?”</char> ti lü, ngpyangki. Acun cun, <char style="wj">“Ka Pamhnam, Ka Pamhnam; ise na na hawihinki ni?”</char> tinaka kyaki.<verse eid="MAT 27:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47"/>Acun üng ngdüiki khyang avang naw ami ngjak üng, “Hina khyang naw Elijah khü ve,” ami ti. <verse eid="MAT 27:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Sal 69:21</ref></char></note>Acun üngka mat naw angsenga dawng lü spawng<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:48: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“spawng” ti hin tui üng mi kphüm se tui ak’uma a umnak theia pawh ni.</char></note> lo lü capyit kthui am kphümki naw cungmdawng üng a tak. Jesuha mpyawng üng a awk vaia a jeng säng pet.<verse eid="MAT 27:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49"/>Avang naw, “Asäng ve cang se! Yung khaia Elijah law hlü khe, mi teng vai u,” ami ti.<verse eid="MAT 27:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50"/>Jesuh angsanga ngpyang betü ja a sak päihki.<verse eid="MAT 27:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:51: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Ex 26:31-33</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acunüng, Templea veki jihnu akhan üngka naw a le cäpa tekinki. Ngkhyü ngsün lü lungnue pi ngbokie. <verse eid="MAT 27:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52"/>Lungdüa ng’utnake nghmawng law u se, Pamhnama khyang ngcime thikie pi tho bekie. <verse eid="MAT 27:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53"/>Jesuh a thawh be käna ng’utnake jah hawih hüt u lü mlüh ngcingcaih Jerusalem k’uma lut vai u se khyang khawkän naw jah hmuhkie.<verse eid="MAT 27:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54"/>Acunüng yekap ngvai ja Jesuh mtätkie naw mkhyüa ngsün ja thawnghlawki naküt ami jah hmuh üng, “Ani hin, Pamhnama Capa kcang ni,” ti lü kyükyawkie.<verse eid="MAT 27:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:55,56: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 8:2">Lk 8:2</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:3">3</ref></char>
    </note>Kalilea a ve üng, Jesuha hnu läk lü ei awk tumbeiki nghnumie naw pi khawsang üngkhyüh jah teng hngakie. <verse eid="MAT 27:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56"/>Acun he üngka Marih Makdalin, Marih Jakuk ja Josepa ani nu, acun ja Zebedea khyu xawia kyaki he.<verse eid="MAT 27:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh k'utki he</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mk 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Lk 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Jn 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57"/>Khaw amü law üng, Arimahte mlüha ka bawimang lü Jesuha hnukläk hngaki Josep pha lawki. <verse eid="MAT 27:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58"/>Pilata veia cit lü Jesuha yawk cun a va tä. Pilat naw Jesuha yawk Josep üng ami pet vaia a jah mtheh. <verse eid="MAT 27:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59"/>Acunüng Josep naw yawk cun la lü jih kthai am hlawpki naw, <verse eid="MAT 27:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60"/>amäta ng’utnak vaia lung a pyangei üng k’ut lü Lungdü mkawt cun lungnu am khai hüt lü a ceh tak. <verse eid="MAT 27:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61"/>Acuia Marih Makdalin ja Marih kce mat cun lungdü da mang lü ngawki xawi.<verse eid="MAT 27:61"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lungdü yekape naw mtätkie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62"/>Angawi, Sabbath mhnüp üng, ktaiyü ngvaie ja Pharise he Pilata veia ngcun lawki he. <verse eid="MAT 27:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:63: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:21">Mt 16:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:23">17:23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:19">20:19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mk 8:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:31">9:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:33">10:33</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Lk 9:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-33">18:31-33</ref></char></note>“Saja aw, jah mhleimhlaki naw a xün ham üng, ‘Amhnüp kthum üng ka tho be khai’ a ti kami sümki. <verse eid="MAT 27:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64"/>Axüisawe naw mthana law u lü a yawk mpyu law be u lü, ‘Jesuh thihnak üngka naw tho be ve’ ti lü, khyang he üng jah mtheh u se, ak’hnua hleihlaknak hin akmaa ka kthaka sehlen khai ni. Acunakyase, a ng’utnak mhnüp kthum mtäh vaia ngthu mkhyaha,” ami ti.<verse eid="MAT 27:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65"/>Pilat naw, “Mtät khaie jah khü lü nami khyaih khawha üp khaia va mtät ua,” a ti.<verse eid="MAT 27:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66"/>Acunüng mtät khaia yekape am cit u lü lung cun msingnak am msing u lü lungdü cun mtätkie.<verse eid="MAT 27:66"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28"/>
  <para style="s">Bawi Jesuh Tho beki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Mk 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Lk 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Jn 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1"/>Sabbath käna, amhnüp khyühnak ngawilam, khaw athaih law hlü hnüh üng, Marih Makdalin ja a püi Marih kce mat am, ng’utnak teng khaia cetki xawi. <verse eid="MAT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2"/>Pamhnama khankhawngsä mat khankhaw üngkhyüh kyum law se, ngkhyü aknuia ngsünki. K’utnak mkawta lungnu mkawt üngka ktawngin lü lunga khana ngawki. <verse eid="MAT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3"/>A hmai khawmlaiha mäih law lü a suisak pi khuia mäiha bawki. <verse eid="MAT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4"/>Mkawt mtäte naw khankhawngsä cun hmu u lü kyühei ngen u lü akthi kcea mäiha awmki he.<verse eid="MAT 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5"/>Khankhawngsä naw nghnumie üng, “Käh kyühei ua, kutlamktung üng ami taih Jesuh nami sui hüki ti ka ksingki. <verse eid="MAT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6"/>“Ani hia am ve; a pyena kba, tho be pängki ni. Hia law lü Bawipaa ngkawhnak teng law ua. <verse eid="MAT 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7"/>“Akjanga cit u lü, “Jesuh thihnak üngkhyüh tho be lü, nami ma Kalile khawa cet ve, acuia nami hmu khai ni ti” axüisaw he üng jah mtheh ua. Ka ning jah mtheh khawi cen süm be ua,” a ti.<verse eid="MAT 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8"/>Acunüng kyühnak ja aktäa jenak am, lungdü üngkhyüh cet lü axüisaw he üng jah mtheh khai hea dawngkie.<verse eid="MAT 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9"/>Ahunata Jesuh naw lama jah na khyum lü, <char style="wj">“Dimdeihnak am ve ua,”</char> ti se, law u lü, a khawe jah mhjut mtham u lü hjawkhahkie. <verse eid="MAT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Käh kyühei ua. Cet u lü ka benae Kalile khawa ami na ceh vaia jah va mtheh ua, acuia na hmu khaie ni,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lungdü Mtätea Ngthu Pyen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11"/>Nghnumie ami ceh k’um üng, yekap avang mlüh k’uma cet u lü thawnhlawki naküt cun ktaiyü ngvaie üng ami jah mtheh vai. <verse eid="MAT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12"/>Ktaiyü ngvaie naw axüe ngvai jah va nghmu u lü, yekape üng ngui khawkän jah pe u lü, <verse eid="MAT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13"/>“Mthana, kami ih k’um üng axüisaw he naw a yawk ami mpyuk law ni ti lü, nami jah mtheh vai. <verse eid="MAT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14"/>Acunüng Khaw Uk naw a ngjak taw üng, nangmia mkhye am ni ti a ksing vaia kami mcäi khaie ni,” ti lü ami pyen.<verse eid="MAT 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15"/>Yekape naw ngui cun la u lü ami jah mtheha mäiha ami pawh u. Acunakyase ahina ngthu cun tuh vei cäpa Judahea ksunga ngthang hüki.<verse eid="MAT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Axüisawea veia A Ngdangnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mk 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Lk 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Jn 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Ngs 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:32">Mt 26:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:28">Mk 14:28</ref></char>
    </note>Axüisawe xaleiate cun Kalile khawa cet lü Jesuh naw a jah mthehnak mcunga kaikie. <verse eid="MAT 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17"/>Jesuh ami hmuh üng hjawkhahkie. Cunüngpi avang cun ami mlung uplatki. <verse eid="MAT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18"/>Jesuh naw thäih law lü, <char style="wj">“Khawmdek ja khankhawa anaa naküt cun ka kut k’uma pet pänga kyaki.</char> <verse eid="MAT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:8">Ngs 1:8</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Acunakyase, cit u lü khyang naküt ka hnukläkea jah pyang u lü, Pa, Capa ja ngmüimkhya ngcima ngming üng baptican jah pe ua.</char> <verse eid="MAT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20"/><char style="wj">Ahmäi ka ning jah mthehe ami jah läklam vaia jah mthei ua. Khawmdeka düt vei cäpa nami hlawnga ka ve khai,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="MAT 28:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28"/>
</usx>
